<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Bible en mashi du Congo</book>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="is">EMYANZI Y’AKALEMBE YAYANDIKAGWA NA MUTAGATÎFU LUKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Bulya banji bacihânganyire okushûbûza emyanzi y’ebyarhuyishîre, <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>nk’oku rhwayimanyisibagwa na balya bayibonaga bônene kurhenga emurhondêro, bo bâli rhurhonzi na barhumisi b’ezo nderho, <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>nâni nie nahumbaga eyo myanzi yoshi n’obushiru kurhenga aha murhondêro gwâyo, nalonz’ikuyandikirayo bwinjinjà, yâga Teofili mukengwa, <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>ly’omanya bwinjà oku ebinwa wayigîrizi­bagwa binali by’okunali.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">I. Okuburhwa n’oburhò bwa Yowane Mubatiza na Yezu</para>
  <para style="s1">Malahika alêba okuburhwa kwa Yowane Mubatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Oku ngoma ya Herodi, mwâmi w’e Buyahudi, hàli mudâhwa muguma, ye wali Zakariya, w’ecihe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abadâhwa bâli bagabirwe omu mirhwe, na ngasi murhwe gwagwêrhe ecihe cago c’okukola omu ka-Nyamuzinda. Zakariya àli wa murhwe gw’Abiya. </char></note> c’Abiya, na mukâge ye wali Luzabeti, w’obûko bw’Aroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Bombi bâli bashinganyanya embere za Nyamuzinda, banakâg’ishimba kwinjà amarhegeko ga Nnâmahanga goshi na ngasi byoshi biyandisirwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Ci barhàjiraga mwâna, bulya Luzabeti yali ngumba, bombi erhi banakola bashosi. <verse eid="LUK 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Erhi Zakariya adwîrhe akola omu ka-Nyamuzinda oku cihe c’omurhwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cihe c’omurhwe: Ngasi murhwe gwakâg’ikola mugobe muguma.</char></note> gwâge, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>nk’oku abadâhwa banakomerera, acîshogwa okujà omu ka-Nyamuzinda n’okugend’igashâniza n’enshangi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ogwo mukolo gwàli gwa kulanga omuliro n’omugavu byàli embere z’ahatagatîfu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Nayo engabo y’abantu erhi edwîrhe yashenga embuga amango g’okugashâniza. <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Okubundi ayagânwa na malahika wa Nyakasane, erhi ayîmanzire oluhande lw’ekulyo kw’olutare lw’okugashâniza. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Zakariya erhi amubona afuduka, agwârhwa n’obwôba. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Ci olya malahika amubwîra, erhi: «Orhayôbohaga. Zakariya, bulya amahûne gâwe gayumvikîne: mukâwe Luzabeti âkuburhira omwâna-rhabana, wanayish’imuyîrika izîno lya Yowane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Ayish’ikulêrhera obusîme n’obushagaluke, na banji bayish’icîshinga oku kuburhwa kwâge. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Bulya ayish’ibà mukulu embere za Nyakasane; arhakanywa mamvu na ngasi cinyôbwa cijakwo engezo: ayunjula Mûka Mutagatîfu kurhenga omu nda ya nnina; <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>na banji omu bene-Israheli abagalula emwa Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâbo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Yênene amushokolera n’omurhima n’obuzibu bw’Eliya, agalulire abâna emirhima ya b’îshe, n’abagomi âbagalule omu bumanye bw’abashinganyanya, ârheganyize Nyakasane ishanja limâna». <verse eid="LUK 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Zakariya anacishuza Malahika, erhi: «cimanyîso cici namanyirakwo? Bulya nkola mushosi na mukânie mugikulu». <verse eid="LUK 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Malahika amushuza, erhi: «Nie Gabriyeli, oyimanga embere za Nyamuzinda. Narhumagwa okuyish’ikubwîra n’okukulerhera ogu mwanzi mwinjà. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Okolaga wâbà kaduma, oyâbirwe n’okuderha kuhika olusiku okwo kwâbà, bulya orhayêmîre akanwa kâni n’obwo kayish’ibà omu mango gâko». <verse eid="LUK 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Abantu erhi badwîrhe balindira Zakariya embuga, banasomîrwe n’oku alegerîre omu ka-Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Erhi ahuluka, arhacihashag’ibadesa, bamanya oku ayagânirwe omu ka-Nyamuzinda. Naye akabakema, anayôrha kaduma. <verse eid="LUK 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Erhi ensiku z’okugashâniza z’ecihe câge zihwa, ashubira emwâge. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Erhi kugera nsiku, mukâge Luzabeti ayalala izîmi, acîfulika myêzi isharhu, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>«Ntyo kwo Nyakasane anjirire omu nsiku al’intengeza ecindêrhera enshonyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emwa Abayahudi, obugumba bwakag’ilolwa nka nshonyi na ciru nka buhane bwa Nnâmahanga.</char></note> omu bantu!»<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mariya abwîrwa emyanzi oku abà nnina w’Omuyôkozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Omu mwêzi gwa ndarhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mwêzi gwa ndarhu kurhenga okuyâlalwa kwa Yowane Mubatiza.</char></note>, malahika Gabriyeli arhumwa na Nnâmahanga omu cishagala ciguma c’e Galileya, ciderhwa Nazareti, <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>emwa omubikira wali oshebirwe n’omulume, izîno lyâge ye Yozefu, w’omu mulala gwa Daudi; n’oyo mubikira izîno lyâge ye Mariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Erhi ahika omu mwâge, amubwîra, erhi: «Nkuhîre omusingo, we oyunjwîre inêma, Nyakasane ali haguma nâwe»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu bakazi we mugishe (Lolà omulongo gwa 42).</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Erhi ayumva ntyo, afuduka, acîdôsa gwo musingo muci ogwo. <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Malahika anacimubwîra, erhi: «Orhayôbohaga, Mariya, bulya orhonyire emwa Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Wâyalala enda, wâburha omwâna-rhabana, wanayish’imuyîrika izîno lya Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Ayish’ibà mukulu, anayish’iderhwa Mugala w’Ow’enyanya; ayish’ihâbwa na Nyakasane Nyamuzinda entebe y’obwâmi bw’îshe Daudi; <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>âyîma omu nyumpa ya Yakôbo emyâka n’emyâka, n’obwâmi bwâge burhakayûrha». <verse eid="LUK 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Mariya anacibwîra malahika, erhi: «Kurhi okwo kwankabà ntanayishi mulume?» <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Malahika amushuza, erhi: «Mûka Mutagatîfu akuyandagalira, n’obuzibu bw’Ow’enyanya bwakubwîka ecîhôho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okuyâlalwa kwa Mwâmi Yezu guli mukolo gwa Nnâmahanga. Ecîhôho c’Ow’enyanya, kuli kuderha oku Bikira Mariya âyunjula obuzibu bwa Nyamuzinda, n’oku izîmi lyâge lyâbà mukolo gwa Nyamubâho yênene.</char></note>. Co carhuma omwâna wâburha âbà Mutagatîfu anaderhwe Mugala wa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Mwene winyu Luzabeti naye ali nda y’omwâna-rhabana muli bula bugikulu bwâge; guno mwêzi gwo mwêzi gwa ndarhu gw’owakâg’iderhwa ngumba. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Bulya ntâco cirhankahashikana emwa Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Mariya anaciderha, erhi: «Nie mwambalikazi wa Nyakasane; mbone nka okwo odesire!» Malahika anacimuleka.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikira Mariya aj’irhangula Luzabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Muli ezo nsiku, Mariya ayimuka, akanya, aj’ebwa bishagala by’omu ntondo, omu murhundu gwa Yûda. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Ajà omu mwa Zakariya, alamusa Luzabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Luzabeti erhi ayumva omusingo gwa Mariya, omwâna ashabire omu nda yâge; Luzabeti ayunjula Mûka Mutagatîfu. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Anaciyâkûza n’izù linene, aderha, erhi: «Oli mugishe omu bakazi, n’omwâna w’enda yâwe naye mugishe! <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>“Iragi lici nabwîne ene nnina wa Nnâhamwîrhu ajà aha mwâni?” <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>“Bulya ene izù ly’omusingo gwâwe linampika omu marhwiri, omwâna anshabira omu nda n’omwîshingo”. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>“Iragi lyâwe we wayêmîre oku ebi wabwîragwa na Nyakasane byâbà!”»<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bikira Mariya akuza Nyakasane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Mariya naye anaciderha, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">Omurhima gwâni gukuzize Nyakasane,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>n’omûka gwâni gucishinzire bwenêne muli Nnâmahanga, Muyôkozi wâni,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>bulya alolêrize obunyi bwa mwambali-kazi wâge. Nêci kurhenga ene amashanja goshi ganderha muny’iragi,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>bulya Ogala-byoshi anjirire ebirhangâzo, Izîno lyâge liri litagatîfu,<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>n’obwonjo bwâge buyorha bulumîre ensiku zoshi oku bantu bamurhînya.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Alambwîre emisî y’okuboko kwâge, ashandazamwo abacîbonyi n’enkengêro zâbo mbî.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Akûzire ngasi bacîbonyi oku ntebe zâbo, ahirakwo abîrhôhye.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Ayunjuza abakenyi birugu, n’abagale abalibirhakwo maboko mûmu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Ashîbirira omurhumisi wâge Israheli, obwonjo bwâge burhuma,<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>nka kulya alaganyagya ababusi bîrhu, Ibrahimu n’omulala gwâge ensiku n’amango!<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Mariya abêra bo na Luzabeti nka myêzi isharhu, agal’ishubira emwâge.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuburhwa n’okukembûlwa kwa Yowane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Erhi ensiku zâge z’okuburha ziyunjula, Luzabeti ahiraho mugala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Abalungu na bene wâbo bayumva oku Nyakasane omufire bwonjo, banacîshinga bo naye. <verse eid="LUK 1:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Erhi kugera nsiku munâni, bayisha bal’ikembûla omwâna, balonz’imuyîrika izîno ly’îshe Zakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Ci nnina anacilahira, erhi: «Nanga, ayîrikwe erya Yowane». <verse eid="LUK 1:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Bamubwîra, mpu: «Ci ntâye omu Bûko bwinyu ojira ery’izîno», <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Banacikema îshe mpu aderhe izîno lihi alonzize bamuyirike. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Naye anacihûna ehipaho, ayandika, erhi: «Yowane ly’izîno lyâge». Boshi banacirhangâla. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Ho na halya, akanwa kâge kayiguka n’olulimi lwâge lwashwêkûka, arhondêra aderha n’okukuza Nnâmahanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Abâlungwè bâbo boshi bayôboha, n’ogo mwanzi gwalumîra omurhundu goshi gw’e Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Ngasi bayumvagya ogo mwanzi boshi bagubika emurhima, mpu: «Oyu mwâna âbà mwâna muci?» Bulya okuboko kwa Nyakasane kwàli haguma naye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 66 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwo kuderha oku Nyakasane akâg’imulanga.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zakariya avuga omunkwa analêba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Naye îshe Zakariya ayunjula Mûka Mutagatîfu, arhondêra okulêba, erhi:<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>«Ayâgirwe Nyakasane, Nyamuzinda w’Israheli, bulya ayishir’irhangula n’okulîkûza olubaga lwâge.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Arhumereza ihembe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 69 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ihembe, co cimanyîso c’obukulu n’obuzibu.</char></note> ly’obucire omu nyumpa y’omwambali Daudi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Nka kulya aderhaga omu kanwa k’abalêbi bâge batagatîfu ba mîra:<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>Lyo arhuciza oku babisha n’omu maboko g’abashombanyi bîrhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Ntyo afirîre balarha obwonjo, anakengêra endagâno yâge ntagatîfu,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>endahiro alahiriraga larha Abrahamu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>oku hano rhubà rhwamâlîkûzibwa omu maboko g’abashombanyi bîrhu,<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>rhwamukolera buzira bwôba omu butagatîfu n’omu bushinganyanya, embere zâge ensiku zoshi z’obuzîne bwîrhu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>Nâwe, we hyâna, wâderhwa mulêbi w’Ow’enyanya, bulya washokolera Nyakasane, orheganye enjira zâge;<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>ly’omanyîsa olubaga lwâge obuyôkoke, lyo lubabalirwa ebyâha byâlwo;<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>omu lukogo lw’omurhima gwa Nyamuzinda wîrhu lwarhulerhera Izûba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 78 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eryo Izûba lyarhenga enyanya, ye Masiha.</char></note> lyarhenga enyanya,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>oku kumolekera abâli omu mwizimya n’omu mpehema y’olufù, n’okuyêrekeza amagulu gîrhu omu njira y’omurhûla».<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowane Mubatiza omu irungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Omwâna akula, ayûshûka omu buzibu bw’omurhima, aj’ibêra omu irungu kuhika olusiku aciyêrekanaga omu Israheli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuburhwa kwa Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Sezari Ogusti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sezari Ogusti, mwâmi w’e Roma kurhenga omwâka gwa 30 embere z’okuburhwa kwa Kristu kuhika omwâka gwa 14 kurhenga okuburhwa kwa Kristu. Abantu b’igulu lyoshi, kwo kuderha abàli idako ly’obuhashe bw’e Roma.</char></note> anacirhegeka mpu abantu b’igulu lyoshi baganjwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Ogwo gwo muganjo murhanzi gwajiragwa na Kwiriniyusi erhi ali murhegesi w’e Sîriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Banacigenda boshi okuyandikwa ngasi muntu omu cishagala câbo. <verse eid="LUK 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Yozefu naye arhenga e Galileya omu cishagala c’e Nazareti, ayinamukira e Yudeya omu murhundu gwa Daudi, guderhwa Betelehemu, ku­lya kubà àli muntu w’omu nyumpa n’omu bûko bwa Daudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Ajaga eyo munda mpu ayandikwe bo na mukâge Mariya, wali izîmi. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Oku bakola bali eyo munda, ensiku zâge z’okuburha zahika. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Anaciburha omwâna-rhabana lubere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Barhadesiri oku alondirwe, bulya omwâna cûsha anaderhwa nfula erhi lubere. </char></note> lwâge, amubwîka n’orhushangi, anamugwîshiza omu ciranga, bulya barhabonaga cirâlo omu nyumpa y’ebigolo. <verse eid="LUK 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Omu kabadu mwâli abangere badwîrhe balâlîra amasò gâbo budufu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Malahika wa Nyakasane anacibayagâna, n’irenge lya Nyakasane lyabalangashanira hoshi hoshi: barhungwa n’obwôba. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Malahika anacibabwîra, erhi: «Murhayôbohe, bulya mmudwîrhîre omwanzi mwinjà gw’obushagaluke bunene bwayish’ibà oku lubaga lwoshi: <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>ene, omu cishagala ca Daudi, Omuyôkozi ammuburhîrwe, ye Kristu Nyakasane. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Ecimanyîso mwamumanyirakwo c’eci: mwâbugâna akabonjo kabwisirwe orhushangi kanagwishizîbwe omu ciranga». <verse eid="LUK 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Ho na halya, omwandu gw’engabo z’empingu gwayankana n’olya malahika, bakakuza Nyamuzinda, banaderha, mpu: <verse eid="LUK 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>«Irenge enyanya kuli Nnâmahanga, n’en’igulu omurhûla oku bantu balonza aminjà!» <verse eid="LUK 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Erhi bamalahika babarhengaho bashubira empingu, balya bangere bajanamwo bône na nnene, mpu: «Rhugende nîrhu e Betelehemu, rhulole bici byabîreyo, n'oku Nyakasane anal’irhumanyisa». <verse eid="LUK 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Banacigenda bulibirha, bashimâna Mariya bona Yozefu n’omwâna w’akabonjo agwishizîbwe omu ciranga. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Erhi bamubona, bagend’imanyîsa kalya kanwa babwîragwa kuli oyo mwâna. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Nabo ngasi babayumvagya barhangâla bwenêne n’ebi babwîragwa n’abangere. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Mariya yêhe abîkirira ebyo binwa, anakabirhimanya emurhima gwâge. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Abangere bagaluka, bajà bakuza n’okusîma Nnâmahanga oku ebi bayumvîrhe n’ebi babwîne byoshi, n’oku banabwîragwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu akembûlwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Erhi nsiku munâni zigera, go mango omwâna akembûlagwa, bamuyîrika izîno lya Yezu, nka kulya malahika anaderhaga embere ayâlalwe omu nda ya nnina.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ahânwa omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Erhi ensiku z’okushukûlwa kwâbo zihika, nka kulya irhegeko lya Mûsa linadesire, bamuhêka e Yeruzalemu mpu bamuhè Nyakasane, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>nka okuyandisirwe omu irhegeko lya Nyakasane: Ngasi mwâna-rhabana yêshi w’olubere ahânwe nterekêro ya Nyakasane, <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>bahâne n’enterekêro nk’oku bidesirwe omu irhegeko lya Nyakasane, mahali abiri ga ngûkù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yozefu na Bikira Mariya bâli bakenyi, n’eyo nterekêro yâbo yali ya bukenyi.</char></note> erhi banangoko babiri ba ngûkù. <verse eid="LUK 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Obwo erhi e Yeruzalemu eli omuntu, ye wali Simeoni. Oyo muntu ali mushinganyanya anarhînyaga Nyamuzinda. Akâg’ilinga cînamula w’Israheli, na Mûka Mutagatîfu erhi abà muli ye. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Mûka Mutagatîfu ali erhi amuyêresire oku arhashub’ifà arhanaj’ibonakwo Kristu wa Nyakasane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kristu wa Nyakasane, ye Masiha, owashîzirwe amavurha gw’obwâmi, lyo agalulira Nnâmahanga irenge lyâge</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Anaciyisha adwîrhe na Mûka Mutagatîfu, ajà omu ka-Nyamuzinda, n’erhi akabonjo Yezu kalêrhwa n’ababusi bâko mpu bakajirire nk’oku binayandisirwe omu irhegeko, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>amubagalira, akuza Nnâmahanga, erhi:<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Simeoni akuza Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>«Yâgirwa wankalekaga mwambali wâwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:29">nka kulya waderhaga wênene, acigendere n’omurhûla;<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>bulya amasù gâni galozire oku buyôkozi bwâwe,<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>warheganyizagya amashanja goshi,<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>bulangashane bw’okumolekera amashanja goshi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:32">n’irenge ly’olubaga lwâni lw’Israheli».<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulêbi bwa Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Obwo îshe na nnina erhi badwîrhe bazânwa n’ebyo byaderhagwa kuli ye. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Simeoni anacibagisha, abwîra nnina Mariya, erhi: «Omanye oku oyu mwâna ayishire mpu abè iherero n’iciriro lya banji omu Israheli, abè cishombanya; <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>nâwe wêne engôrho yayish’ikubera omurhima, lyo enkengêro za mirhima minji zimanyîkana».<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulêbi bwa Ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Hàli n’omulêbi-kazi, Ana, mwâli wa Fanuweli, w’omu bûko bw’Aseri. Ali akola mugikulu. Kurhenga obulamba bwâge, alamire n’ibà myâka nda, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>ayôrha mukana kuhika myâka makumi gali munâni n’ini; arhàrhengaga omu ka-Nyamuzinda, akakolera Nnâmahanga buca buyira omu kucîshalisa n’omu kushenga. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Muli ako kasanzi, naye ashoshôka, arhondêra akuza Nnâmahanga n’okubwîra ngasi boshi bakâg’ilinga obucunguzi bwa Yeruzalemu olwa oyo mwâna.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Erhi bayûs’iyûkiriza ebirhegesirwe n’irhegeko lya Nyakasane, bashub’igaluka e Galileya, omu cishagala câbo c’e Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Omwâna akula, ayûshûka, anayunjula bumanye, n’inêma lya Nyamuzinda lyabà muli ye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ekarhî k’abayigîriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Ngasi mwâka ababusi bâge bakâg’ijà e Yeruzalemu oku lusiku lukulu lwa Basâka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Erhi ayunjuza myâka ikumi n’ibiri, bayirheremera nka oku banali bakomîre oku lusiku lukulu. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Erhi olusiku lukulu luhwa, bashubira eka, yêhe omwâna Yezu asigala e Yeruzalemu n’ababusi bâge barhamanyiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Obwo bacîkebwa mpu ali omu katundo k’abandi, bagenda lugendo lwa lusiku bamulongeza omu bene wâbo n’omu bâbo. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Erhi bamubula, banacigaluka e Yeruzalemu, baj’imulongezayo. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Erhi kugera nsiku isharhu, bamushanga omu ka-Nyamuzinda abwârhîre ekarhî k’abayigîriza, adwîrhe abayumvirhiza anabadôsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Ngasi bamuyumvirhizagya, basômerwa n’obumanye n’amashuzo gâge. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Erhi bamubona, barhangâla. Nnina anacimubwîra, erhi: «Mwâna wâni, carhumire warhujira ntya? Lolà oku sho nâni rhwarhindibusire rhwajà rhwakulonza». <verse eid="LUK 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Naye abashuza, erhi: «Ci mwanongezagya? Ka murhàl’imumanyire oku kukwânîne nshimbe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuli kwinjà okuyumva ababusi, ciru liri irhegeko lya Nnâmahanga. Ci hali amango o­mwâna arhegesirwe okurhayumva ababusi, nka Nnâmahanga yêne akulonza. Nyamuzinda arhajisibwa kadali: akarhegeka, ntà wundi wankaciderha mpu atwa omu kanwa kâge. Kukwânîne ababusi bayumve okwo, lyo barhacihira enyanya lya Nnâmahanga omu kurhegeka abâna bâbo.</char></note> ebya Larha?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Ci bôhe barhayumvagya eco cinwa ababwîraga.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ashubira e Nazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Anacibunguluka bo na bo, ajà e Nazareti, akabayumva. Nnina abîkirira ebyo binwa byoshi cmurhima gwâge. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Naye Yezu akula omu bumanye, omu bushûke n’omu nshôkano embere za Nyamuzinda n’embere z’abantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="ms1">II. Amarheganyo g’enyigîrizo za Yezu</para>
  <para style="s1">Enyigîrizo za Yowane Mubatiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk 1, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Erhi Tiberi Sezari ashinga myâka ikumi n’irhanu oku ntebe y’obwâmi, Ponsiyo Bilato erhi ali murhegesi w’Obuyahudi, Herodi erhi ali murhambo w’e Galileya, Filipo mwene wâbo erhi ali murhambo w’Ituriya n’e Trakoniti, naye Lusaniya erhi ali murhambo w’Abilena; <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Ana na Kayifa erhi bo badâhwa bakulu: Yowane mwene Zakariya ayumva oluderho lwa Nyamuzinda omu iru­ngu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu mwâka gwa 28 erhi 29.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Anacirhondêra ageragera omu cihugo ca Yordani, ajà ahanûla obubati­zo bw’okucîyunjuza, lyo bababalirwa ebyâha, <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>nka kulya biyandisirwe omu citabu c’ebinwa by’omulêbi Izaya: <char style="qt">«Izù ly’odwîrhe ayakûliza omu irungu</char>: <char style="qt">Rheganyagi enjira ya Nyakasane, yumanyagi bwinjà ah’agera</char>. <verse eid="LUK 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/><char style="qt">Ngasi lubanda lyunjuzibwe, na ngasi ntondo erhi hirhondo bigalagazibwe</char>. <char style="qt">Ngasi hakubire hakubulwe, na ngasi njira za rhubanda-rhubanda zibè njira nnongedu</char>. <verse eid="LUK 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/><char style="qt">Na ngasi muntu ayish’ibona obuyôkozi bwa Nnâmahanga</char>.»<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Anacikabwîra orhutu rhw’abantu bal’iyishire mpu ababatiza, erhi: «Mwe iburha lya cibugusha, “ndi lêro wammuyeresire enjira y’okuyâka obukunizi bwayisha?” <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>“Lêro mushabukekwo amalehe gakwânîne obucîyunjuze, murhanacîbwîraga mwene na mwene, mpu”: “Kali larha ye Abrahamu!” “Bulya mmubwîzire oku Nyamuzinda anahindula aga mabuye okubà bâna b’Abrahamu”. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>“Ciru embasha ekola eri aha cisiki c’emirhi”: “kuziga ngasi murhi gurhayanyirikwo malehe minjà gwatûbwa gunakwêbwe omu muliro”». <verse eid="LUK 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Eyo ngabo yakamudôsa, mpu «Kurhi rhwâjiraga obwo?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Naye akabashuza ntya: «Ngasi ogwêrhe bishûli bibiri abigabâne n’orhagwêrhi, na ngasi ogwêrhe ebiryo naye kwo anajirage ntyo». <verse eid="LUK 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Abavurhîsa nabo bayisha mpu ababatize, banamubwîra, mpu: «Muyigîriza, kurhi rhujirage?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Abashuza, erhi: «Murhakâg’ihûna kulusha ebi mwarhumagwa». <verse eid="LUK 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Abasirika nabo bamudôsa, mpu: «Nîrhu kurhi rhwajira?» Ababwîra, erhi: «Murhakâg’ilibuza ndi; murhakâg’ilega ndi busha, munasîme oluhembo lwinyu». <verse eid="LUK 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Obwo olubaga lwoshi lwacîkebwa n’okucîdôsa emurhima mpu nkaba Yowane ye Kristu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yowane anacibashuza, ababwîra, erhi: «Nie ono, ndwîrhe nammubatiza n’amîshi, ci hayishire omukulu kundusha, ntanakwânîni okumushwêkûlira orhugozi rhw’e­nkwêrho zâge; ye wâmmubatize muli Mûka Mutagatîfu n’omu Muliro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obubatizo Yowane akâg’ihâna lirhali isakramenta. Bwàli bubatizo bwa kucîyunjuza ebyâha. Bucîyunjuze bwimâna bwakag’irhenza ebyâha. Obubatizo bwa Yowane bwàli marheganyo g’lsakramenta ly’Obubatizo bwa Mwâmi Yezu, bwo bubatizo bw’okuli burhurhengeza ecâha c’ecisisi haguma n’ebindi byâha byoshi. Obwo bubatizo burhenza ebyâha n’obuzibu bwa Mûka Mutagatîfu. Kwo burhushuka n’okurhucêsa nka kulya omuliro gucêsa n’okuyôca ngasi izinga. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Omu kuboko kwâge afumbasire olwîbo lw’okuyerûla, mpu ayerûlemwo ecibuga câge analunde amahemba gâge omu nguli; n’omulolo gôhe agudûlike omu cibeye c’omuliro gurhazima». <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Bindi binji akazir’ikabahanûla, akabayigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowane omu mpamikwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:3-12">Mat 14, 3-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17-29">Mrk 6, 17-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Ci erhi acikalihira mwâmi Herodi erhi Herodiyada, mukà mwene wâbo orhuma, n’oku mabî goshi ajiraga, <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>ayûshûla obundi bubî oku gandi goshi: anaciheba Yowane omu mpamikwa.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abatizibwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrk 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Erhi olubaga lwoshi lubà lwamabatizibwa, n’erhi Yezu naye ayûs’ibatizibwa, agwîra okushenga, amalunga gayiguka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>na Mûka Mutagatîfu amuyandagalira omu nshusho y’engûkù. Izù lyanacirhenga emalunga, erhi: «We Mugala wâni murhonyi, we nzigira bwenêne».<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omulala gwa Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1, 1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Erhi Yezu arhondêra okuyigîriza àli myâka nka makumi asharhu ali muburhe, banakâg’imanya mpu abà mwene-Yozefu, mwene-Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>mwene­ Matati, mwene-Levi, mwene-Melki, mwene-Yanayi, mwene-Yozefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>mwene-Matatiyasi, mwene-Amosi, mwene-Nahumu, mwene-Hesili, mwene-Nagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>mwene-Mahati, mwene-Matatiyasi, mwene-Semeyini, mwene-Yozeshi, mwene-Yoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>mwene-Yohanani mwene-Reza, inwene-Zorobabeli, mwene­-Salatiyeli, mwene-Neri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>mwene-Melki, mwene-Adi, mwene-Kozami, mwene-Elimadamu, mwene-Eri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>mwene-Yezu, mwene-Eliyezari, mwene-Yori­mu, mwene-Matati, mwene-Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>mwene-Simoni, mwene-Yûda, mwene­ Yozefu, mwene-Yônamu, mwene-Eliyakimi, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>mwene-Meleya, mwene-Mena, mwene-Matata, mwene-Natani, mwene-Daudi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>mwene-Yese, mwene-Obè­di, mwene-Bwozi, mwene-Sala, mwene-Nâsoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>mwene-Aminadabu, mwene­ Adimini, mwene-Aramu, mwene-Hesroni, mwene-Faresi, mwene-Yûda, - <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>mwene-Yakôbo, mwene-Izaki, mwene-Abrahamu, mwene-Tera, mwene­ Nakori, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>mwene-Seruki, mwene-Ragu, mwene-Faleki, mwene-Eberi, mwene-Sala, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>mwene-Kayinani, mwene-Arifakisadi, mwene-Semu, mwene-Nûhu, mwene-Lameki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>mwene-Matuzala, mwene-Henoki, mwene-Yaredi, mwene­ Maleleyeli, mwene-Kayinani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>mwene-Henosi, mwene-Seti, mwene-Adamu, mwene-Nyamuzinda.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Kristu ahima amashumi ga shetani omu irungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mrk 1, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yezu ayunjula Mûka Mutagatîfu, arhenga e Yordani, ahêkwa na Mûka omu irungu, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>ajiramwo nsiku makumi anni ashumikwa na shetani. Ezo nsiku arhakozagya kalyo ekanwa, n’erhi ziyunjula, ashalika. <verse eid="LUK 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Shetani anacimubwîra, erhi: «Akabà oli Mwene-Nyamuzinda, bwîra eri ibuye lihinduke mugati». <verse eid="LUK 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Naye Yezu amushuza, erhi: «Kuyandisirwe, mpu: Arhali mugati gône gujira omuntu, ci ajirwa na ngasi luderho lurhenga ekanwa ka Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="LUK 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Shetani anacimurheremana, amuyêreka caligumiza amâmi goshi g’en’igulu, <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Shetani, erhi: «Nakuhà obwo buhashe bwoshi n’irenge ly’ago mârni goshi, bulya nabihîrwe, nâni nambihe ngasi yêshi nnonzize. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Okamfukamira, ntà kundi, byoshi byanabà byâwe». <verse eid="LUK 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yezu anacimushuza, erhi: «Kuyandisirwe, mpu: <char style="qt">Wakaz’iharâmya Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâwe, onakaz’imukolera yênene»</char>. <verse eid="LUK 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Okubundi anacimuhêka e Yeruzalemu, amuyimanza oku kanshonsho k’aka-Nyamuzinda, amubwîra, erhi: «Akabà oli Mwene-Nyamuzinda, hamira ahanshi, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>bulya kuyandisirwe, mpu: <char style="qt">Akurhegekera bamalahika bâge bakulange</char>, <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>na mpu: <char style="qt">Bakuhêke omu maboko gâbo, olek’isârhala oku ibuye»</char>. <verse eid="LUK 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yezu anacimushuza, erhi: «Kuyandisirwe, mpu: <char style="qt">“Irhondo orhashumikaga Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâwe</char>”». <verse eid="LUK 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Erhi ayûsa ngasi nshumi, shetani arhang’imuleka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shetani arhamulekaga lwoshi, ci arhang’igenda, alinga amango ashub’igaluka. Ago mango, go mango g’amalumwa ga Mwâmi Yezu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22-23">Luk 22—23</ref></char>) ci Yezu ye wahimire Shetani (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 24">Luk 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2">Ebj 2</ref></char>) n’ebindi.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">III. Yezu ayigîriza e Galileya</para>
  <para style="s1">Omurhondêro gw’enyigîrizo za Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17:23">Mat 4, 12—17, 23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15:39">Mrk 1, 14—15, 39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>N’obuzibu bwa Mûka Mutabatifu, Yezu ashubira e Galileya, n’irenge lyâge lyayunjula omu cihugo coshi. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Akaz’iyigîriza omu masinagogi gâbo, n’abantu boshi bamukuza.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu e Nazareti n’e Kafarnaum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mrk 6, 1-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrk 1, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Anacijà e Nazareti, co cishagala alereragwamwo; ajà omu sinagogi omu lusiku lwa-Sabato, nka oku anayôrheraga, ayimanga mpu asome. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Bamushumbiriza ecitabu c’omulêbi Izaya. Erhi abungûla ecitabu, ayirukira ahayandisirwe ntyâla: <verse eid="LUK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/><char style="qt">Omûka gwa Nyakasane kuli nie, bulya anshîzire amavurha</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okushîgwa amavurha kuli kujirwa mwâmi, kuli kucîshogwa na Nnâmahanga oku mukolo gwâge. Omwâka gw’obwonjo bwa Nyakasane, go mango ga Masiha.</char></note>, <char style="qt">antuma mpu ngend’iyigîriza abakenyi emyanzi y’akalembe</char>, <char style="qt">mbale omwanzi gw’o­buyôkozi, emw’abâli omu mpamikwa, n’emwa emihûrha ogw’okushub’ikabona, ngalulire abarhindibuzibwe omurhûla</char>, <verse eid="LUK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/><char style="qt">nnandalike omwâka gw’obwonjo bwa Nyakasane</char>. <verse eid="LUK 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Anacibunga ecitabu, acishubiza omurhumisi, abwârhala. Abâli omu sinagogi boshi bamuyêrekeza amasù. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Okubundi anacirhondêra ababwîra, erhi: «Ene, olu lwandiko lwamayunjula omu marhwiri ginyu». <verse eid="LUK 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Boshi bali bamubêrîre càli-ho, banacirhangâla n’enderho nyinjà zarhengaga omu kanwa kâge, mpu: «K’arhali mwene-Yozefu oyu?» <verse eid="LUK 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Ntahabiri oku mwambwîra ogu mugani, mpu: “We mufumu, ocîbuke wêne!” “Birya byoshi barhubwîraga mpu byabîre e Kafarnaumu, obijirage n’eno mwinyu”». <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Ashub’ibabwîra, erhi: «Okuli, mmubwîre, ntà mulêbi oyankiriwa bwinjà omu cihugo câbo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Nêci, mmubwîzire oku binali: hàli bakana banji omu Israheli amango g’Eliya, erhi enkuba ehangama myâka isharhu na myêzi ndarhu n’erhi ecizombo cizûka omu cihugo coshi, <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>ntà muguma mulibo Eliya arhumirwe ­emwâge, ci emwa omukazi mukana w’e Sarepta, omu cihugo c’e Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Na bashomyo banji bâli omu Israheli amango g’omulêbi Elizeyo; ntâye ciru n’o­muguma wafumizwe muli bo, ci Nahamani yêne w’e Sîriya». <verse eid="LUK 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Erhi bayumva ntyo, abàli omu sinagogi boshi bakunira; <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>banaciyimuka, bamuhulusa omu lugo, bamuhêka oku cigonzi c’entondo ecishagala câbo càli ciyûbasirwekwo mpu bamulohe oku ncangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oku «ncangu», kandi rhwanaderha: «oku mmanga» </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Ci larha wâni abagera ekarhî, acîgendera.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Anaciyandagalira e Kafarnaumu, cishagala c’e Galileya; akabayigîriza o­lwa-Sabato. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Basômerwa n’enyigîrizo zâge, bulya akâg’iderha nka ogwêrhe obuhashe. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Mw’eyo sinagogi mwâli omuntu ogwêrhwe n’omuzimu mubî. Ana­ciyakûza n’izù linene, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>«Cici rhufânwa, ewani Yezu w’e Nazareti? Kali wayishire mpu orhuheze? Nkumanyire we ndi: Mutagatîfu wa Nnâmahanga». <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yezu anacimukankamira, erhi: «Hulika, onarhengemw’oyu muntu». Olya shetani anacimurhimba ahanshi embere z’abantu boshi, amurhengamwo buzira kumubabaza. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Boshi bageramwo omusisi, bakâbwîrana bône na nnene, mpu: «Ema! Kwo kurhi oku? Ci adwîrhe arhegeka abashetani n’obuzibu n’obuhashe, banadwîrhe bahuluka!» <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Irenge lyâge lyanacilumira hoshi hoshi omu cihugo.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya nnazâla wa Petro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Mat 8, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-31">Mrk 1, 29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Erhi ahuluka omu sinagogi, ajà aha mwa Simoni. Nnazâla wa Simoni erhi ashushîrwe bwenêne; banacimusengerera. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Amujaho, arhegeka lirya ishushira, lyamulîka. Anacizûka ho na halya, arhondêra abakolera.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya endwâla za ngasi lubero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:15-17">Mat 8, 15-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:32-34">Mrk 1, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Erhi izûba lizika, ngasi boshi bali bagwêrhe abalwala ba ngasi buzamba, bamulerherabo. Naye akahirakwo ngasi muguma okuboko, abafumya. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Abà­shetani bakarhengamwo banji, bakâyâma banaderha, mpu: «We Mwene-Nyamuzinda!» Ci akabakankamira n’okubahanza okuderha, bulya bâli bamanyire oku ye Kristu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arhenga bufundafunda e Kafarnaumu ajaj’ageragera omu Yûda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mrk 1, 35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Erhi buca, alîkûla, acîjira aharhali bantu. Orhutu rhw’abantu rhwakamulonza, n’erhi rhumuhikaho, rhwamuhagalika mpu arharhulekaga. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Naye anacibashuza, erhi: «Kukwânîne nyigîrize emyanzi minjà y’Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda omu bindi bishagala, bulya kwo kwarhumaga ntumwa». <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Akayigîriza omu masinagogi g’e Yûda.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ahamagala abaganda bâni barhanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Lêro lusiku luguma erhi olubaga lumulundûkîre mpu luyumve oluderho lwa Nnâmahanga, erhi naye ayîmanzire eburhambi bw’enyanja y’e Jenezareti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Jenezareti», liri iderha lya nfarasè. Okuyegêra ecihebraniya n’ecigereki, rhwanaderha: «Genezareti». </char></note>, <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>anacibona mârho abiri masîke eburhambi bw’enyanja; abashâna erhi bayômosire, badwîrhe bashuka orhwêshe rhwâbo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Anacijamwo bwârho buguma, bwa Simoni; amubwîra mpu acîyêgûle hitya n’obwimango. Anacibwârhala, arhondêra ayigîriza olubaga omu bwârho. <verse eid="LUK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Erhi ayûs’iderha, abwîra Simoni, erhi: «Musûle amârho emuhengere, murhege orhwêshe rhwinyu». <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni amushuza, erhi: «Waliha, rhwalibusire obudufu bwoshi, rhurhanabwîne cici; ci oku kanwa kâwe, nkolaga narhega orhwêshe». <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Erhi babà bamâjira ntyo, bagwârha nfî nyinji bwenêne, ciru orhwêshe rhwâbo rhwalonz’irhulika. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Banacikema abâbo bali omu bundi bwârho, mpu bayish’ibagwâsa. Bayisha, bayunjuza amârho gombi, ciru hindi hitya galonz’ilohoma. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simoni-Petro, erhi abona okwo, acîrhimba aha magulu ga Yezu, erhi: «Ontengeho, Yâgirwa, bulya ndi muntu munya-byâha!» <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Bulya obwôba bwàli bumugwêrhe bo n’abàli boshi, erhi obwo budubi bw’enfî burhuma. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Yakôbo na Yowane, bene­ Zebedeyo, bakâg’igenda boshi na Simoni, nabo kwo n’okwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Andreya, mulumuna wa Petro àli muli bo, ci Luka arhamudesiri, bulya àli omu bwârho buguma bo na Petro.</char></note>. Yezu anacibwîra Simoni, erhi: «Orhayôbohaga: kurhenga ene bantu wakaz’iduba». <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Okubundi banacisîka amârho gâbo oku cikwî, baleka byoshi, bamushimba.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omushomyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk 1, 40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Erhi abà akola ali omu lugo luguma, hanaciyisha omuntu ohonyôsire lushomyo. Erhi abona Yezu, acîrhimba oku idaho, amusengera, erhi: «Yâgirwa, okalonza, wananfumya». <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Naye anacilambûla okuboko, amuhumakwo, anamubwîra, erhi: «Nnonzize, fumaga». Ho na halya olushomyo lw’olya muntu lwazimangana. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Anacimuhanza mpu arhabwîraga ndi, erhi: «Ogende, oj’icîyêrekana emwa omudâhwa, onaj’ihâna entûlo erhegesirwe na Mûsa, ebè cêrekane c’okufuma kwâwe». <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Irenge lyâge lyajà lyalumîra hoshi, na bantu mwandu bakamushubûkira mpu bamuyumve, anabafumye endwâla zâbo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Ci yêhe akacîyegûlira omu irungu, akashenga.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omuntu ohozire enjingo (Mat 9. 1-8; Mrk 2, 1-12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Kwanacibà lusiku luguma erhi adwîrhe ayigîriza. Hàli Abafarizeyi n’a­bayigîriza b’Amarhegeko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abayigîriza b’Amarhegeko, bo bashamuka b’ihano erhi bayandisi.</char></note> bahubukaga omu ngasi cishagala c’e Galileya n’e Yûda n’e Yeruzalemu, n’obuhashe bwa Nyakasane erhi bumulimwo mpu lyo afumya. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Hanaciyisha abantu babarhwîre omuntu ohozire enjingo oku ncingo; balonza oku bamuhisa omu nyumpa n’oku bamuhira embere zâge. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Erhi babula aha bamugereza erhi ngabo y’abantu erhuma, banacishona oku nyumpa, bamugereza aha burhungiri, aha karhî k’amatebura, bamuyandagaza n’encingo kuhika omu kâgarhî k’abantu embere za Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Erhi abona obwêmêre bwâbo, amubwîra, erhi: «We mulume, ebyâha byâwe byamârhenzibwa». <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Abafarizeyi n’abashamuka b’ihano barhondêra bakengêra omu murhima, mpu: «Ye ndi oyu walogorha ntya? Ka hali owankarhenza ebyâha arhanali Nnâmahanga yênene?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yezu abona enkengêro zâbo, abashuza, erhi: «Cirhumire mukengêra ntyo omu mirhima yinyu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>“Kuci kulembu kulusha, okuderha, erhi”: “ebyâha byâwe byamârhenzibwa”, “erhi okuderha, erhi”: “yimuka, olambagire?” <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>“Lêro lyo mumanya oku Mwene-omuntu agwêrhe obuhashe bw’okukûla ebyâha en’igulu”, “-anacibwîra nyakuhola enjingo, erhi”-: “Nkurhegesire oyimuke, oyanke encingo yâwe, oj’emwâwe”». <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Ho na halya, ayimuka embere z’abantu boshi, abarhula erya ncingo àli agwishirekwo, acîjira emwâge, aj’akuza Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Boshi barhangâla, bakuza Nnâmahanga; bageramwo omusisi, banarhondêra baderha, mpu: «Rhwabwîne ebirhangâzo ene».<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abamagala Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9">Mat 9, 9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-14">Mrk 2, 13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Enyuma ly’okwo, anacihuluka, abona omuvurhîsa, ye Levi, erhi atamîre e kagombe k’okuhôza, amubwîra, erhi: «Nshimba!» <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Anacileka byoshi, ayimuka, amushimba.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu alya haguma n’abanya-byâha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:10-12">Mat 9, 10-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:15-17">Mrk 2, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Levi amurheganyiza idinie omu mwâge; bavurhîsa mwandu n’abandi bantu nabo bâli oku cîbo bo nabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Abafarizeyi n’abashamuka bâbo b’ihano bagaya, banabwîra abaganda bâge, mpu: «Cirhuma mulira munanywera hagu­ma n’abavurhîsa n’abanya-byâha?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yezu anacibashuza, erhi: «Barhali bantu bagumagumà balonza omufumu, ci abalwâla. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ntayishaga nti nd’ilonza abêru-kwêru, ci abanya-byâha, lyo bacîyunjuza».<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bajà kadali oku kucishalisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk 2, 18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Nabo banacimubwîra, mpu: «Ci abaganda ba Yowane banacîshalise kanji kanji n’okushenga, n’ah’Abafarizeyi kwo n’okwo, ci wêhe abâwe balya bananywe!» <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yezu abashuza, erhi: «Ka mwankashalisa abîra b’omuhya-mulume n’omuhya-mulume aciri haguma nabo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>“Ensiku zacibayishira, amango banyagwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">go mango Mwâmi Yezu, ye muhya-mulume, afà.</char></note> omuhya-mulume, zo ensiku bâcîshalisemwo ezo”». <verse eid="LUK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Ashub’ibabwîra ogu mugani, erhi: «Ntâye obêra eciremwo c’omwambalo muhyâhya akacilemeka oku mwambalo mukulûkulù; n’owalemeka ntyo, erhi abezire gulya mwambalo muhyâhya, na cirya ciremwo c’omwambalo muhyâhya cirhankayumânana na gulya mukulûkulù. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>“Kandi ntâye ohongolera amamvu mahyâhya omu rhubindi rhukulûkulù”; “n’owahongoleramwo, galya mamvu mahyâhya ganabera orhubindi, amamvu gacîbulajikire, abule n’orhubindi”. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>“Ci amamvu mahyâhya gajà omu rhubindi rhuhyâhya”. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>“Na ntà muntu wanywîre oku mamvu makulûkulù<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5, 39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amamvu erhi idivayi likulûkulù n’omwambalo mukulûkulù, go marhegeko g’abamîra; nago amamvu erhi idivayi lihyâhya n’omwambalo muhyâhya, zo nyigîrizo mpyâhya zidwîrhwe na Abakomîre amamvu makulûkulù barhankanunirwa n’amahyâhya.</char></note> wankacilonza amahyâhya”. “Bulya anaderha, erhi”: “Amakulûkulù go manunu”».<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa zatwa emihuli y’engano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-18">Mat 12, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrk 2, 23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Erhi ayish’agera omu mashwa olwa-Sabato, abaganda bâge bakakonola emihuli y’engano, bajà bayinyira omu nfune banayibujegera. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Okubundi baguma omu Bafarizeyi bababwîra, mpu: «Cirhumire mujira okuhanzîbwe olusiku lwa Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yezu abashuza, erhi: «Ka murhasâg’isoma kurhi Daudi ajiraga erhi akola ali bufà n’ishali, bo n’abâli boshi? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Oku ajaga omu ka-Nyamuzinda, ayanka amantu g’enterekêro, alya, aha n’abâbo, n’obwo gàli gahanzîbwe okulîbwa n’abarhali badâhwa bônene?» <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Mwene-omuntu ye Nna-olwa-Sabato».<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omuntu ohozire okuboko (Mat 17., 9-14: Mrk 3, 1-6)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Olundi lwa Sabato, ajà omu sinagogi, arhondâra ayigîriza. Mwâli omuntu ohozire okuboko kulyo. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Abashamuka b’ihano n’Abafarizeyi bakàmuhengûza mpu babone erhi amufumya olwa-Sabato, lyo bamushobeka. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Ci yêhe erhi amanyire entimarhima zâbo. Anacibwîra olya muntu obozire okuboko, erhi: «Yimuka, oj’ekarhî». Anaciyimuka, ayimanga. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Okubundi Yezu ababwîra, erhi: «Nammudôsa: ka kuyêmêrîrwe okujira kwinjà olwa-Sabato ahâli h’okujira kubî, okuciza obugumaguma bw’omuntu ahâli h’okubuheza?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Anacibageza­ mwo amasù boshi, abwîra olya muntu, erhi: «Lambûla okuboko kwâwe». Akulambûla, n’okuboko kwâge kwafuma. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Bôhe banacigwârhwa n’omungo, baja kadali bône na nnene mpu kurhi bajira Yezu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa ikumi n’ibiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrk 3, 13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Mw’ezo nsiku, arheremera oku ntondo, aj’ishenga; alâla ashenga Nyamuzinda obudufu bwoshi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>N’erhi buca, ahamagala abaganda bâge, acîshoga ikumi na babiri muli bo, abahà izîno ly’entumwa: <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simoni, amuyîrika izîno lya Petro, n’omulumuna Andreya; Yakôbo na Yowane; Filipo na Bartolomeyo; <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mateyo na Toma; Yakôbo mwene-Alfeyo na Simoni oderhwa Sha-bushiru; <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yûda mwene-Yakôbo na Yûda w’e Keriyoti owamulenganyagya.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Engabo y’abantu yakulikira Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">Mat 4, 24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-12">Mrk 3, 7-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Anaciyandagala bo nabo, ayimanga omu cirêre c’entondo. Hàli ngabo nyinji y’abaganda bâge n’abantu mwandu b’e Yûda yoshi n’e Yeruzalemu, n’e­ntambi z’e Tiri n’e Sidoni, <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>bayishaga mpu bamuyumve, anabafumye endwâla zâbo; na ngasi boshi balibuzibagwa n’abashetani bafuma. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Olwo lubaga lwoshi lwakâg’ilonza okumuhumakwo, bulya obuzibu bwamurhengamwo bwakâg’ibafumya boshi.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyigîrizo ntanzi. Ab’iragi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mat 5, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Okubundi anacilikira abaganda bâge mw’amasù, aderha, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">«Iragi linyu mwe bakenyi, bulya obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buli bwinyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>Iragi linyu mwe mushalisire buno, bulya mwaciyigurha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Iragi linyu mwe mudwirbe mwalaka buno, bulya mwacisheka.<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>Iragi linyu abantu bakammushomba, bakammukaga, bakammujacira n’okushologorbwa n’izîno linyu mpu libî Mwene-omuntu orhumire.<verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Olwo lusiku musîme munacîshinge, bulya oluhembo lwinyu lwâbe lunene omu mpingu. Kwo bîshe bajiriraga abalêbi ntyo.»<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abahanya</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>«Ci muli bahanya mwe bagale, bulya mugwêrhe oluhembo!<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>Muli bahanya mwe muyigusire buno, bulya mwacishalika!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Muli bahanya mwe mudwîrhe mwasheka buno, bulya mwacilaka munabande endûlù!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>Buhanya bwinyu mukasîmwa n’abantu boshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abà igulu liderha bahanya, bo Mwâmi Yezu aderha b’iragi, n’ab’igulu liderha bany’iragi, bo Mwâmi Yezu aderha bahanya. Kuziga owalonza iragi ly’en’igulu, arhakacilangâlira iragi lya bambali ba Yezu; n’owalonza iragi ly’obukristu arhahîraga omurhima gwâge oku by’en’igulu</char></note>! Kwo bîshe bajiriraga abalêbi b’obunywesi ntyo.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzigira abashombanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:39-46">Mat 5, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>«Ci mwe mudwîrhe mwayumvirhiza mmubwîzire: “Muzigire abashombanyi, abammushomba mubajirire aminjà”; <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>“abammuhehêrera mubahè obwangà”, “abammushobeka mubasengerere”. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>“Omuntu akakurhimba oluhi omu irhama, onamuhindulir’erindi; n’owakunyaga ecishûli câwe, orhamuhagalikaga oku lubega”. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>“Ngasi okuhûnyire onamuhè, n’okunyazire ehi ogwêrhe, orhacihishubiranaga”. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>“Oku mulonza abandi bammujirire, ninyu ntyo kwo mubajirirage”. <verse eid="LUK 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Mukazigira abammuzigira, luhembo luci mukwânîne?” “Bulya ciru n’abanya-byâha bazigira ababazigira”. <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>“N’erhi mwankajirira kwinjà abammujirira aminjà, luhembo luci mukwânîne?” “Ciru n’abanya-byâha nabo bânajire ntyo”. <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>“N’erhi mwankahoza abamulangâlire oku bayish’immuholôla, luhembo luci mukwânîne?” “Ciru n’abanya-byâha banahoze abanya-byâha mpu lyo bayish’iholôlwa nk’oku bahozagya”. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>“Mwêhe muzigire abashombanyi binyu, mujire aminjà, munahoze buzira okulangâlira okuholôlwa, lyo oluhembo lwinyu luyish’ibà lunene, munayish’ibà bâna b’Oli-enyanya; bulya yêhe abà mwinjà oku bantu babî n’abarhakûla bwâsi”».<verse eid="LUK 6:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufà abandi obwonjo n’okubarhabâla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-2">Mat 7, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mat 4, 24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>«Mubè babwonjo nk’oku Sho abà wa bwonjo. <verse eid="LUK 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>Murhakâg’itwa oluli omu mwa bene, irhondo bankatwa oluli omu mwinyu; murhakâg’iyagîriza, ninyu murhakayagîrizibwa; mukababalira, ninyu mwâbabalirwe. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Mukâhâna, ninyu mwâhâbwe: Lugero nkana, lusindagîrwe, ludundaganyîbwe, luyunjwîre, bâmmuhirire omu nshoho. Bulya olugero mwagereremwo, lwo ninyu mwânagererwemwo».<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuntu arhaderha ecirhamuli omu murhima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15, 14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">10, 24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12, 33-35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:16-18">7, 16-18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:3-5">7, 3-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Ashub’ibabwira omugani, erhi: «K’omuhûrha gwankalangula omuhûrha enjira? K’erhankarhogera yombi omu nyenga? <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>“Owayiga arhalusha omuyigiîriza; ci omwigîrizibwa mwimâna abà nk’omwigîriza wâge”. <verse eid="LUK 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Cirhuma olola ehyâsi hiri omu isù ly’owinyu, orhanabona enduluma y’omurhi eri omu isù lyâwe?” <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>“Kurhi wankabwîra owinyu, erhi”: “Yâga, lemba nkudokôle ehyâsi hikuli omu isù, n’obwo orhabwîni enduluma y’omurhi ekulî omu isù?” “Eyi ncuku! orheng’irhenza enduluma y’omurhi ekulî omu isù, ly’obona oku wadokôla ehyâsi hiri omu isù ly’owinyu”. <verse eid="LUK 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Ntà murhi mwinjà guyânakwo amalehe mabî; na ntà murhi mubî guyânakwo amalehe minjà”. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>“Bulya ngasi murhi gumanyirwa oku irehe lyâgo; oku kashûgishûgi barhahumbakwo magâka, n’o­ku bulengo barhashongakwo mujoco”. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>“Omuntu nkana omu muhako mwinjà gw’omurhima gwâge arhenza aminjà; n’omuntu mubî omu muhako mubî gw’omurhima gwâge arhenza amabî”. “Bulya ebifukanîne emurhima, kanwa kâge kabiderha”».<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaganda b’okuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:21">Mat 7, 21</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>«Cirhuma mumbwîra: Yâgirwa, Yâgirwa, murhajira n’oku nderha? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Ngasi ojà emunda ndi, oyumva ebinwa byâni anabijire, nammuyêreka ndi ashusha. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Ashusha omuntu wayûbakaga enyumpa, abanda eciriba, ahumba bwenêne, ahika oku lwâla. Erhi amîshi gasîka, olwîshi lwacihonda kuli erya nyumpa, ci lurhahashag’iyidunda, bulya yali eyûbasirwe oku lwâla. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Naye oyumva anabule okujira, ashusha omuntu wayûbakaga enyumpa yâge oku idaho, buzira ciriba. Erhi olwîshi lucicihonda kuli yo, yacihongokera ho na ha­lya; lêro obuhanya bw’erya nyumpa bwacibêra nyandumà!»<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omurhumisi w’omukulu w’abasirika (Mat 8. 5-10, 13; Ywn 4, 46-54)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Erhi ayûs’ibwîra olubaga ebyo binwa, ajà omu Kafarnaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Obwo erhi murhambo muguma wa basirika igana omwambali agogomîrwe bwenêne ali obufa, erhi anali murhonyi w’omurhambo. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Erhi ayumva emyanzi ya Yezu, anacimurhumira abashamuka b’Abayahudi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">7, 3: Abo bashamuka barhali balya b’ihano ly’e Yeruzalemu. Bâli bagula b’emwa oyo murhambo w’abasirika.</char></note>, mpu bagend’imusengerera ayish’imufumiza omwambali. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Erhi bahika hali Yezu, bashenga banamubwîra, mpu: «Akwânîne ajirirwe ntyo; <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>bulya azigira obûko bwîrhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ali mupagani mwinjà, aka Korneliyo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 10-11">Ebj 10—11</ref></char>).</char></note>, ciru yêne warhuyûbakiraga isinagogi». <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Obwo Yezu anacilîkûla bona bo. Erhi ayêrekera ebwa nyumpa, olya mukulu w’abasirika arhuma abîra bâge, erhi: «Mâshi, Nyamwagirwa, orhacîrhamye, bulya ntakwânîni ojè omu mwâni. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Kwo kwarhumaga ncîyaga niene nti ntakaja emunda oli. Ci oderhe cinwa ciguma cônene, na mwambali wâni afuma. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Bulya nâni, ciru akabà kurhegekwa ntegekwa, njira nâni abasirika nkulire obwo. Nambwîre oyu, nti: genda, anagende. Nkabwîra owundi, nti: yisha, anayishe. Na nkabwîra mwambali wâni, nti: jira hirebe, anahijire». <verse eid="LUK 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Erhi Yezu ayumva okwo, asomerwa, ahindukira engabo yali emukulikîre, aderha, erhi: «Mmubwîre okuli, ciru omu Israheli ntasâg’ibo­ na obuyêmêre bungan’aha». <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>N’erhi abarhumagwa bashubira eka, bashimâna olya murhumisi wali bufà akola mutaraga.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afùla mugala w’omukana w’e Nayimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Okubundi anaciyanka enjira ajà omu cishagala ciderhwa Nayimi. Abaganda bâge n’engabo nyinji y’abantu bamukulikira. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Erhi akola ahika omu ihulukiro ly’olugo, abona babarhwîre omufù: àli mwâna-rhabana cûsha wa nnina, naye erhi na mukana; n’engabo erhali nyi y’abantu b’oku lugo erhi bamulusize. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Erhi Nyakasane amubona, amufa bwonjo, amubwîra, erhi: «Orhalakaga». <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Anaciyegera, ahuma oku nkundabaniha. Abàli babarhwîre bayimanga. Anaciderha, erhi: «We musole, nkurhegesire ozûke!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Olya nyakufà abwârhala, arhondêra aganîra. Yezu amuhà nnina. <verse eid="LUK 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Boshi bagwârhwa n’obwôba, banacikuza Nyamuzinda, mpu: «Omulêbi mukulu azûsire muli rhwe, na Nnâmahanga ayishir’irhandûla ishanja lyâge». <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Ogwo mwanzi gwanacilanda omu Buyahudi mwoshi n’omu cihugo coshi c’eburhambi.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">idôso lya Yowane Mubatiza n’obuhamîrizi bwa Yezu kuli ye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:1-15">Mat 11, 1-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Obwo abaganda ba Yowane bamushambalira eyo nyanzi yoshi. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Yowane ahamagala babiri omu baganda bâge, abarhuma emunda Yezu àli, erhi: «Ka we olya wâyishe, erhi wundi rhwalinga?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Abo bantu erhi bamuhikaho, bamubwîra. mpu: «Yowane Mubatiza arhurhumire emunda oli mpu: “Ka we olya wâyishe, erhi wundi rhwalinga?”» <verse eid="LUK 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Muli ako kasanzi, anacifumya bantu banji endwâla, obuzamba n’abashetani, anahurhûla mihûrha minji. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Okubu­ndi anacibashuza, ababwîra, erhi: «Mugend’ibwîra Yowane ebi mwabwîne n’ebi mwayumvîrhe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Ebimwabwîne n’ebi mwayumvîrhe», byo bisômerîne byàli bimanyîso byalêbagwa n’omulêbi Izaya mpu bimanyîse oku Masiha avishire.</char></note>: emihûrha edwîrhe yabona, abahozire amagulu badwîrhe bafuma, abashomyo badwîrhe bafuma, ebihuli bidwîrhe byayumva, abafu badwîrhe bafûka, abakenyi badwîrhe babwîrwa Emyanzi y’Akalembe. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>“N’iragi lyâge orhasârhiri erhi nie ntuma!”» <verse eid="LUK 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Zirya ntumwa za Yowane erhi zibà zamagenda, arhondêra abwîra olubaga ebya Yowane, erhi: «Bici mwâli mujir’ilâba omu irungu? Ka lusheke lwahuliganyibwa n’empûsi? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>“Bici mwalig’ilâba? Ka muntu ayamhirhe emyambalo y’obugale?” “Ci abayambala emyambalo y’obugale n’abalonza amasîma, omu nyumpa z’ebwâmi babà”. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>“Bici mwalig’ilola?” “Ka mulêbi?” “Nêci ntyo, ciru kulusha omulêbi”. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>“Oyo ye kuyandikirwe”: <char style="qt">“Lolà, narhuma entumwa yâni e­mbêre zâwe, nti ekurheganyize enjira”</char>. <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>“Mmubwîzire oku omu bàbusirwe n’omukazi boshi, ntà mulêbi oli mukulu kulusha Yowane Mubatiza”; “ci kwône oli munyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oli munyi omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda alushire Yowane obukulu: kuli kuderha oku abantu b’Amalaganyo mahyâhya balushlre ab’Amalaganyo makulûkulù iragi. Yowane aciri w’omu Malaganyo makulûkulù.</char></note> kulusha abâbo omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda, amulushire obukulu”». <verse eid="LUK 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Olubaga lwoshi lwamuyumvîrhe, ciru n’abanya-byâha babwîne oku Nyamuzinda ayâzize, babatizibwa obubatizo bwa Yowane. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Ci erhi Abafarizeyi n’abashamuka b’ihano balahira bwabatizibwa naye, bagayaguza ihano lya Nyamuzinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Erhi bagayaguza obubatizo bwa Yowane, balahira obwonjo bwa Nyamuzinda bw’okulonz’icungula abantu.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olubanja lw’abantu b’ensiku za Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:16-19">Mat 11, 16-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>«Ndi nankagererakwo abantu b’er’iburha? Ndi bashusha? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>“Bashushire abâna babwârhîre oku irango, badwîrhe bahamagalana banabwîrana, mpu”: “Rhushuba rhwammuzihira akarhêra, murhanasâmire; rhwabanzire endûlù, murhanalasire!” <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>“Yowane Mubatiza anaciyisha, arhàlyaga mugati arhànanywaga mamvu; mwaderha, mpu”: “Alimwo shetani!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>“Mwene-omuntu ayisha, erhi alya ananywa; mwaderha, mpu”: “Lolagi omulyi mukulu n’omulalwe, mwîra w’ebishungu n’ow’abanya-byâha!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>“Ci kwônene obushinganyanya bw’Obwîrhonzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abâna b’obushinganyanya bw’Obwîrhonzi bwa Nyamuzinda zo ntumwa za Yezu na ngasi boshi bayankirîr’enyigîrizo za Yezu n’ez’Omushokolezi wâge Yowane. </char></note> bwamanyîbwe n’abâna bâge boshi”».<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omukazi munya-byâha abêrwa obwonjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Mufarizeyi muguma amulâlika mpu aj’irya emwâge. Anacijà omu mw’o­lya Mufarizeyi, atamala aha cîbo. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Hâyisha mukazi muguma munya-byâha w’omu cishagala. Erhi ayumva oku ali oku cîbo omu mw’oyo Mufarizeyi, anaciyish’adwîrhe ecihakabiro c’omugavu. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Ayimanga enyuma aha magulu gâge, arhondêra amuvugumulira emirenge oku magulu anayihôrhola n’emviri z’oku irhwe lyâge; akamununugurha amagulu anagashîga omugavu. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Olya Mufarizeyi wali omulalisire, erhi abona okwo, acîdôsa emurhima, erhi: «Oyu muntu acibâga mulêbi, anali amanya mukazi muci oyu wamuhumakwo n’o­bwôrhere bwâge: ali munya-byâha!» <verse eid="LUK 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yezu anacimushuza, amubwîra, erhi: «Simoni, ngwêrhe oku nakubwîra». Naye, erhi: «Mwigiriza, derhaga». <verse eid="LUK 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>«Bashi babiri bâli omu mwenda gw’owâbo muntu; omurhanzi erhi acihozize ngoyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Magerha ikumi, lyo ifundo; na mafundo ikumi (erhi magerha igan’a), lwo lugoyi.</char></note> irhanu, owa kabiri mafundo arhanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Erhi babula eci bajuha, ababêrwa obwo­njo bombi. Ohi muli bo wamuzigira kulusha?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni ashuza, erhi: «Ncîkêbirwe nti olya nyakubabalirwa oku binji». Anacimubwîra, erhi: «Wadesire oku binali». <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Anacihindukira olya mukazi, abwîra Simoni, erhi: «K’o­ bwîne oyu mukazi? Najîre muno mwâwe, orhanshusire magulu; yêhe a­mvugumulire emirenge oku magulu, anagahôrhola n’emviri zâge. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Orhanûnugusire; yêhe, aha ajirîre muno, arhaj’ihusa okunnûnugurha amagulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Orhanshizire mavurha omu irhwe; yêhe anshîzire omugavu oku magulu. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Kuli okwo, nkubwîre: akulîrwe ebyâha byâge binji, bulya azigîre bwenêne. Ci ngasi obabalirwa bunyi, bunyi azigira». <verse eid="LUK 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Anacibwîra olya mukazi, erhi: «Wakulîrwe ebyâha byâwe». <verse eid="LUK 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Abàli oku cîbo baguma naye barhondêra okucîdôsa emurhima, mpu: «Ye muntu muci oyu orhenza ciru n’ebyâha?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Anacibwîra olya mukazi, erhi: «Obwêmêre bwâwe bwakucizize; cîgendere n’obuholo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Abaganda-kazi ba Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Kwanacibà kandi erhi adwîrhe ageragera omu ngo n’omu bishagala, ayish’ahanûla anayigîriza Emyanzi Minjà y’Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda; na balya Ikumi-na-babiri erhi bamukulikîre, <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>haguma n’abakazi afumagya abashetani babî n’endwâla: Mariya Magadalena, owarhenzibagwamwo bashetani nda; <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Yowana mukà Kuza, murhambo wa Herodi; Suzana, na bandi banji bakâg’ibarhabâla n’ebirugu byâbo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’owajag’imîra emburho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:19">Mrk 4, 19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Erhi engabo nyinji y’abantu ecilundumana n’erhi abakâg’ihubuka omu bishagala byoshi bamushimba, anacibatwa ogu mugani, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>«Omuhinzi anacihuluka mpu aj’imîra emburho zâge. N’erhi abà akola adwîrhe amîra, mburho nguma zarhogera eburhambi bw’enjira; zalabarhwa, n’orhunyunyi rhw’emalunga rhwacîlirazo. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Ezindi zarhogera omu lukarabuye; erhi zimera, zaciyumira erhi kubula mîshi kurhuma, <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Ezindi zarhogera omu mishûgi; erhi emishûgi emera haguma nazo, yazihuhya. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Ezindi zarhogera omu budaka bwinjà; zamera zanaburha ngasi nguma igana». Erhi abà adwîrhe aderha ntyo, anaciyâkûza, erhi: «Ogwêrhe amarhwîri g’okuyumva, ayumve!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecirhuma Yezu ayigîriza omu migani:</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-11">Mat 13, 10-11</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 13:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mrk 4, 10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Abaganda bâge bamudôsa ogwo mugani kwo kuderha kuci. <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Mwêhe mwahirwe okumanya amahwe gw’Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda; ci abandi bakaz’ibwîrwa omu migani, lyo bakalola barhanabone, bakanayumvirhiza barhanayumve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Loya <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Iz 6, 9</ref></char>.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amahugûlo g’omugani gwa nyakumîra emburho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:14-20">Mrk 4, 14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>«Ogwo mugani gw’ogu: “Emburho lwo Luderho lwa Nyamuzinda”. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>“Abâli eburhambi bw’enjira, bo balya bayumvîrhe; okubundi shetani ayisha, arhwêrûla lulya Luderho, omu mirhima yâbo, mpu lyo balek’iyôkoka bakayêmêra”. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>“Nabo ab’omu lukalabuye, bo balya bayumva Oluderho, baluyankirire banasîmire; ci erhi ntà mizî bagwêrhe”: “babà bantu bayêmêra kasanzi, n’ama­ngo g’amashumi, banacîyegûla”. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>“Ezarhogeraga omu mishûgi, bo balya bayu­mvîrhe; erhi bacigenda, ebihamba, obuhirhi n’amasîma g’eby’en’igulu byabahuhya, barhanacibonaga oku bayânakwo amalehe”. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>“Nazo ezarhogeraga, omu budaka bwinjà, bo balya bayumvîrhe Oluderho n’omurhima nkana na mwinjà, balushîbirira, banayerakwo amalehe omu bushibirizi bwâbo”».<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’akamole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-22">Mrk 4, 21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10, 26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>«Ntâye oyâkiza akamole okukafulika, nîsi erhi okukahira omu nterulè, ci emugamba kamanikwa, lyo abajà omu nyumpa babona obulangale. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>“Bulya ntâco cifulisirwe cirhakafulûlwa, na nt’ihwe lirhakarhulika n’okumanyîkana na boshi”. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>“Kuziga murhege amarhwîri oku ebi muyumva! Bulya ogwêrhe ye wâhâbwe, naye orhagwêrhi, ciru n’ehi acîkubagîre mpu agwêrhe, âhinyagwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bulya Entumwa zo zayish’ibà bajà-bugo b’Emyanzi y’Akalembe. 8, 19: Bene wâbo Yezu: bo balya b’omulala gwa Nnina Mariya na Yozefu Mutagatîfu. </char></note>”».<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ababusi na bene wâbo Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrk 3, 31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Nnina na bene wâbo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nnina na bene wâbo: Ojira oku Nnâmahanga alonza, agwêrhe obuzîne bwa Nyamuzinda omu murhima gwâge, oyo ye nnina na mwene wâbo Mwâmi Yezu.</char></note> banaciyisha emunda ali, ci babula oku bamuhika­ kwo erhi ngabo erhuma. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Bamubwîra, mpu: «Nyoko na bene winyu abo bali embuga bakulonza». <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Naye anacibashuza, erhi: «Nyâmà na bene wîrhu bo ngasi bayumva ecinwa ca Nyamuzinda n’okucîjira».<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arhiìza omulaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrk 4, 35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Lusiku luguma anacijà omu bwârho bo n’abaganda bâge, ababwîra, erhi: «Rhuyikirire ishiriza». Banacisokera emuhengere. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>N’erhi babà badwîrhe bavugama, ahunga. Empûsi yanacizûka, yatula omulaba omu nyanja; obwârho bwayunjula mîshi, babona bakola bali omu kaga. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Banacimujaho, bamutula, mpu: «Mâshi Muyigîriza, kufà kuno!» Anacizûka, akalihira empûsi n’ebivumba by’omulaba; byahulika, n’omurhûla gwabà. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Okuhandi ababwîra, erhi: «Ngahi obuyêmêre bwinyu buli?» Banacigeramwo omusisi, banarhangâla; balolanakwo bône na nnene, mpu: «Lêro ye ndi oyu? Ci yêhe adwîrhe arhegeka empûsi n’enyanja, binamuyumve!»<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu alîkûza omuntu w’e Jerazeni wàlimwo shetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mrk 5, 1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Banaciyikirira omu cihugo e'Abajerazeni, ishiriza ly’e Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Oku anayômoka oku cikwî, tundu oku muntu w’eco cishagala wàlimwo bashetani. Kurhenga mîra, arhaciyambalaga, arhanacilalaga omu nyumpa, ci omu byûsho. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Erhi abona Yezu, ayâma, acîrhimba aha magulu gâge, aderha n’izù linene, erhi: «Bici rhufânwa nâwe, Yezu Mwene-Nyamuzinda w’Enyanya? Orhandibuzagya, mâshi we okonkwa!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Yezu erhi adwîrhe arhegeka oyo shetani mpu arhengemwo oyo muntu. Bulya kanji oyo shetani ali amuzimuhire; bakàmulanga mushwêke n’enyogi n’emigozi; kurharhumaga arhakatwa emigozi, n’olya shetani akamukuruhana erubala. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yezu amudôsa, erhi: «We ndi izîno lyâwe?» Naye ashuza, erhi: «Murhwe», bulya alimwo bashetani banji. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Banacimuhûna mpu arhabarhegekaga bajè omu kuzimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abo bashetani barhalonz’ijà omu kuzimu, n’obwo yo emwâbo.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Aho hàli obusò bunene bw’engulube, erhi ziyabusire oku ntondo. Balya bashetani bamuhûna mpu abayêmêrere babè zo bajamwo. Anacibayêmêrera. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Obwo balya bashetani banacirhengamwo olya muntu, bajà omu ngulube; obusò bwahona oku manga, bwagend’iciloha omu nyanja, bwanacizika. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Abangere erhi babona oku byabîre, bakûla omulindi, baj’ishwâlîza ogwo mwanzi omu cishagala n’omu ndimiro. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Abantu banacishagamuka mpu baj’ilola oku byabîre. Erhi bahika hali Yezu, bashimâna olya abashetani barhengagamwo atamîre aha magulu ga Yezu, akola ayambîrhe anagwêrhe obukengêre bwâge; bayôboha. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Ababonaga oku byâbà, babarhondêreza oku oyo muntu wàlimwo bashetani afumaga. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Okubundi olubaga lwoshi lw’ecihugo c’Abajerazeni lwayinginga Yezu mpu abarhenger’eka, bulya bâli bayôbohire bwenêne. Naye anacishonera omu bwârho, acîgalukira. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Olya muntu wàlimwo abashetani amusengera mpu abêre bo naye; ci Yezu amusêzera anamubwîra, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>«Shubira emwinyu, ogend’iganîra ngasi byoshi Nnâmahanga akujirîre». Anacihira njira, aj’alumîza omu cishagala coshi ngasi kwoshi Yezu amujirîre.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omukazi walwala omududu, anafûla mwâli wa Yayiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-42">Mrk 5, 21-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Erhi Yezu agaluka, olubaga lwamuyankirira, bulya bakâg’imulinga boshi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Hanaciyisha omuntu, mpu ye Yayiri, wali mukulu w’esinagogi. Anacicîrhimba aha magulu ga Yezu, amushenga mpu ajè emwâge; <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>Bulya ali agwêrhe omwâna w’obunyere wa cûsha, wa myâka ikumi n’ibiri muburhe, erhi anali bufà. Erhi akola ayijà, olubaga lunji lw’abantu lwàli lumukulikîre lwamugorha. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Lêro omukazi walwâlaga omududu kurhenga myâka ikumi n’ibiri, erhi abafumu bamuyûsize ebintu na ntâye wamufumize, <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>amuyisha nyuma, amuhuma oku mukubo gw’ecishûli, na ho na halya ecirhambo câge cahuba. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yezu anacidôsa, erhi: «Ndi ompumirekwo?» Boshi erhi bahakana, lêro Petro n’abâbo bamubwîra, mpu: «Muyigîriza, ngabo y’abantu eyo ekulundumînekwo enakugosire». <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Yezu, erhi: «Omuntu ampumirekwo, bulya nayumvîrhe obuzibu bwantengamwo». <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Olya mukazi erhi abona agwâsirwe, anaciyisha, aj’ageramwo omusisi, acîrhimba aha magulu gâge, acîshobeka embere z’abantu boshi, ababwîra ecarhumaga amuhumakwo n’oku afumiraga oku liguma. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Anacimubwîra, erhi: «Mwâna wâni, obuyêmêre bwâwe bukufumize; ocîgendere n’o­buholo». <verse eid="LUK 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Oku acidwîrhe aderha, muntu muguma wahubukaga emwâge ayish’ibwîra omukulu w’esinagogi, erhi: «Mwâli wâwe amârhengamwo omûka; orhacîrhamagya Omuyigîriza». <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Erhi Yezu ayumva ako kanwa, amubwîra, erhi: «Orhayôbohaga; oyêmêre kwônene, afuma». <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Erhi ahika omu nyumpa, arhazigaga owamukulikiramwo, orhali Petro na Yowane na Yakôbo, bo n’îshe na nnina wa olya mwâna-nyere. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Boshi erhi badwîrhe bamulakira banabanda endûlù. Anaciderha, erhi: «Murhalake, bulya omwâna arhafîri, ci al’îrò». <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Bamushekera, bulya bâli bamanyire bwinjà oku anafîre. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Yêhe amugwârha okuboko, ayâkûza, erhi: «We mwâna, zûka». <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Omûka gwamushubiramwo, anacizûka ho na halya. Okubundi arhegeka mpu bamuhè ebi alya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Ababusi bâge barhangâla bwenêne; abakomêreza bwenêne mpu ntâye babwîrage ogwo mwanzi.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arhuma Entumwa zâge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5">Mat 10, 5</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 10:9-14">9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrk 6, 7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Ahamagala balya Ikumi-na-babiri, abahà obuhashe n’obuzibu oku ba­shetani boshi n’oku ndwâla mpu bazifumye. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Abarhuma okugend’ihanûla Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda n’okufumya endwâla. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Murhahêkaga kantu oku njira, ciru akarhi, ciru oluhago, ciru obuntu, ciru igerha; murhanacîhundikiraga bishûli bibiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Ngasi nyumpa mwankanajamwo, mubêremwo kuhika mugende. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>N’abâbule okummuyankirira, munarhenge muli lulya lugo, mugukumule akatulo kammuli oku nshando, kubè câgizo cinyu kuli bo». <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Banacilîkûla, bazunguluka ebishagala, bajà bayigîriza Emyanzi y’Akalembe banafumya abalwâla ngasi hoshi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herodi na Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-2">Mat 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mrk 6, 14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Mwâmi Herodi anaciyumva oku àli adwîrhe ajira kwoshi; ahaba kurhi ajira, bulya baguma bakâg’iderha, mpu Yowane afûsire omu bafù: <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>«Eliya oyo ogalusire», n’abandi mpu: «Muguma w’omu balêbi ba mîra ofûsire». <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Naye Herodi, erhi: «Yowane? Ka ntamutwaga irhwe! Aligi ndi oyo ndwîrhe nayumva baderha ntyo?» Akalonzalonza okumubona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa zashubûka; Yezu aluza emigati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk 6, 30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-13">Ywn 6, 1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Erhi entumwa zishubûka, zamurhondêreza ebi zajirire byoshi. Anacibayanka, acîyêgûla aharhali bantu ebwa cishagala ciguma ciderhwa Betisayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Ci engabo erhi emanya, yamuguma omu cirâlo. Abayankirira bwinjà, abashambalira Emyanzi y’Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda, n’abàli balwâla, abafumya. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Obwo izûba lyarhondêra okuzonga. Balya Ikumi-na-babiri bamujaho, bamubwîra, mpu: «Lîka olu lubaga, lugend’ilonza aha lwahanda n’ebi lwalya omu bishagala n’omu bigala bya hôfi-hôfi, bulya irungu lîno rhulimwo». <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Anacibashuza, erhi: «Mubahè ebi balya mwenene». Nabo, mpu: «Rhurhagwêrhi cindi aha nyuma ya migati irhanu yonene na nfî ibiri. Nkaba rhwêne rhugend’igula ebiryo by’okulîsa abà boshi». <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Bulya bâli nka balume bihumbi birhanu. Anacibwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: «Mubabwârhaze rhudêko rhudêko, ngasi cirundo bantu makumi arhanu». <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Banakujira, babwârhaza abantu boshi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Okubundi ayanka erya migati oku eri irhanu na zirya nfî zombi, agalamira emalunga, abigisha, abibega, abihereza abaganda bâge mpu bagabulire olubaga. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Banacirya boshi, bayigurha. Bashûbûza ebyasigalaga: birhiri ikumi na bibiri bya nshangukizà.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro amanya oku Yezu ali Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-16">Mat 16, 13-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20">20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mrk 8, 27-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Lêro kwanacibà lusiku luguma, erhi adwîrhe ashenga lwihwêko, erhi ali bo n’abaganda bâge, abadôsa, erhi: «Olubaga kurhi luderha mpu nie ndi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Banacimushuza, mpu: «Yowane Mubatiza; abandi mpu Eliya, abandi mpu muguma omu balêbi ba mîra wafûsire». <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Ninyu mwe, kurhi muderha mpu nie­ ndi?» Petro anacishuza, erhi: «Kristu wa Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="LUK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Okubundi anacibahanza mpu barbabwîraga ndi.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abwîra obw’oburhanzi abaganda bâge oku ayish’ibabazibwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21">Mat 16, 21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mrk 8, 31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Erhi: «Mwene-omuntu akwânîne ababale bwenêne n’okunenwa n’abagula, abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano, ayîrhwe, n’olusiku lwa kasharhu afûke.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebi owalonz’ishimba Yezu arhegesirwe okujira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-27">Mat 16, 24-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34-38">Mrk 8, 34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Akababwîra boshi, erhi: «Owalonz’inshimba, acîlahire yênene, abarhule omusalaba gwâge ngasi lusiku, ankulikire. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>“Bulya owâlonze okuciza obuzîne bwâge, ye wâbuheze; ci owâheze obuzîne bwâge nie ntuma, ye wâbucize”. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>“Bici kwankakwânana omuntu okubà mwâmi w’igulu lyoshi, erhi ankaciheza erhi okucîshereza yênene?” <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>“Bulya ngasi yêshi wâbè nshonyi nie ntuma n’enderho zâni zirhuma, oyo Mwene-omuntu ayish’imubêra nshonyi, amango ayish’iyisha omu irenge lyâge n’ery’Îshe na bamalahika batagatîfu”».<verse eid="LUK 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buli hôfi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:28">Mat 16, 28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:11">Mrk 9, 11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>«Mmubwîre okunali: hali baguma muli abà bali aha barhakabona olufù, barhanaj’ibona Obwâmi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda bwarhangire erhi Mwâmi Yezu arhondêra okuyigîriza abantu. Bwâyisha lwoshi hano Mwene-omuntu afà anafûke, na hano Ekleziya erhondêra okulumîra omu igulu. </char></note> bwa Nyamuzinda».<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ahinduka obusù</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-9">Mat 17, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-10">Mrk 9, 2-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Erhi kugera nka nsiku munâni ayûsiz’iderha ebyo binwa, anaciyanka Petro na Yakôbo na Yowane, arheremera oku ntondo, aj’ishenga. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Erhi abà akola adwîrhe ashenga, enshusho y’obusù bwâge yahinduka, n’emyambalo yâge yâbà myêru, yalangashana. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Obwo bantu babiri bakâganira bo naye: bo Mûsa na Eliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Banacibonekana omu irenge, bakâshambâla emyanzi y’okugenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okugenda kwa Yezu: kuli kuderha okufà kwâge.</char></note> kwâge ayish’iyunjuliza e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petro n’abâbo erhi bazidohîrwe n’îrò. Erhi basinsimuka, babona irenge lyâge, na balya bantu bo­mbî bayimanzire bo naye. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Erhi abo bantu bayegûka, Petro abwîra Yezu, erhi: «Waliha, kuli kwinjà rhubêre hano; rhuyûbakeho rhuyumpa rhusharhu: higuma hyâwe, ehindi bya Mûsa n’ehindi hya Eliya». Erhi arhacimanyiri bici adwîrhe aderha. <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Oku acidwîrhe aderha ntyo, olwikungu lwayisha, lwababwîka. Erhi olwikungu lubabwîkira, abaganda barhungwa n’obwôba. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>N’izù lyanacirhenga mwa lulya lwikungu, erhi: «Oyu ye Mugala wâni, ye Mwîshogwa wâni: mumuyumve». <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Eryo izù erhi liyumvikana, erhi Yezu akola ali yênene. Bâna­cihulika, mw’ezo nsiku barhabwîraga ndi eci babwîne.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu alibirhakwo shetani w’isirhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat 17, 14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrk 9, 14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Erhi buca, bakola bayandagala oku ntondo, ngabo nyi­nji yamuyishira. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Obwo muntu muguma omu lubaga anaciyâkûza, erhi: «Mâshi Mwigîriza, nkuhûnyire ololekwo mugala wâni; bulya ali wa cûsha. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Shetani anakaz’imugwârha, ho n’aho anagwîrira okuyâma, anamuzunguza, amugalagule kagali kûmu n’okumurhumbya kafula; anayish’imulîka erhi amâmuyûmy’amîshi, erhi anamuyâgazize. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Nahunyire abaganda bâwe nti bamulibirhe­kwo, ci barhahashire». <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yezu anacishuza, erhi: «Er’iburha libula-buyêmêre na linya-mabî, kuhika mangaci nayôrha ninyu erhi kulembera nammulembera? Lêrhaga mugala wâwe hano». <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Nyamwâna erhi ayêgera, shetani anacimurhi­mbà oku idaho, amuzunguza anamugalagula kagali kûmu. Yezu anacikankamira olya shetani, afumya omwâna, amugalulira îshe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Boshi barhangâla banasômerwa n’obukulu bwa Nyamuzinda.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yezu abwîra abaganda bâge obwa kabiri oku ayish’ibabala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mrk 9, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Okubundi erhi boshi babà badwîrhe basômerwa n’ebyo akâg’ijira, anacibwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>«Lolagi mwêhe ebinwa mwabîka emurhima gwinyu: Mwene-omuntu akwânîne ahânwe omu maboko g’abantu». <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Ci kwônene bôhe barhayumvagya olwo luderho, lwayôrha lufulike mpu lyo barhaluhugûke; banarhînya okumudôsalwo.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndi mukulu kulusha abâbo?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk 9, 33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Ehidali byanacizûka muli bo, mpu: ndi mukulu muli bo kulusha abâbo? <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Ci Yezu amanya enkengêro z’emurhima gwâbo, ahamagala omwâna w’ecirhaba, amuhira aha burhambi bwâge, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>anacibabwîra, erhi: «Ngasi wâyankirire oyu mwâna Izîno lyâni lirhuma, erhi nie ayankirîre; bulya oli murhò kulusha abâbo muli mwe, ye mukulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda, omu Ekleziya, omurhò ye mukulu, n’omukulu ye murhò. Owalonz’ikula, akwânîne acirhohye; n’owacîkuza, anarhôhibwa.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Orhali mushombanyi erhi mwîra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mrk 9, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yowane anacimubwîra, erhi: «Yâgirwa, rhwabonaga omuntu alibirha­ kwo abashetani oku Izîno lyâwe, rhwalonz’imuhanza, bulya arhakukulikira haguma nîrhu». <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Ci Yezu anacimushuza, erhi: «Murhamuhanzagya, bulya orhali mushombanyi winyu erhi mwîra winyu».<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">III. Yezu arheremera e Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ayankiriwa kubî omu cishagala ciguma e’e Samâriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Erhi ensiku zâge z’okurhenga en’igulu zihika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okubabala, okufà, okufûka n’okurheremera empingu kwa Mwâmi Yezu.</char></note>, anacihiga okujà e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Arhuma obugo embere zâge. Nabo balîkûla, bajà omu cishagala ciguma c’Abasamâriya mpu bamurheganyize icumbi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Ci barhamuyankiriraga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abasamâriya n’Abayahudi barhanywêranaga mîshi, ntyo oyêrekire e Yeruzalemu arhankayankirîrwe n’Abasamâriya.</char></note>, bulya ali ayêrekîre e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Erhi babona ntyo, abaganda bâge, Yakôbo na Yowane, bamubwîra, mpu: «Yâgirwa, k’olonzize rhurhegeke omuliro gumanuke emalunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuliro gumanuke emalunga: Aho ho Yakôbo na Yowane bayîrikagwa izîno lya Bowanerge, erhi bene-enkuba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 3:17">Mrk 3, 17</ref></char>).</char></note>, gubasingônole?» <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Anacihindamuka, abakalihira, erhi: «Murhamanyiri murhima muci mugwêrhe? <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Mwene-omuntu arhishag’iheza abantu, ci okubaciza». Banacigwârha enjira y’okujà omu cindi cishagala.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehi owalonz’ibà ntumwa arhegesirwe okujira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:18-22">Mat 8, 18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Erhi babà badwîrhe bagenda, muntu muguma amubwîra, erhi: «Nâkushimba ngasi hoshi wankajà». <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yezu anacimushuza, erhi: «Banyambwe bajira obulumba, n’orhunyunyi rhw’omu malunga rhujira enyôgo; Mwene-omuntu yêhe arhajira aha ankaheba irhwe». <verse eid="LUK 9:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Abwîra owundi, erhi: «Nkulikira». Naye, erhi: «Waliha, orhang’indika ngend’ibisha larha». <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yezu anacimushuza, erhi: «Oleke abafu babishe abafu bâbo; wêhe ogend’iyigîriza Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Owalonz’ikulikira Yezu arhankacihanzwa na cici, akwânîne aleke eby’en’igulu n’okushwira ebya Nnâmahanga.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 9:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Owundi, erhi: «Waliha, nakukulikira, ci orhang’indika nj’isêzera ab’emwîrhu». <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yezu anacimushuza erhi: «Ngasi yêshi wamâfumbarha enfuka, akashub’ikabagana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 62 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okulikîre Mwâmi Yezu arhaciyêmêrirwi okulola nyuma n’okukabagana eby’asigaga omu igulu.</char></note> enyuma, erhi arhakwânîni Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda».<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arhuma baganda makumi gali nda na babîri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:37-38">Mat 9, 37-38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:9-16">10, 9-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-24">11, 21-24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:8-11">Mrk 6, 8-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Enyuma ly’aho, Nyakasane ashub’icîshoga bandi makumi gali nda na babiri, abarhuma babiri babiri embere zâge, mpu bamushokolere okujà omu ngasi cishagala na ngasi hantu anâgere yênene. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «E­myâka y’okusârûlwa eri minji, ci abakozi banyiha; hunagi Nn’emyâka arhume abakozi omu myâka yâge. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>“Mugendage!” “Mubwîne oku mmurhumire nka bâna­-buzi omu karhî ka bacihazi”. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>“Murhahêkaga mvumba, erhi luhago, erhi nkwêrho, murhanalamusagya ndi omu njira”. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>“Ngasi nyumpa mwânajemwo, murhang’iderha, mpu: “Omurhûla mw’eyi nyumpa!” <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>“Mukabà muli omwâna w’omurhûla, omurhûla gwinyu gwanamudekererakwo; erhi akabà arhamuli, gwana­mmugalukira mwe nagwo”. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>“Munabêre mw’erya nyumpa, mulye munanywe­ kwo ebi banagwêrhe; bulya omukozi akwânîne oluhembo lwâge”. “Murhajaga omu n’omu”. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>“Ngasi cishagala mwânajemwo, bakammuyankiriramwo, munalye ebi bammurheganyîze”; <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>“mufumye abalwâla bamuli, munabwîre abantu, mpu”: “Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda bummuli hôfi”. <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Ci ngasi cishagala mwânajemwo bakabula kummuyankirira, munaje omu mashango gaco, muderhe, mpu”: <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>“Ciru n’akatulo k’ecishagala cinyu kali karhunanîre omu nshando, rhukagukumwîre, nti rhummusigireko, ci kwônene mumanyage oku Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buli hôfi”. <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>“Mmubwîre: olwo lusiku Sodoma ayish’ibabalirwa kulusha eco cishagala”. <verse eid="LUK 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Buhanya bwâwe, Korozayini! Buhanya bwâwe, Betisayida!” “Bulya ebisômerîne byajizirwe emwinyu, bicijiragwa e Tiri n’e Sidoni, rhinga kurhenga mîra bacibabazagya banatamale omu luvù, bacîyunjuze”. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>“Co cirhumire, olusiku lw’olubanja, Tiri na Sidoni bayish’ibabalirwa kummulusha”. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>“Nâwe Kafarnaumu, k’omanyire mpu walîha kuhika omu malunga?” “Wayish’ibungululwa kuhika omu kuzimu”. <verse eid="LUK 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>“Ngasi ommuyumva, erhi nie ayumvîrhe; n’omugayaguza, erhi nie agayaguzize; n’owangayaguza, erhi olya wantumaga ye agayaguzize”».<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecankarhuma abaganda ba Yezu bashagaluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Balya makumi gali nda na babiri bashûbûka banashagalusire, mpu: «Wa­liha, ciru n’abashetani badwîrhe barhuyumva Izîno lyâwe lirhuma!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Nalangire Shetani arhoga emalunga nka mulazo. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Nêci, na­ mmuhîre obuhashe bw’okulabarha enjoka n’engobe, n’obuhashe bwoshi oku mushombanyi, na ntâco cammubabaze. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Ci murhashagalukaga oku kubà abà­shetani badwîrhe bammuyumva, ci mushagaluke oku kubà amazîno ginyu gali mayandike omu mpingu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mushagaluke: Ciguma cône cankalerhera omukristu enshagali omu mikolo yâge: okujira obulonza bwa Nnâmahanga. Okwo kwône kwankarhuma rhwakwânana oluhembo lw’empingu, Ebindi byoshi, ciru byankabà bisômerîne n’ebirhangâzo, biri bya busha, akabà rhurhalonzamwo irenge lya Nyamuzinda n’akalamo k’ensiku n’amango.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emyanzi y'Akalembe yamanyibwe n’abîrhôhye. Îshe n’Omugala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat 11, 25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ho n’aho, Yezu afuduswa na Mûka Mutagatîfu, acîshinga, erhi: «Nkukuzize, Larha, Mwâmi w’empingu n’igulu, bulya ebyo wabifulisire ab’obukengêre bunji n’abirhonzi, wabifulûlira abîrhôhye. Nêci, Larha, bulya kwo walonzize ntyo. <verse eid="LUK 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>Nahîrwe byoshi na Larha, na ntâye oyishi Omugala ye ndi arhanali Îshe, na ntâye oyishi Îshe ye ndi arhanali Mugala, erhi oyu Omugala olonzize okumufulûliraye».<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iragi ly’abaganda ba Yezu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">Mat 13, 16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Okubundi anacihindamukira abaganda bâge, ababwîra kwâbo, erhi: «Iragi ly’amasù gabwîne ebi mudwîrhe mwabona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Bulya, mmubwîre, balêbi na bâmi banji bàcîfinjire okubona ebi mudwîrhe mwabona, barhanabibonaga, n’okuyumva ebi mudwîrhe mwayumva, barhanabiyumvagya!»<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Irhegeko lirhanzi omu marhegeko goshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:28-31">Mrk 12, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Obwo mulenga muguma w’Amarhegeko anaciyimanga, alonza okumurhega, amudôsa, erhi: «Waliha Mwigîriza, kurhi nankajira lyo mbona akalamo k’ensiku n’amango?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Anacimubwîra, erhi: «Omu Marhegeko, cici ciyandisirwemwo? Cici osomamwo?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Naye amushuza, erhi: «Okâzigira Nyakasane Nyamuzinda wâwe n’omurhima gwâwe goshi, n’omûka gwâwe gwoshi n’emisî yâwe yoshi n’obukengêre bwâwe boshi; n’owinyu nka oku ocîzigira wênene». <verse eid="LUK 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yezu amubwîra, erhi: «Washuzize bwinjà; ojire ntyo, wabona akalamo».<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’Omusamâriya mwinjà</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Ci yêhe erhi acilonza okucîrhenza enshonyi, abwîra Yezu, erhi: «Owîrhu ye ndi?» <verse eid="LUK 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yezu assuza, erhi: «Muntu muguma arhengaga e Yeruzalemu, ayandagalira e Yeriko, lêro agwa omu maboko g’ebishumûsi; erhi bibà byamâmunyaga ebi ali adwîrhe byoshi byamânamushurha, byamuleka cirunda, byacîgendera. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>“Mudâhwa muguma anaciyandagala muli eyo njira; erhi amubona, acigerera”. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>“Muleviti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omuleviti: muntu w’omulala gwa Levi; gwo mulala gwa balya bakâg’ikola omu ka-Nyamuzinda; mpu Mushi, rhucîkebwa shakulûza w’Abashi ali w’oku bûko bwa Levi naye (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 6:19">Lub 6, 19</ref></char>). </char></note> muguma kwo n’okwo, erhi ahahika, amulikira amasù, acîzongera”. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>“Ci erhi Musamâriya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omusamâriya: Oyo muntu wagwâga omu maboko g’ebishumûsi àli Muyahudi; n’Abayahudi bâli basho­mbanyi b’Abasamâriya. Oyo Mûsamâriya mwinjà luli lwîganyo kuli rhwe: obuzigire burhalola ola ali wa mulala muci, burhalola ali w’idini lici; burhishi mwîru erhi mwêru erhi mudukula: ngasi muntu ali mwene-wîrhu, bulya ciri ciremwa ca Nyamuzinda na mwene Larha w’empingu.</char></note> muguma mubalama amuhikaho n’erhi amubona, amufa lukogo”. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>“Anacimujaho, amutunga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amutunga ebihulu, kuli kuderha arhuba ebihulu</char></note> ebihulu, abidubulirakwo amavurha n’idivayi, amushonêsa oku ndogomi yâge, amuhêka omu k’ebigolo, amulwâza”. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>“Erhi buca, ajira mafundo abiri, agahà nn’ak’ebigolo, amubwîra, erhi”: “Omulwâze bwinjà, na ngasi coshi wankakolêsa kulusha aho, hano ngaluka, nkulyûle”, <verse eid="LUK 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>“Muli abo basharhu, ndi odesire mpu ye wâbo olya wagwâga omu mahoko g’ebishumûsi?”» <verse eid="LUK 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Ashuza, erhi: «Olya wamufâga bwonjo». Naye Yezu amubwîra, erhi: «Ogende, nâwe oj’ijira ntyo».<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Marta na Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Byanacibà ntyo! Erhi babà bali omu njira, Yezu ajà omu lugo luguma; mukazi muguma, ye Marta, anacimuyankirira omu mwâge. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Oyo mukazi àli agwêrhe omulumuna, izîno lyâge ye Mariya; yêhe acibwârhalira aha magulu ga Nyakasane, akayumva ebinwa byâge. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Naye Marta erhi arhubanukîrwe n’e­mikolo minji y’okurheganya ebi bamushêgera. Anaciyimuka, amujaho, erhi: «Waliha, k’orhabwîni oku mulumuna wâni andekîre omukolo nienene? Mâshi omumbwîrire angwâse». <verse eid="LUK 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Nyakasane anacimushuza, erhi: «Marta, Marta, odwîrhe wakoyakoya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahâli h’okukoyakoya oku by’en’igulu, rhukoyakoye oku by’Obwâmi bw’empingu erhi­ kwo. «Iragi lyâbo abayumva ecinwa ca Nyamuzinda, banacibikirire emurhima».</char></note> wanalibuka na binji; nobwo ciguma conene cikwânîne. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Mariya ye wacîshozire omwanya mwinjà kulusha; arhakagunyagwa».<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Oku rhwakashenga Larha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6, 9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Kwanacibà lêro erhi ali hantu haguma adwîrhe ashenga, erhi ayûsa, muguma omu baganda bâge amubwîra, erhi: «Yâgirwa, orhubwîrize nîrhu okushenga, nka kulya Yowane abwîrizagya abaganda bâge.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">«Nka mwashenga, “mukaderha ntya”:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Larha, Izîno lyâwe likuzibwe”;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Obwâmi bwâwe buyishe”;<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>“Orhuhè ene akalyo kîrhu ka ngasi lusiku”;<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>“Orhubabalire ebyâha bîrhu”,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">“bulya nîrhu rhubabalira ngasi yêshi orhuli omu mwenda”;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">“orhanarhuhiraga omu mashumi”».<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omwîra orhagoheka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Muguma muli mwe erhi ankabà ajira omwîra, ayish’imutula aha karhî k’obudufu, erhi: “Mwîra wâni, mpoza migati isharhu”, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>“bulya omwîra wâni ambalamîre ntanagwêrhi eci namuzimâna”. <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>“Naye amushuzize omu nyumpa, anamubwîre, erhi”: “Orhambere irhwe; mîra lwahamika­gwa, nankola ngwîshîre n’abâna bâni; ntankacizûka nti nkuhè”. <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>“Olya erhi ankashub’ikakomamba, mmubwîzire oku, ciru ankabà arhazûsiri mpu amuhêre obwîra, anazâka erhi burhè burhuma, amuhè ngasi eci alonza”».<verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhashe bw’ensengero</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Mat 7, 7-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:13-16">Ywn 14, 13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>«Nâni mmubwîzire: Muhûne mwahâbwa, mulonze mwarhôla, mukomambe mwayigulirwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Bulya ngasi ohûna anahâbwe, na ngasi olonza anarhôle, n’okomamba oku lumvi anayigulirwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Mubusi ndi muli mwe, omugala erhi ankamuhûna obuntu, ankamuha ibumba? Nîsi erhi ankamuhûna enfî, ka ankamuhà empiri? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Nîsi kandi erhi amuhûne iji, ka ankamuha ihiri? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Mwe babî, akabà muyish’ihà abâna binyu ebinja, Sho w’empingu yêhe k’arhalushe okuhà abamuhûnyire Mûka Mutagatîfu!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arhayimbanwa na Belzebubi (Mat 12. 22-29; Mrk 3, 22-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Anacibà adwîrhe alibirhakwo shetani, n’oyo shetani erhi wa kaduma. E­erhi shetani akarhengamwo, kalya kaduma kaderha, n’olubaga lwarhangâla. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Ci baguma muli bo baderha, mpu: «Belzebubi, omurhambo w’abashetani, ye ahulusamwo abashetani». <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>N’abandi balonza okumurhangula, bamuhûna ecimanyîso cahubuka oku nkuba. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Ci yêhe abona enkengêro zâbo, ababwîra, erhi: «Ngasi bwâmi buciberamwo, kuhya buhya, n’enyumpa zanakahongokera oku zindi. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>“Naye shetani, akabà acîgabiremwo yênene, kurhi obwâmi bwâge bwankaciyimanga?” “Bulya mudesire mpu oku buzibu bwa Belzebubi ndibirha­ kwo bashetani”. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>“Akabà oku buzibu bwa Belzebubi ndibirhakwo bashetani, oku buzibu bwa ndi abâna binyu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Buyahudi mwâli abantu bàl’igwêrhe obuhashe bw’okuhulusa abashetani. Okuderha mpu oku buhashe bwa Belzebubi Yezu alibirhakwo bashetani, kuli kujacira abandi Buyahudi bahîrwe obwo buhashe. Bulya okuhengulira Belzebubi obuhashe bw’okuhulusa abashetani, kuli kujira abâna bâbo baganda ba shetani. Abo bâna b’Abayahudi bo bayish’itwîra ababajâcira ntyo olubanja. </char></note> babalibirhakwo bo?” “Lêro bo bayish’ibà bacîranuzi binyu”. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>“Ci akabà oku munwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omunwe gwa Nyamuzinda: buzibu bwâge, Nyamuzinda-Mûka.</char></note> gwa Nyamuzinda ndibirhakwo ba­shetani, kwo kuderha oku Obwâmi bwa Nnâmahanga bwayishire eno mwinyu”. <verse eid="LUK 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Entwâli ecîbambizize ekalâlîra enyumpa yâge, ntâye wankahuma oku birugu byâge”. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>“Ci erhi hankayisha omulushire burhwâli, akanamuhima, anamunyaga emirasano yoshi ali acîkubagîre, n’ebi amunyagaga, anabigabaguza”».<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Orhali na Yezu erhi mushombanyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12, 30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>«Oyu rhurhali rhwe naye, erhi mushombanyi, n’orharhôla haguma nâni, erhi kushandâza ashandâza».<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuzimu mubî w’enshubîrizi aminya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12, 43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>«Shetani akarhenga omu muntu, anajè ageragera aharhali mîshi, ajè alonza ah’arhamûkira. Akahabula, anaderha, erhi: “Ka ncîshubirire mulya mwâni narhengaga”. <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>“Erhi amuhika, anashimâna muli muhyajire munabambirwe bwinjà”. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>“Anagenda obwo, alêrhe bandi bashetani nda babî kumulusha; n’erhi bajamwo, banacilambûliramwo”. “Okubundi obwôrhere buzinda bw’oyo muntu bwanabà bubî kurhaluka oburhanzi”».<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iragi ly’okuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Lêro oku adwîrhe aderha ntyo, mukazi muguma omu lubaga anaciyakuûza, erhi: «Iragi ly’enda yakuhêkaga n’amabêre gakuyonsagya!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Ci yêhe amushuza, erhi: «Iragi lyâbo erhi bo abayumva ecinwa ca Nnâmahanga n’okucilanga!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecimanyîso ca Yônà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Erhi orhutu rhw’abantu rhumulundûkira, arhondêra okubabwîra, erhi: «Eri iburha liri iburha libî; lyalonza ecimanyîso, n’ecimanyîso ntâco lyâbona ecirhali cimanyîso ca Yônà<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">- cimanyîso: Kwo kuderha ecisômerîne c’okuyêrekana obuhashe bwa Yezu. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Bulya, nka kulya Yônà aberaga abantu b’e Ninive cimanyîso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kulya Yônà ayêrekaga abantu b’e Ninive enjira y’okucira, ntyo kwo Mwâmi Yezu al’ijirira Abayahudi; ci bôhe balahira.</char></note>, kwo na Mwene-omuntu ayìsh’ibà kuli eri iburha. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Omwâmi-kazi w’Ebulyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Ebulyo»: emunda omuntu oli alola ebushoshôkero ehebire okuboko kulyo, kandi bayiderha «mukondwè» erhi «ifo». «Ebulembe», yo erigi emunda omuntu ahebire okuboko kulembe, kumosho. Kandi bayiderha e «mwênè», erhi e «ruguru» </char></note> ayish’ijà lubanja n’eri iburha, aliyagîrize, bulya arhengaga e­nyuma y’ebihugo mpu ayish’iyumva obushinganya bwa Salomoni; n’olushire Salomoni, y’ono oli hano! <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Abantu b’e Ninive bayish’ijà lubanja n’eri iburha, banaliyâze, bulya bacîyunjuzize erhi bayumva enyigîrizo za Yônà; n’olushire Yônà, y’ono oli hano!»<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’akamole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5, 15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mrk 4, 21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>«Ntâye oyakiza akamole okukafulika omu nterulè erhi omu byâsi, ci oku ngondôzo kamanikwa, lyo abajà omu nyumpa babona obulangale. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Akamole k’omubiri gwâwe, lyo isù lyâwe. Isù lyâwe likabà ligumaguma, omubiri gwâwe gwoshi gunabè n’obulangashane; ci erhi lyankalwâla, nagwo omubiri gwâwe gwanabà n’omwizimya. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Ocidôsc erhi ohulangale bukulimwo burhali mwizimya! <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Omubiri gwâwe gwoshi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mubiri gwoshi omu bulangale: Owalonz’iyumwa enyigîrizo za Yezu, abè n’obukengêre n’omurhima mugumagumà.</char></note> gukabà n’obulangale, buzira cirumbu ciri omu mwizimya, gwoshi gwanabêra omu bulangale nka kulya akamole kakumolekera n’obulangale bwâko».<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu akalihira Abafarizeyi n’abashamuka b’ihano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:13-32">Mat 23, 13-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Oku acidwîrhe aderha, Mufarizeyi muguma anacimulâlika mpu aj’irya e­mwâge. Anaciyijà, atamala oku cîbo. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Erhi abona okwo, olya Mufarizeyi arhondêra acîdesa emurhima mpu arhacîkalabire embere z’okulya. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Ci Nyakasane amubwîra, erhi: «Mwe Bafarizeyi, mushuka ebiri emugongo gw’akabehe n’embêhe, ci erhi munayunjwire bushungu n’obubî! <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>“Ebi bingolongolo”! “Owa­jiraga ebiri emugongo k’arhali ye wajiraga n’ebiri omu ndalâlà?” <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>“Muhêreze abakenyi ebi mugwêrhe erhikwo, na ntyo byoshi byammubêra bicêse”. <verse eid="LUK 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Ci kwônene, buhanya bwinyu mwe Bafarizeyi, bulya muhâna entûlo y’emento<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emento n’eruta ziri mburho za citwîro ca ntyantya.</char></note> n’eruta n’eya ngasi lushogo, mugal’iyibagira obushinganyanya n’obuzigire bwa Nnâmahanga! N’obwo byo mukwânîne okurhang’ijira ebyo, buzira okuyibagira ebirhanzi”. <verse eid="LUK 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Buhanya bwinyu, mwe Bafarizeyi, bulya musîma okubwârhala oku ntebe ntanzi omu masinagogi n’okulamusibwa oku mmâna!” <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>“Buhanya bwinyu, bulya mushusha enshinda zirhabonekana, ciru n’abantu banazigere­kwo barhanamanyiri!”»<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Muguma omu bashamuka b’ihano ashuza, erhi: «Muyigîriza, omu kuderha ntyo, kurhujacira orhujacîre nîrhu!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Naye, erhi: «Ninyu mwe bashamuka b’ihano, buhanya bwinyu! Bulya munabarhuze abantu emizigo erhankagalwa, n’obwo mwêne ciru murhayihumakwo n’omunwe gwinyu! <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Buhanya bwinyu, mwe muyûbakîsa enshinda z’abalêbi, n’obwo basho bo babayîrhaga! <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Ntyo muli bahamîrizi b’ebijiro bya basho, munabiyêmêra; bulya bo babayîrhaga, ninyu muyûbaka ebyûsho byâbo! <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Co cirhumire Obushinganya bwa Nyamuzinda buderha: Nabarhumira abalêbi n’entumwa, bayîrhamwo baguma banabalibuze, <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>lyo eri iburha liyish’idôsibwa omukò gw’abalêbi gwabulajisire kurhenga okulemwa kw’igulu, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>kurhenga omukò gw’Abeli kuhika omukò gwa Zakariya, owanigiragwa omu ka-Nyamuzinda ekarhî k’oluhêro n’ahatagatîfu. Okuli, mmubwîre, ebyo byoshi byabarhuzîbwe eri iburha. <verse eid="LUK 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>Buhanya bwinyu, mwe bashamuka b’ihano! Bulya mwayansire olwigulo lw’obumanye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lwigulo lw’obumanye bw’Amandiko matagatîfu. Ntyo bàrhuma abantu barhamanya enjira y’Obwâmi bwa Nnâmahanga. Kulusha aho, badwîrhe bahanza abantu okuyankirira enyigîrizo za Mwâmi Yezu.</char></note>. Mwene murhacimujaga, nabo abàli bamujà, mwabahagalika!» <verse eid="LUK 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Erhi ahuluka, abashamuka b’ihano n’Abafarizeyi barhondêra okumukunirira bwenêne n’okumudôkereza binji binji, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>bakamurhega mpu lyo aderha akanwa karhuma bamushobeka.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Okuderha okuli buzira bwôba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Erhi engabo nyinji emuzunguluka, ciru baguma bakalabarha abandi, arhondêra okubwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: «Mumanye engezo y’Abafarizeyi, bwo bulyâlya. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Ntâco cifulisirwe cirhakafulûlwa, na nt’ihwe lirhakarhulika. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Kuziga ebi mwaderhîre omu mwizimya, byoshi byayish’iderhwa izûba lyabasha, n’ecimwajaga mahwe omu kurhwiri muli omu nyumpa, cayish’iyakuzibwa oku mmâna. <verse eid="LUK 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>Mwe bîra bâni, mmubwîzire nti murhayôbohaga abantu bayîrha omubiri, n’enyuma ly’aho babule ecibankashub’ijira. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Nkolaga nammuyêreka ndi mukwânine okuyôboha: muyôbohe Olya wankab’amâyîrha, akashub’ihasha n’okukwêba omu nyenga y’omuliro. Nêci, mmubwîzire, y’oyo ye muyôbobage<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyamuzinda yêne wa kuyôbohwa, bulya yêne ogwêrhe obuhashe bw’okuheza lwoshi n’okuciza. Ci obwo bukwânine okurhabâlwa n’obulangâlire, bulya Nyamuzinda ali Larha.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>Ka bitora birhanu birhagulwa bujuma bubiri? Na ntâco muli byo ciyibagirwa na Nyamuzinda! <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Ciru n’emviri z’irhwe linyu ziri nganje zoshi. Murhayôbohaga; mulushire olugù lw’ebitora. <verse eid="LUK 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>Ka mmubwîre: ngasi yêshi wânkuze embere z’abantu, naye Mwene-omuntu anâmukuze embere za bamalahika ba Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Ci owandahire embere z’abantu, ayish’ihakanwa e­mbêre za bamalahika ba Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>Na ngasi yêshi wajâcîre Mwene-omuntu, anababalirwe; ci omuntu wâlogorhere Mûka-Mutagatîfu, arhakababalirwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà amahugûlo: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 3:29">Mrk 3, 29</ref></char>. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>Amango mwâhekwe omu masinagogi n’embere z’abacîranuzi n’abarhegesi, murharhamaga mwarhanya mpu kurhi mwasamba erhi binwa bici mwaderha. <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>Bulya Mûka Mutagatîfu ayish’immubwîra ho na halya ebi mu­kwânine okuderha».<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhahira omurhima omu by’en’igulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Muntu muguma omu lubaga anacimubwîra, erhi: «Waliha Mwigîriza, o­mbwîrire mwene wîrhu rhugabâne akashambala kîrhu». <verse eid="LUK 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Anacimushuza, erhi: «Ewe larha, ndi wanjiraga mucîranuzi nîsi mugabi w’ebirugu by’akashambala kinyu?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Okubundi anacibabwîra, erhi: «Mumanye murhabâga ba kajiji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okubà wa kajiji: kushwira erhi okuziga eby’en’igulu n’okubihubira</char></note>, bulya omuntu obuzîne bwâge burhaba omu bunji bw’ebirugu byâge». <verse eid="LUK 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Anacibatwa omugani, erhi: «Hàli muntu muguma mugale, ishwa lyâge lyananaciyêra bwenêne. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>“Anacirhimanya, erhi”: “Kurhi najira obu ntagwêrhi aha nahaka emyâka yâni?” <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>“Acîdesa, erhi”: “Namâmanya oku najira”: “nkola nâshâba enguli zâni, nyûbake engali kulusha, mwo nâhaka emyâka yâni n’ebirugu byâni byoshi”. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>“Obwo mbwîre omurhima gwâni, nti”: “We murhima, okola ogwêrhe birugu binji muhako myâka erhali minyi; ojage waluhûka, olye, onywe onajire idinie”. <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>“Ci Nyamuzinda anacimubwîra, erhi”: “Eci cingolongolo!” “Kali obu budufu bw’ene bayish’ikuyanka omûka!” “N’ebyo walundisire byayishig’ibà bya ndi obwo?” <verse eid="LUK 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>“Kwo ali ntyo ngasi muntu ocilundikira yêne ahâli h’okugalira Nnâmahanga”»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">okugalira Nnâmahanga kuli kuhika amakwânane g’empingu</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîkubagira Nnâmahanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-33">Mat 6, 25-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Okubundi anacibwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: «Co cirhumire mmubwîra: “Murharhanyagya oku buzîne bwinyu mpu bici mwalya n’oku mubiri gwinyu mpu bici mwayambala”. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>“Bulya obuzîne bulushire ebiryo n’omubiri gulushire emyambalo”. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>“Mulole bahungwe: bahbarhwera barhanasârûla, barhajira irhindikiro erhi nguli, Nyamuzinda agal’inabalîsa! Ka murhalushiri orhunyunyi bwenêne!” <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>“Ndi muli mwe, ciru ankahangaza, wankahash’icîyushulira ikoro liguma oku buzîne bwâge?” <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>“Akabà ciru ebinyi biyâbîre obuhashe bwinyu, cirhumirâge mukacîrhamya oku bindi?” <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>“Mulole kurhi obwâso bumera: burhakola burhanaluka”. “Mmubwîzire oku ciri Salomoni omu irenge lyâge lyoshi arhayambalaga nka hyâso higuma muli rhwo”. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>“Kuziga Nnâmahanga akayambika ntyo ehyâsi hiri omu ishwa ene n’irhondo hyakwêbwa omu cibeye, ba­ nyamubula-buyêmêre, k’arhammujirire okulushire aho?” <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Murhakâg’irhanya mpu cici mwankalya, nîsi mpu cici wankanywa; mumanye murhacîhiraga omu ntanya”. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>“Bulya ebyo byoshi bapagani b’en’igulu bo babilonza. Mwêhe Sho ayishi oku mubilagîrirekwo”. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>“Kuziga mulonze Obwâmi bwâge, n’ebyo byoshi mwayish’ibiyûshulirwa”. <verse eid="LUK 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Murhayôbohaga, mwe busò busungunu, bulya Sho alonzize okummuhà Obwâmi”».<verse eid="LUK 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuguza ebirugu bîrhu n’okuhà abakenyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:20-21">Mat 6, 20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Muguze ebirugu binyu, murhabâlemwo abakenyi. Mucîlukire emvumba zirhashaja, munacîbîkire omuhako gurhahwa omu mpingu, emunda ecishambo cirhahika n’enundo erhalunda. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Bulya aha omuhako gummuli ho n’omurhima gwayish’immuba.<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîrheganya n’okubà masù oku mango Nnawîrhu agaluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:35">Mrk 3, 35</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:43-51">Mat 24, 43-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>«Muhwinje bwinjà munafumbarhe orhumole rhwinyu rhutwâne. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>“Mubè nk’abantu bâlinga nnawâbo hano arhenga oku buhya, erhi ayisha lyo bamuyigulira amâkomamba oku lumvi”. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>“Iragi lyâbo abashi nnawâbo ashimâna bali masù hano ayisha! Okuli, mmubwîre, ayish’ikenyera, ababwârhaze aha cîbo câge, akabageramwo, abagabulire”. <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>“Ayishe oku îrò lirhanzi, ayishe oku irya-bantu, akabashanga bali ntyo, iragi ly’abo Bashi!” <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>“Muyumve bwinjà”: “acibâga nnakà ankamanya akasanzi ecishambo cayisha, arhankagoheka ciru ehitya, arhankanaleka enyumpa yâge eberwe”. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>“Ntyo ninyu mubè masù, bulya amango murhishi go Mwene omuntu anayishe”». <verse eid="LUK 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petro anacimubwîra, erhi: «Waliha, ka rhwenene otwîre ogo mugani, ni boshi?» <verse eid="LUK 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Nyakasane ashuza, erhi: «Ndi baderha mpu ali mwimangizi mwîkubagirwa na mwîrhonzi, oyu nnawâbo anasigîre aha mbuga, ayish’ihà abâbo Bashi ogwâbo mulengo gw’e­ngano omu mango gakwânîne? <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>“Iragi ly’oyo mushi, oyu nnawâbo ashimâna a­ dwîrhe ajira ntyo hano ayisha!” <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>“Okuli mmubwîre, ayish’imurhambuza oku byâge byoshi”. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>“Kwônene, oyo murhumisi erhi ankaderha emurhima, erhi”: “Nnawîrhu alegamir’igaluka”, “okubundi arhondêre ashûrha abambali n’abà­ mbali-kazi, agwîre okulya, okunywa n’okukalûka”, <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>“nnawâbo oyo mushi ayish’iyisha olusiku n’akasanzi arhamanyiri, amukage anamuganjire omu bâgo­ma”. <verse eid="LUK 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Naye omushizi oyishi eci nnawâbo asîma, arhanacirheganye, arhanajire oku nnawâbo alonza, ayish’ishûrhwa empîmbo”. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>“Naye owakozire ebikwânîne okushûrhirwa, ci arhamanyaga, ayish’inyulikwa, ci arhali bwenêne”. “Ngasi wahîrwe binji, ayish’idôsibwa binji, na ngasi wabîsîzwe binji, ayish’ilyuzibwa kulu­sha”».<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arhàl’ilêrha murhûla en’igulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:38">Mrk 10, 38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat 10, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>«Muliro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muliro gwa kucêsa n’okudûrhubaza emirhima </char></note> nal’ilêrha en’igulu, nanalonza bwenêne guyâke! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>“Ngwêrhe obubatizo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obubatizo bwa Mwâmi Yezu gwo mababale n’okufà kwâge.</char></note> nayîsh’iyankirira, nampangalîre omurhima kuhika buyunjule!” <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>“Ka mumanyire mpu murhûla nal’ilêrha en’igulu? Nanga, mmubwîzire, ci kukoza abantu”. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>“Bulya kurhenga buno, omu nyumpa ya bantu barhanu, bayish’icîgabamwo basharhu balwîsa babiri, na babiri balwîse basharhu”. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>“Abantu bayish’icîgaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okwo kucîgabamwo n’okukozanya, kuli kuderha oku abayêmire Yezu bakozibwakwo entambala n’abarhamuyêmîri</char></note>, omubusi akoze omugala, n’omwâna akoze îshe; omuzîre akoze omwâli, n’omwâli akoze nnina; omukazi akoze omwâlikazi, n’omwâlikazi ako­ze nnazâla”».<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okumanya ebimanyîso by’amango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat 16, 2-3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">5, 25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Ashub’ibwîra olubaga, erhi: «Mukabona ecitù ciyimuka Ebuzikiro, munayirukire mwaderha, mpu enkuba yamahinda, erhi kwo binali ntyo. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Nayo empûsi y’Ebulyo ekahûsa munaderhe, mpu idûrhu lyâbà, erhi binali. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Ezi ndyâlya, munamanyirire obusù bw’ecihugo n’obw’emalunga! Cirhumirage murhacimanya aga mango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mango ga Masiha: gamanyîkana oku bisômerîne hyâge.</char></note>? <verse eid="LUK 12:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>Cirhuma murhamanya mwenene ecimmukwânîne okujira? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Ntyo okahêka oyu muli kadali naye lubanja emwa omucîranuzi, onacisêze muyûkize omu njira, arhag’ikuhêka embere z’omucîranuzi, naye omucîranuzi arhag’ikuhà omuganda, n’omuganda arhag’ikuhira omu mpamikwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Nkubwîre, orhâmurhengè orhajaj’ilyûla obujuma buzinda».<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Okucîyunjuza n’okuyêmêra amalumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Muli ako kasanzi hanaciyisha abantu, bamubwîra emyanzi ya balya Bagalileya Bilato agushaga omukò gwâbo omu gw’enterekêro zâbo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Anacibashuza, ababwîra, erhi: «Ewe, ka mumanyire mpu aho Bagalileya bàgwêrhe ebyâha kurhaluka abâbo Bagalileya boshi, okwenge bamalibuzibwa ntyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Mmubwîzire oku nanga! Ci akabà murhacîyunjuzizi, mweshi kwo mwânahungumuka ntyo. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Nîsi erhi balya ikumi na munâni bahoneragwa n’omutungo omu Silowe, ka mwamanya mpu bo babîhire kurhaluka abâbo b’e Yeruzalemi boshi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Mmubwîzire oku nanga! Ci akabà murhacîyunjuzizi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu masù g’Abayahudi, amalumwa càli cimanyîso c’obuhane bwa Nnâmahanga. Bôhe, bâli bacîkêbirwe mpu abo bâbo banigagwa n’abàhoneragwa n’omutungo bo bâli babî, mpu n’abandi barhabonaga ago mababale bâli bêru-kwêru. Hali amango Nnâmahanga akarhumira abinja amababale en’igulu, n’ababî abaleke. Co cirhumire ntâye ciru n’omuguma okwânîne okulonz’imanya omahwe ga Nyamuzinda, bulya rhweshi rhuli banya-byâha, na rhweshi rhukwânîne rhulyûle ebyâha bîrhu n’eby'abirhu bantu.</char></note>, mweshi kwo mwânahirigirha ntyo».<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’omulehe gurhayàna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Ashub’ibabwîra ogu mugani, erhi: «Muntu muguma àli agwêrhe omulehe omu lukoma lwâge lw’emizâbîbu. Ayish’al’ilonza amalehe kuli gwo, arhagabonaga. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>“Anacibwîra okonda lulya lukoma, erhi”: “Ekola myâka isharhu eno erhi nyisha nd’ilonza amalehe kw’ogu mulehe, ntanagabona”. “Lêro ogutwe; cici gucirîrakwo obudaka?” <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>“Naye amushuza, amubwîra, erhi”: “Mâshi Waliha, oshub’iguleka, ogu mwâka naguyûhirira nguhirekwo n’emyâvu”. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>“Nkaba gwayâna lêro… N’akabà nanga, oyîsh’igutwa.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omukazi ògonyahire olwa-Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Anacibà adwîrhe ayigîriza omu sinagogi olwa-Sabato. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Mwâli mukazi muguma olimwo shetani w’obuzamba kurhenga byanda ikumi na munâni; erhi àgonyahire arhankanahash’icîyimusa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Erhi Yezu amubona, amuhamagala, anamubwîra, erhi: «Ewe nyoko, wamâfuma obuzamba bwâwe!» <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Okubundi amuhirakwo amaboko. Ho na halya, anacigonyôka, akuza Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Ci omukulu w’isinagogi akunira, bulya Yezu arnafumya omuntu omu lwa-Sabato. Anacibwîra olubaga, erhi: «Ensiku z’okukola ziri ndarhu; muli ezo nsiku mukayisha mufumibwe, ci arhali omu lwa-Sabato». <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Nyakasane anacishuza, erhi: «Ezi ndyâlya! Ka ngasi muntu muli mwe arhahulusa enkafu erhi endogomi yâge omu lusiku lwa Sabato, aj’iyinywêsa? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>N’oyu mwâli w’Abrahamu wali oziringisirwe na shetani kurhenga myâka ikumi na munâni, k’arhàli a­kwânîne yeki ashwêkûlwe ezi ngoyi olwa-Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Erhi aderha ntyo, enshonyi zagwârha abashombanyi bâge boshî, ci olubaga lwôhe lwoshi lwasîma ebirhangâzo byoshi akâg’ijira.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’emogomogo y’emburho y’esinapi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13, 31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrk 4, 30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Anaciderha, erhi: «Lwîganyo luci nankashushanya Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda? Cici nankabugererakwo? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Kwo buli nka mogomogo y’emburho y’esinapi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà amahugûlo: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:32">Mrk 4, 32</ref></char>. </char></note> omuntu ayankaga, ayimîra omu kwâge; yakula yanabà murhi, orhunyunyi rhw’emalunga rhwayish’ikayûbaka omu mashami gâgwo».<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’olwango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mat 13, 33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Ashub’iderha, erhi: «Cici nankagererakwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Migani minji ekulikirîne omu milongo yayisha aha idako</char></note> Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Kwo buli nka lwango omukazi ayankaga, aluheba omu nshâno ya mirengo isharhu, kuhika yoshi yalinda ebumbugurha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda, yo Ekleziya. Olwo lwango, lwo lwîganyo lw’Akanwa ka Mwâmi Yezu; n’enshâno lwahebwamwo, lyo igulu.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuhango mufunda. Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda bwanyagwa Abayahudi buhâbwe abapagani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7, 13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:10-12">25, 10-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:22-23">7, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:11-12">8, 11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:30">19, 30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mrk 10, 31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Aj’agera omu bishagala n’omu ngo, erhi aj’ayigîriza anali omu njira y’okujà e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Muntu muguma amubwîra, erhi: «Waliha, ka banyi bâyôkoke?» <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>Anacibashuza, erhi: «Mucîsêze okugerera omu muhango mufù­nda; bulya, mmubwîre, banji bayish’ilonza okugera barhanahashe. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>“Amango nnanyumpa abà amayimuka amânahamika olumvi, ninyu mwamayôrha e­mbuga, murhondêra mwakomamba, mpu”: “Mâshi Waliha, orhuyigulire nîrhu”, ayish’immushuza, erhi: “Ntishi muli ba ngahi”. <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>“Ninyu obwo mwârho­ndêre okumubwîra, mpu”: “Rhwalîre rhwananywa haguma nâwe, wayigîrize n’emwîrhu”. <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Naye anâmushuze, erhi: “Ntishi muli ba ngahi; ntengiho, mujè aha ntashigirwa, mwe banyankola-maligo mweshi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>“Lyo mwayish’ihôgera n’okukenyeza amîno, mubona Abrahamu n’Izaki na Yakôbo n’abalêbi boshi omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda, ninyu mubona oku mwakabulîrwe embuga”. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>“Bayish’ihubuka Ebushoshôkero<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Empande ini z’igulu oku muntu oyêrekire emunda izûba lishoshôka: Ebushoshôkero, Ebuzikiro, Ebumosho n’Ebulyo: kandi rhwanaderha, Buzûka-zûba, Buzika-zûba, Emwênè n’Emukondwè.</char></note> n’Ebuzikiro bw’izûba, Emwênè n’Emukondwè, bayish’ishangîra Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda”. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>“Nêci, hali abazinda bâbè barhanzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahâli h’okulonz’imanya erhi abîshogwa bâbè banyi erhi banji, kukwânîne okucîyunjuza lyo rhuyish’ibà omu bîshogwa. Bulya arhali okubà ba mulala gw’lhrahimu kwo kwankaciza omuntu; arhanali okubà omu barhanzi kwârhume abantu bacunguka, nanga! Cîntu ciguma cône cârhume rhwacunguka: okuyêmêra Kristu n’okucisêza okukulikira amarhegeko n’obulonza bwa Nnâmahanga. </char></note>, hali n’abarhanzi bâbè bazinda”».<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwenguza bwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Aho honênè, baguma omu Bafarizeyi bamujaho, banamubwîra, mpu: «Ogende, orhenge kuno, bulya Herodi alâlîre okukuniga». <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Anacibashuza, erhi: «Mugende, muj’ibwîra oyo nyambwe ntyâla: “K’orhabwîni, ndwîrhe nalibirhakwo bashetani, ndwîrhe nafumya abantu ene n’irhondo, n’olusiku lwa kasharhu nyûkirize<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okuyûkiriza kwa Yezu, kwo kufà n’okufûka kwâge.</char></note>!” <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>“Ci ene n’irhondo na lisirhondo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ene, irhondo na lisirhondo, zo nsiku Mwâmi Yezu aciri en’igulu. Hano ezo nsiku ziyu­njula, anagwârhwa aj’ifira omu Yeruzalemu.</char></note> kukwânîne ngende, bulya kurhali kwinjà omulêbi afîre omurhali omu Yeruzalemu”».<verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeruzalemu, Yeruzalemu!</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat 23, 37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>«Yeruzalemu, Yeruzalemu! Obu oniga abalêbi n’okubanda entumwa bakurhumirwe amabuye, kanga nalonzize okukumakuma abâna bâwe nka ku­lya engoko eyûbarhira abanangoko bâyo omu byûbi… orhanalonzagya! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Mumanyage! obu mukola mwâlekerwa enyumpa yinyu mushaka. Nêci, mmubwîzire oku murhakacishub’imbona kuhika olusiku mwâderhe, mpu: <char style="qt">Aganze oyishire oku izîno lya Nyakasane!</char>»<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya omuntu w’akabunda olwa-Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:11">Mat 12, 11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:15">Luk 13, 15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Okuhandi, olwa sabato Yezu anacijà omu mwa mukulu muguma w’omu Bafarizeyi mpu ayikule, nabo bakàmuhengûza. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Obwo erhi muntu muguma wa­lwâla akabunda ali embere zâge. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yezu anacibwîra abashamuka b’ihano n’A­bafarizeyi, erhi: «Ewe, ka kuyêmêrîrwe okufumya omu lwa-Sabato erhi nanga?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Bagumagumya. Anaciyanka olya mulwaâla, amufumya, amulika. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Okubundi ababwîra, erhi: «Ndi muli mwe, omugala, nîsi erhi enkafu yâge yankarhogera emugoke, alek’iyizikûla ho na halya omu lwa-Sabato?» <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Banacibula oku bankamushuza.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucîshoga ebibwârhalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23, 12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Okubundi atwa abàli balâlisirwe omugani, bulya amâbona okubacîshoga ebibwârhalo by’embere. Anacibabwîra, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>«Nka oli mulâlike oku buhya, orhahîra mpu ocidêkereze oku ntebe ntanzi, bulya erhi omukengwa kukulusha ankayisha anali mulâlike naye, <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>“owammulâlika mwe naye alek’ikubwîra, erhi”: “Hundusa oyu oku ntebe, lyo orhaj’itamala n’enshonyi oku ntebe y’enyuma”. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>“Ci irhondo okalâlikwa, onagend’icîtamalira oku ntebe nzinda, lyo owakulâlikaga, hano ayisha, akubwîra, erhi”: “Mwîra wâni, yegera embere!” “Obwo wanakengwa na balya muli balâlike mwe nabo”. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>“Bulya ngasi muntu ocîkuza arhôhibwa, naye ocirhohya akuzibwa”».<verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abakwânîne okulâlikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Anacibwîra n’olya wali omulâlisire, erhi: «Nka wajira idinie lya mûshi erhi lya bijingo, orhalâlikaga bîra bâwe, erhi bene winyu, erhi ab’omulala gwinyu, erhi bâlungwè bâwe bagale, lyo barhish’ikulâlika nabo, lunalek’ibà luhe­mbo lwâwe. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Ci nka wajira idinie, onahamagale abakenyi, ebirema, abakunagizi n’emihûrha. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Obwo wanayish’ibona iragi, kulya kubà barhagwêrhi eci­ bakugalulira! Bulya wayish’igalulirwa aha bufûke bw’abimâna».<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abalâlike balahiraga okuyisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:2-20">Mat 22, 2-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Muguma wa muli balya balâlike, erhi ayumva ntyo, amubwîra, erhi: «Iragi lyâge owânalye oku biryo by’omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Naye anacimushuza, erhi: «Muntu muguma anacijira idinie, alâlika bantu banji. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>“E­rhi amango g’okulya gahika, arhuma omwambali mpu aj’ilâlûla abalâlike, erhi”: “Mpu muyishage, bulya byoshi biri birheganye”. <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>“Ci bôhe babà nka balaganîne boshi, barhondêra okuhûna obwonjo. Omurhanzi, erhi”: “Nzind’igula ishwa, kukwânîne ngend’ilirhangula; nkuhûnyire, ombabalire”. <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>“Owundi, erhi”: “Nzind’igula mahali arhanu ga nkâfu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkâfu za kuhinga.</char></note>, nkol’ij’igagereza, nkuhûnyire, ombabalire”. <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>“Owundi aderha, erhi”: “Nzind’ijà omu buhya, co cirhumire ntayisha”. <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>“Olya muganda erhi agaluka, abwîra nnawâbo okwo. Nnanyumpa anacikunira, abwîra omwambali, erhi”: “Okanye, ojè omu mashanganizo n’omu njira, ngasi bali bakenyi n’ebirema, n’emihûrha, n’abakunagizi, obalêrhe”. <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>“Omwambali, erhi”: “Waliha, najizire nk’oku warhegekaga, n’obugali ho buciri”. <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>“Nnawâbo olya mushi amubwîra, erhi”: “Ogonye engo n’enjira, osêze abantu bayishe, kuhika enyumpa yâni eyunjule”. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>“Bulya mmubwîzire oku balya bantu bali balâlike barhâbayize ciru n’omuguma oku idinie lyâni”».<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owalonz’ishimba Yezu aleke byoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Ngabo nyinji yamukulikira. Anacihindamuka, ababwîra, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>«Omuntu walonz’inshimba, akabà arhashombiri îshe, na nnina, na mukâge, n’abâna bâge, na bene wâbo, na bâli bâbo, ciru n’obuzîne bwâge, arhankabà muganda wâni. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>“N’orhabarhwiri omusalaba gwâge, akankulikira, arhankabà muganda wâni”. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>“Ndi muli mwe, akalonz’iyûbaka omutungo, arharhang’ibwârhala, akaganja bici gwafà n’okulola erhi agwêrhe ezaguyunjuza”; <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>“arhag’ibanda eciriba busha arhanayunjuze omutungo, lyo n’abantu bagera barhamushekera, mpu”: <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>“Loli omuntu warhondêraga okuyûbaka, lêro ayabirwa n’okuyunjuza!” <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>“Nîsi, mwâmi ohi wankarhabala mpu aj’ilwîsa owâbo mwâmi, abule kurhang’ibwârhala agerêreze erhi n’omurhwe gwâge gwa bihumbi ikumi ahash’ikoza owâbo nn’ebihumbi makumi abiri?” <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>“Bulya erhi ankarhînya, anarhuma obugo, owâbo aciri kulî, ahûne mpu bayumvanye”. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>“Ntyo ninyu kwo na kuguma”: “ngasi yêshi orhalesiri ebi ajira, byoshi, arhankabà muganda wâni”».<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olwiganyo lw’omunyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5, 13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mrk 9, 50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>«Omunyu gubà mwinjà. “Ci kwônene erhi gwankagaga, bici gwankacilungwamwo?” <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>“Gurhankacikwânana omu ishwa ciru erhi oku câvu: gwanakabu­lirwa erubala”. “Ogwêrhe amarhwîri g’okuyumva, ayumve!”»<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Migani isharhu y’olukogo lwa Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Obwo abavurhisa n’abanyabyâha bamulirâna boshi mpu bayumve e­nyigîrizo zâge. <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Lêro Abafarizeyi n’abashamuka b’ihano bakadwira omu nda nk’ihiri, mpu: «Oyu muntu adwîrhe ayankirira abanya-byâha analîra haguma nabo!»<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">1. Ecibuzi cihezire</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat 18, 12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Anacibatwa ogu mugani, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>«Ndi muli mwe ojira bibuzi byâge igana, ciguma cikahera, orhaleka birya bindi makumi gali mwenda na mwenda omu bulambo, akakulikira cirya cihezire kuhika acibone? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>“N’erhi acirhimâna, anacihira abà lurhugo n’obushagaluke”. <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>“Erhi ahika eka, anayâkûza abîra n’abalungu bâge, ababwîre, erhi”: “Musîme haguma nâni, bulya ecibuzi câni, càli cihezire, nacibwîne!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>“Kwo n’okwo, mmubwîre, bwayish’ibà bushagaluke omu mpingu oku munya-byâha muguma ocîyunjuzize kulusha bantu makumi gali mwenda na mwenda bimâna barhalagiriri okucîyunjuza”».<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">2. Obujuma buhezire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>«Nîsi, mukazi ohi ogwêrhe ifundo ly’amagerha, liguma limuhere, abule kutwâna n’okuhyajira enyumpa, alongereze kuhika alirhôle? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>“N’erhi abà amalirhôla, anayâkûza abîra-kazi n’abalungu bâge, erhi”: “Musîme haguma nâni, bulya igerha lyàli limpezire nalibwîne!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>“Kwo n’okwo, mmubwîre, hayish’ibà obushagaluke emwa bamalahika ba Nyamuzinda oku munya-byâha muguma ocîyunjuzize”».<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">3. Omwâna mulalahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Ashub’iderha, erhi: «Muntu muguma agwârhe bagala babiri. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>“Omurhò anacibwîra îshe, erhi”: “Larha, mpânâni ebyâni birugu by’obwîme”. “Îshe anacibagabira ebirugu byâge”, <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>“Erhi hagera nsiku nyi, olya mwâna ashana ebikunga, alîkûla, ajà omu cihugo c’ihanga, erhi ahikayo, ashandâza ebirugu byâge omu bulalahi”. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>“Erhi ab’amâhwerwa na byoshi, ecizombo cikali cazûka mulya cihugo, abona oku amâkena”. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>“Anacikanya, aj’ishiga mushamuka muguma wa muli cirya cihugo, anacimuhira oku irango mpu akamuyâbulira engulube”. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>“Obwo akacîfinja okushalûka n’ebyûla, engulube zàkâg’irya; ci abula ciru owamuhâbyo”. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>“Acîjamwo, erhi”: “Bashi banga babà aha mwîrhu badwîrhe bayigurha, nâni oku nafira eno munda n’ishali!” <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>“Ema! Nkola nalikûla, njè emunda larha ali, mubwîre, nti”: “Larha, nabihîre Nnâmahanga nâwe”. <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>“Ntacishingânîni okuderhwa mugala wâwe: onjire nka muguma omu bambali bâwe”. <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>“Anacigandûla, ajà emw’îshe”. “Erhi abà aciri kuli, îshe amulangira, ayumva o­bwonjo bwamugwârha; anaciyisha ali bulibirha, amuyâbabira, amuhôbera”. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>“Omugala amubwîra, erhi”: “Larha, nabihîre Nyamuzinda nâwe, ntacishingânîni nderhwe mugala wâwe”». <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Obwo îshe abwîra abambali, erhi: «Mubanguke, mulêrhe gulya mwambalo gw’obulimbi, mumuyambike; mumuhire engolo ekuboko n’enkwêrho emagulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Mulêrhe ecimasha cishushagîre, muci­bâge, rhulye rhunajire olusiku lukulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>Bulya oyu mwâna wâni ali afîre, lêro afûsire; àli ahezire, lêro abonesire!» Banacirhondêra okujira olusiku lukulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>Obwo enfula yâge erhi yahinzire. Erhi afuluka, akol’ahika eka, ayumva omulimba gw’ennanga n’amasâmo. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Anacikema mwambali wâbo muguma, amudôsa, kurhi. <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Naye amushuza, erhi: «Mulumuna wâwe oyo oyishire; sho amabâga ecimasha cishushagîre, bulya amubwîne mugumagumà». <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Anacikunira bwenêne, arhanacilonzagya ciru okujà omu nyumpa. Okubundi îshe ahuluka mpu amuyinginge. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Ci yêhe ashuza îshe, erhi: «Ndi byanda binga erhi kukukolera nkukolera? Ntazig’ivuna omu kanwa kâwe ciru n’eliguma. K’oj’o­ mpîre nieki ciru omwâna-hene mpu mmulye nanjiremwo idinie rhwe n’abîrhu?» <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>«Lêro ene mugala wâwe waherezagya ebyâge byoshi omu bakazi b’ebishungu ayisha, yêhe wamâmubâgira ecimasha cishushagîre!» <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Îshe anacimubwîra, erhi: «Mwâna wâni, wêhe ensiku zoshi rhubà rhwembi, n’ebyâni byoshi bibà byâwe. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>“Ci kwàli kurhuyâmânîne okujira olusiku lukulu n’okushagaluka, bulya mulumuna wâwe àli afîre, lêro afûsire; àli ahezire, lêro abonesire!”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Omulanzi mulangûza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Ashub’ibwîra abaganda bâge; erhi: «Hàli mulume muguma mugale, erhi ajira omurhindisi w’ebirugu byâge. Banacimushobeka emwa nnawâbo mpu adwîrhe ashandâza ebirugu byâge. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>“Amurhumiza, amubwîra, erhi”: “Kurhi kulya nayumvîrhe baderha kuli we? Nyêreka ebirugu olanga, bulya orhacibè murhindisi”». <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Olya murhindisi anacirhanya, erhi: «Lêro kurhi najira obu nnawîrhu antenza omu burhindisi bwâni? Okuhinga ntakuhashe, n’okujà nahûna nka mukenyi, enshonyi zayish’ingwârha. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Namâmanya oku najira lyo nyish’ibona owanyigulira hano nkûlwa omu burhindisi». <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Okubundi ahamagala muguma muguma abàli omu myenda ya nnawâbo. Anacidôsa omurhanzi, erhi: «Mwenda muci walîre nnawîrhu?» <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Naye, erhi: «Mirengo igana ya mavurha». Amubwîra, erhi: «Yanka ecêrhè câwe, bwârhala, oyandike duba makumi arhanu». <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Anacibwîra owundi, erhi: «Nâwe, mwenda muci walîre nnawîrhu?» Naye, erhi: «Mirengo igana ya ngano». Amubwîra, erhi: «Yanka ecêrhè câwe, oyandike makumi gali munâni». <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Nnawâbo olya mulanzi mulangûza amukunga mpu ajizire obwenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arhali bubî bw’oyo mulanzi bwo nnawâbo amukungire, ci bwenge n’obwîrhonzi bwâge, bw’okurheganya amango akabà arhacigzerhi burhindisi. Oku mukristu gali amango rhwarhenga en’igulu, ebi rhwaligwerheyo byoshi byasigala. </char></note>. Bulya abâna b’er’igulu bo bayengeha omu bâbo kulusha abâna b’obulangashane.<verse eid="LUK 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukolêsa kwinjà ebirugu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:21">Mat 25, 21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:17">Luk 19, 17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6, 24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>«Nâni mmubwîzire nti mukome amîra n’ebirugu by’enshamu, hano mubinyagwa, lyo abo bîra bammuyankiriza omu ibwârhalo ly’emyâka erhaganjwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Omuntu ôbà mwîkubagirwa omu binyi, ye na mwîkubagirwa omu binene; n’ôbà ncuku omu binyi, ye na ncuku omu binene. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Mukabà murhabîri bikubagirwa omu birugu by’enshamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebirugu by’enshamu, byo birugu byoshi birhukwânana oku by’en’igulu; n’ebirugu by’okunali, byo birhukwânana oku mûka n’oku buzîne bw’ensiku n’amango.</char></note>, ndi wankaciyish’immulangîsa ebirugu by’okunali? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Na mukabà murhali bikubagirwa omu kantu ka bene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngasi kantu karhakwânîni oku mûka gwîrhu n’oku buzîne bwîrhu bw’ensiku n’amango, kali kantu ka bene. Ehirhu, hyo hirya hyankarhurhabâla okuyish’icunguka.</char></note>, ndi wankacimmuha ehyabà hinyu? <verse eid="LUK 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>Ntà mushi wankashiga bâmi babiri: bulya ana­shomba muguma azigîre owundi, erhi acîshwêkere kuli muguma, ajande owundi. Murhankahash’ikolera Nyamuzinda n’ebirugu».<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abafarizeyi basîma ebirugu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 18:9">Luk 18, 9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:28">Mat 23, 28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Abafarizeyi basîma ebirugu erhi bayumva ntyo, bamugayaguza bwenêne. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Mwe muciderha bimâna embere z’abantu, ci Nyamuzinda amanyire emirhima yinyu. Bulya eci abantu bakûnga, co cishologorha Nyamuzinda».<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Misî egaba Obwâmi bw’empingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mat 11, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>«Kuhika Yowane gàli Marhegeko n’Abalêbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Embere Mwâmi Yezu ayishe, Amarhegeko n’enyigîrizo z’Abalêbi birhahikaga omu bulonza n’omu mirhima y’abantu. Buno, Amarhegeko garhaciri manjî, likola liguma lyône: obuzigire n’okucisêza omu kukolera Nnâmahanga.</char></note>; kurhenga aho, Emyanzi y’Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda yayigîrizibwe, na ngasi muntu akola acîsêza okuhikamwo n’emisî».<verse eid="LUK 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amarhegeko gali g’ensiku n’amango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:18">Mat 5, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>«Kuli kulembu irunga n’igulu bigere kulusha okurhenza mparafu nguma y’Irhegeko».<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuhya liri ifundo lirhankafundûka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5, 32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19, 9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>«Ngasi yêshi ohulusa mukâge akanayanka owundi, erhi kuhusha ahushire; naye oherula omukazi ohulusîbwe n’ibà, erhi kuhusha ahushire».<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugale mubî na Lazaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Hàli muntu muguma mugale, erhi ayambala emyenda midukula n’ey’ecitwîro cihamu, na ngasi lusiku erhi kulya ebiryo by’olusiku lukulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Hàbaga na mukenyi muguma, ye Lazaro, akayish’icîlambulira aha lusò lw’e­ nyumpa yâge, anali ahwîre bulema. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Akacîfinja okulya obushangulikiza bwakag’irhoga oku cîbo c’olya mugale. Ebibwa nabyo byakamugugumakwo, byanakamumîma ebihulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Lêro olya mukenyi anacifà, ahêkwa na bamalahika omu cifuba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okuhêkwa omu cifuba c’Abrahamu, kwo kuhêkwa omu Bwâmi bw’empingu n’okuj’isîmamwo haguma n’Abrahamu, îshe w’abemêzi boshi.</char></note> c’Abrahamu. Olya mugale naye afà, abishwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Erhi abà akola ali omu kuzimu, ayumva amalibuko; agalamira enyanya, alangira Abrahamu na Lazaro omu cifuba câge. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Anaciyâkûza, erhi: «Mâshi larha Abrahamu, ombabalire, orhume Lazaro avumvuze omunwe gwâge omu mîshi, nyokolesemwo olulimi, bulya nahîre ntugurhira muno muliro. <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>“Abrahamu amushuza, erhi”: “Mwâna wâni, okengêre oku wahâbirwe aminjà omu bugumaguma bwâwe n’oku Lazaro abwîne amabî. Lêro buno akola asîmire, nâwe oli omu malibuko”. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>“Na kulusha aho, aha karhî kîrhu ninyu hali enyenga ndi: ngasi balonza okuhubuka eno mpu bajè emwinyu banayabirwa, n’ab’eyo barhayikirira emwîrhu”». <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Olya mugale anacishuza, erhi: «Nkuhûnyirage, mâshi larha, orhume Lazaro aha mwîrhu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>“bulya njira bene wîrhu barhanu”; “abayigîrize”, “balek’iyish’ijà muno hantu h’amalibuko”». <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Naye Abrahamu, erhi: «Bagwêrhe Mûsa n’Abalêbi; babayumve». <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Olya mugale amushuza, erhi: «Arhali ntyo, mâshi larha Abrahamu, ci muguma omu bafîre erhi ankajà emwâbo, banacîyunjuza». <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Abrahamu anacimubwîra, erhi: «Bakabà barhayumvirhizi Mûsa n’Abalêbi, ciru hankabà owafûka omu bafîre ababwîrize, naye barhankamuyumva».<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Owasârhaze owâbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat 18, 6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrk 9, 42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Anacibwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: «Kurhankahashikana harhabè okusârhaza, ci kwônene buhanya bwâge owâkulerhe!» <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Kwankamukwânana kulusha ashwêkerwe ibuye ly’olwanjikwa omu igosi anakwêbwe omu nyanja, ahâli h’okusârhaza muguma muli abà bâna barhò. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Mucîlange!</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 17:3">Okurhabâla ohabire n’okubabalira orhutumuzize</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 17:3">(<ref loc="MAT 18:15">Mat 18, 15</ref>.<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">«Erhi owinyu ankajira kubî, omukalihire, n’akacîgaya, omubabalire». <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>«Ciru ankakubîhira kali nda omu lusiku luguma na kali nda akuyishire, erhi: “Ncîgayire”, “onamubabalire”».<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obuyêmêre buhasha byoshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17, 20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Entumwa zabwîra Nyakasane, mpu: «Orhuyûshûlire obuyêmêre». <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Nyakasane ashuza, erhi: «Mucigwârhaga obuyêmêre bungana emogomogo y’e­mburho y’esinapi, mwânabwîra ogu murhi, mpu: “Kunduka, oj’imera mula nyanja”, gwanammuyumva».<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okurhumikira abirhu n’obwirhobye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>«Ndi muli mwe ojira omwambali ohinga nîsi erhi oyâbula ebintu, wa­nkamubwîra afuluka, erhi: “Kanya duba oj’irya?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>“Abule okumubwîra erhi­ kwo, erhi”: “Onteganyize ebiryo, ohwinje bwinjà, ontumikire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ontumikire, kurhumikira, kurhumika cirhali «ciswahiri» mpu: «kutumikia»</char></note> kuhika nyûs’irya nanyûs’inywa; nâwe ogal’iyish’irya onanywe?”» <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Ewe! K’anavuga oyo mwa­mbali omunkwa bulya ajizire nka oku ali arhegesirwe? <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Ninyu kwo n’okwo; nka mwamayûs’ijira ebi murhegesirwe, muderhe, mpu: «Rhuli barhumisi ba busha; ntâco rhwajizire cirhàli cirhegeke».<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afumya bashomyo ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Kwanacibà, erhi akola ali omu njira y’okujà e Yeruzalemu, agera elubibi lw’e Samâriya n’olw’e Galileya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Erhi ajà omu cishagala ciguma, bantu ikumi balwâla olushomyo bamujayo. Bayimanga kulî. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Banaciyakûza, mpu: «Mâshi Yezu Mwigiriza, orhufè nîrhu bwonjo» <verse eid="LUK 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Erhi ababona, ababwîra, erhi: «Mugendag’icîyêrekana emwa abadâhwa». Erhi bakola bali omu njira mpu bayije, banacifuma. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Muguma muli bo, erhi abona oku afumire, agaluka, aj’akuza Nnâmahanga n’izù linene. <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Acîrhimba aha magulu ga Yezu, amuvuga omunkwa. Oyo muntu àli Musamâriya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Obwo Yezu anaciderha, erhi: «K’arhali oku banali ikumi boshi bafumire? Balya bandi mwenda ngahi? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Ntà wundi wagalusire mpu ahè Nyamuzinda irenge ecirhali eci cigolo conene!» <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Okubundi amubwîra, erhi: «Yimanga, ocîgendere; obwêmêre bwâwe bwa­ kucizize».<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obwâmi bwa Nnâmahanga bwayishire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Abafarizeyi bamudôsa mpu mangaci Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda bwâyishe. Anacibashuza, erhi: «Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda burhamanywa amango buyisha, <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>na ntâye wankaderha mpu: bwo buno nîsi erhi bwo bulà! Bulya O­bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buli ekarhî kinyu».<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Olusiku lwa Mwene-omuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-44">Mat 24, 15-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Anacibwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: «Ensiku zaciyisha, mucîfinje okubona lusiku luguma lwa Mwene-omuntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amango amalumwa gabayishira, abaganda ba Yezu bayish’icîfinja okubona Yezu ciru lusiku luguma, mpu abarhulirize, barhanamubone. </char></note>, murhanalubone. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>“Bayish’ikammubwîra, mpu”: “Y’oyo oli hano! nîsi, mpu”: “Y’oyo oli hala! Murhayijaga murhanayilibirhiraga”. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>“Bulya nka kulya omulazo gumoleka omu bitù kurhenga Ebushoshôkero kuhika Ebuzikiro, ntyo kwo Mwene omuntu ayish’iyisha Olusiku lwâge”. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>“Kwônene burhanzi kukânîne ababale kunene n’okulahirwa n’eri iburha”. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>“Nka kulya byàbaga omu mango ga Nûhu, kwo byanayish’ibà omu nsiku za Mwene-omuntu”. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>“Bakâg’ilya banakanywa, bakasheba banakashebwa, kuhika lulya lusiku Nûhu ajaga omu nkugè; ecihonzi càyisha, càbaho­mbya boshi”. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>“Na nka kulya byàbaga omu mango ga Loti, bakalya banakanya, banagula banakaguza, bakabiba banakayûbaka”. <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>“Ci olusiku Loti arhengaga e Sodomo, enkuba y’omuliro n’ey’ecibiriti yania, yabasingônola boshi.” <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>“Ntyo kwo byayish’ibà Olusiku Mwene-omuntu anaciyêrekane”. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Muli olwo Lusiku, omuntu wâbè oku burhungiri bw’enyumpa, akabà ebirugu byâge biri omu nyumpa, arhayandagalaga mpu abirhôle; n’owâbè ali omu ishwa, kwo na kuguma, arhashubiraga nyuma”. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>“Mukengêre olwa mukà-Loti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Olwa mukà’Loti: Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 19:26">Murh 19, 26</ref></char>.</char></note>.” <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>“Owâlonze okuciza obuzîne bwâge, anâbuheze, n’owâbuheze, anâbulamye”. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>“Ka mmubwîre: muli obwo budufu, bantu babiri bâbè bali haguma aha ncingo nguma, muguma ahêkwe n’owâbo alekwe”; <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>“bakazi babiri bâbè badwîrhe bashwera haguma, muguma ahêkwe n’owâbo alekwe”; [<verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>“bantu babiri banâbè bali omu ishwa, muguma ahêkwe n’owâbo alekwe]”». <verse eid="LUK 17:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Nabo banacimushuza, mpu: «Ngahi, Waliha?» Ababwîra, erhi: «Ngasi aha omurhumba gwâbè ho n’enyunda zâshubûkire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kulya enyunda zicigusha ahâli omurhumba, ziyigurhe, ntyo kwo n’abîshogwa bayish’ishubûkira Mwâmi Yezu omu lusiku lw’amasîma garhahwa.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Omucîranuzi mubî n’omukana orhagoheka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Ashub’ibabwîra omugani mpu kukwânîne okushenga ensiku zoshi buzira kurhama, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>«Omu cìshagala ciguma mwâli omutwî w’emmanja orhàrhînyaga Nyamuzinda arhanacigonzagya ndi. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>“Muli eco cishagala mwâli na mukana muguma; akamushimba anamubwîra, erhi”: “Ontwîre olubanja rhwe n’owîrhu!” <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>“Ajira nsiku nyinji erhi arhenguha. Buzinda acîjà emurhima, erhi: Ciru akabà ntarhînya Nyamuzinda ntanacigonza ndi”, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>“obu oyu mukana anakambera irhwe, namutwîra olubanja, lyo arhakômerera okukayish’imbera irhwe”». <verse eid="LUK 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Okubundi Nyakasane anaciderha, erhi: «Ka muyumvîrhe oku oyo mucîranuzi mulyâlya adesire? <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>“Ewe, ka Nnâmahanga abîshogwa bâge bamubirikira buca-buyira arhabatwîra olubanja? K’alegam’ibarhabâla?” <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>“Mmubwîzire oku ayish’ibatwîra olubanja duba. Kwônene, k’amango Mwene-omuntu ayisha anâshimâne obuyêmêre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:2">Mat 24, 2</ref></char>: «Bulya amabî gayish’iyûshûka, obuzigire bwa banji bwânyihe».</char></note> en’igulu?”».<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omufarizeyi n’omuvurhîsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23, 12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14, 11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Nabo balya bamanya mpu bali bimâna banagayaguza abâbo, ababwîra ogu mugani, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>«Bantu babiri banacirheremera omu ka-Nyamuzinda mpu baj’ishenga; muguma àli Mufarizeyi n’owâbo muvurhîsa. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>“Olya Mufarizeyi ashingalala, ashenga ntya emurhima gwâge, erhi”: “Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, nkuvuzire omunkwa, bulya niehe ntabà nk’abandi bantu, bishungu, ndyâlya, bago­nyi, erhi nka oyu muvurhîsa”; <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>“ncîshalisa kabiri omu mugobe, nantûla ecihimbi ca kali ikumi c’ebirugu byâni byoshi”. <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>“Olya muvurhîsa yêhe aj’icîbêrera erhali hôfi, arhanaderhaga ciru mpu agalamire enyanya, ci akacîkomamba ecifuba, erhi”: “Yâgirwa Nnâmahanga, onfè bwonjo nie munya-byâha!” <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>“Mmubwîzire oku oyu ashubîre emwâge ali mwêru-kwêru, owâbo nanga. Bulya ngasi ocîkuza arhôhibwa, n’ocirhôhya akuzibwa”».<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu agisha abâna barhò</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrk 10, 13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Bakamulerhera ciru n’abâna barhò mpu abahumekwo. Abaganda bâge erhi babona ntyo, babakalihira. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Ci Yezu abahamagala, erhi: «Muleke bajè aha ndi, mumanye murhabahanzagya. Bulya ababashusha, Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buli bwâbo. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Okuli, mmubwîre, orhayankiriri Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda nka mwâna murhò, arhakabujamwo».<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuntu wali ogwêrhe birugu binji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-22">Mat 19, 16-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-22">Mrk 10, 17-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Murhambo muguma amudôsa, erhi: «Waliha Mwigîriza mwinjà, kurhi njirage lyo mbona akalamo k’ensiku n’amango?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yezu amubwîra, erhi: «Cirhumire onderha mwinjà? Ntâye ôbà mwinjà aha nyuma za Nnâmahanga yênene. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Oyishi amarhegeko: <char style="qt">Orhahîra okahusha, orhahîra okaniga, orhahîra okazimba, orhahîra okahamîriza obunywesi; okaz’ikenga sho na nyoko»</char>. <verse eid="LUK 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>O­lya naye, erhi: «Ebyo byoshi nyôrha mbishimba kurhenga oburhò bwâni». <verse eid="LUK 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yezu erhi ayumva okwo, amubwîra, erhi: «Ciguma cône cikusigalîre: ebi ojira byoshi obiguze, ohè abakenyi, wayish’ibà n’omuhako omu mpingu; okuhandi oyîshe, onkulikire». <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Ci yêhe erhi ayumva ntyo, oburhè bwamu­gwârha, bulya ali mugale bwenêne.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhika omu mpingu kw’omugale kuli kudârhi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:23-26">Mat 19, 23-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:23-27">Mrk 10, 23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yezu erhi abona oku agayire, aderha, erhi: «Okuhika omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda kw’o­ mugale kuli kudârhi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Bulya okugeza enjavu omu murhule gw’ensinge kwo kulembu kulusha okuhisa omugale omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda!» <verse eid="LUK 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Abayumvagya baderha, mpu: «Ndi wâcungukage obwo?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Anacibashuza, erhi: «Okurhankahashikana emw’abantu, kwanahashikana emwa Nnâmahanga».<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluhembo lw’abalesire eby’en’igulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:27-29">Mat 19, 27-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:28-30">Mrk 10, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Obwo Petro anaciderha, erhi: «Obu rhuli aha, rhwalesire byoshi, rhwa­kushimba!» <verse eid="LUK 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Naye ababwîra, erhi: «Okuli, mmubwîre, ntâye wâleke enyumpa yâge, erhi mukâge, erhi bene wâbo, erhi ababusi, erhi abâna bâge Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda burhumire, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>abule kuhâbwa binji kulusha en’igulu n’akalamo karhahwa omu mango gâciyisha».<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu alêba obwa kasharhu oku ayish’ibabazibwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrk 10, 32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Okubundi Yezu ayanka balya ikumi na babiri, ababwîra, erhi: «Rhw’ono rhwâyinamukira e Yeruzalemu: ebyayandikiragwa Mwene-omuntu n’Abalêbi byoshi bikola byâyunjula. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Bulya ayish’ihânwa emwa abapagani, ashekerwe, ajâcirwe, anamesherwekwo. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Na babà bamamushûrha emikoba, bamuyîrhe. Ci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«ci» ahâli ha «na», biyêrekîne oku Luka ayishi ecigereki bwinjà. Abâbo bakâg’ihiraho «na» n’obwo ye «waw» kantalinganana oyu w’ecihebraniya erhi ciharamiya. Abâbo barhabonaga oyo «waw» bahira ho «kai» orhenzire omu waw inversif gwârhi abanfransa, kuderha «na», amango wamâbikulikanya ecigereki.</char></note> olwa nsiku isharhu ayish’ifûka». <verse eid="LUK 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Ako kanwa barhakatwâga ihuzihuzi ciru ehitya; lwayôrha luderho lufulike kuli bo, barhanamanyaga kwo kuderha kuci.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuhûrha gw’e Yeriko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrk 10, 46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Erhi akola ahika e Yeriko, omuhûrha gwàli gutamîre eburhambi bw’e­njira, gudwîrhe gwahûnira obuligo. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Erhi guyumva engabo yagera, gwadôsa mpu kwo kuderha kurhi okwo. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Bagubwîra, mpu: «Yezu w’e Nazareti oyo wagera». <verse eid="LUK 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Gwanaciyakûza, erhi: «Mâshi Yezu, Mwene-Daudi, onfè nâni bwonjo!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Nabo abantu bâli bashokwîre bagukankamira mpu guhulike. Ci gôhe gwahangaza, gwalushîsa, erhi: «Mâshi Mwene-Daudi, onfè nâni bwonjo!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Obwo Yezu anaciyimanga, arheregeka mpu bamulêrhere oyo muntu. Erhi amuhikaho, amudôsa, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>«Cici walonza nkujirire?» - Naye, erhi: «Yâgirwa, nti mbone nâni!» <verse eid="LUK 18:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yezu amubwîra, erhi: «Bonaga! Obuyêmêre bwâwe bwakufumize». <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Ho na halya ayirukira abona; amukulikira, aj’akuza Nnâmahanga. Nalwo olubaga erhi lubona, okwo, lwajîra Nyamuzinda irenge.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Zakeyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Erhi ajà omu Yeriko, ahulukana omu lugo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Hanaciyisha mulume muguma, mpu ye Zakeyo; àli mukulu w’abavurhîsa, anali mugale. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Alonza okulolakwo Yezu n’okumumanya, ci ayabirwa erhi ngabo nyinji erhuma, bulya ali mmofi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Okubundi anacikanyiriza, ashokola, aj’ishigira oku muhumbahumba, mpu amubone, bulya yo yali njira yâge. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Erhi Yezu ahahika, agalamira enyanya, amubwîra, erhi: «Zakeyo we, shonôka duba, bulya ene aha mwâwe najà». <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Anacishonôka bimbirirnbiri, amuyankirira aha mwâge n’omwîshingo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Ngasi bantu babonaga, bakacîduduma boshi n’okuderha, mpu: «Ahanzire aha mw’omunya-byâha!» <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Zakeyo ayimanga, abwîra Nyakasane, erhi: «Waliha, ebirugu byâni nâbigabamwo kabiri, mpè abakenyi cigabi ciguma; n’akabà hali oyu nalenganyize oku byâge, nâmugalulira kâni». <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yezu anacimubwîra, erhi: «Ene obucire bwajîre mw’eno nyumpa, bulya oyu naye ali mwâna w’Abrahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Bulya Mwene-omuntu ayishiraga okulonza n’okuciza ngasi càli cahezire».<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’amarhale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat 25, 14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Erhi olubaga lubà ludwîrhe lwayumvirhiza ebyo binwa, ashub’ibatwa omugani, bulya ali hôfi n’e Yeruzalemu, nabo erhi badwîrhe bacikêbwa mpu Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda bwâyirukira bwaboneka caligumiza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Enyigîrizo n’ebisômerîne bya Mwâmi Yezu byàli bimanyisize abantu oku ye Masiha. Co cirhumire bâli balangâlire mpu nkaba akola arhondêra Obwâmi bwâge. Ogu mugani guli gwa kumanyîsa oku buciri kulî</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Anaciderha, erhi: «Muluzi muguma anacilîkûla, abalamira omu cihugo c’ihanga, mpu aj’irhôlayo obwâmi, ashub’inagaluka. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>“Ahamagala bambali ikumi, abahà marhale ikumi ga magerha, ababwîra, erhi”: “Mukârhimbûla kuhika ngaluke”». <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Ci abashi bâge erhi bamushomba; bamukulikiza entumwa zaj’iderha, mpu: «Rhurhalonza rhumushige». <verse eid="LUK 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>Okubundi erhi agaluka anacîyankiraga bulya bwâmi, arhumiza balya Bashi ahâga amagerha gâge, mpu alole bunguke buci ngasi muguma ayungusire. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Omurhanzi ayisha, erhi: «Waliha, irhale lyâwe lyayungusire marhale ikumi». <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Amubwîra, erhi: «Kwokwo, mushizi mwinjà bulya wabîre mwîkubagirwa oku kantu kasungunu, okolaga walagira bishagala ikumi». <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Owa kabiri ayisha, erhi: «Waliha, irhale lyâwe lyayungusire marhale arhanu». <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Anacimubwîra naye, erhi: «Warhegeka nâwe bishagala birhanu». <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Owundi ayisha, erhi: «Waliha, irhale lyâwe eri nal’imbîsire libohe omu irhù. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Bulya nal’inkuyôbohire, kulya kubà orhahimwa kukaliha: onabîkûle eci orhabîkaga, onasârûle eci orhahingaga». <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Anacimubwîra, erhi: «Oku kanwa kâwe wênene nâkutwîra, wâni mushizi mubî! Wali omanyire oku ndi muntu mukali, obîkûla eci arhabîkaga n’osârûla eci arhahingaga! <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Carhumirage amagerha gâni orhagahêka omu mbîko? K’erhi nyisha ntakabwinekwo obunguke?» <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Okubundi abwîra abambali, erhi: «Mumuyanke irhale lyâge, mulihe nna-marhale ikumi». <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Nabo, mpu: «Waliha, ci agwêrhe marhale ikumi!». <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>«Ka mmubwîre: ngasi ogwêrhe ye wayish’ihâbwa, acibêre mugale; naye orhagwêrhi, n’ebinyi agwêrhe bamunyagusâbyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Nabo abashombanyi bâni bàlahiraga mpu ntabè nnawâbo, mubandêrhere, munabanigire omu malanga gâni».<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="ms1">V. Enyigîrizo za Yezu omu Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ajà omu Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mrk 11, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-16">Ywn 12, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Erhi ayûs’iganîra ntyo, anacishokola, ayinamukira e Yeruzalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Erhi akola ahika e Betifaje n’e Betaniya, hôfi n’entondo y’Emizêti, arhuma babiri omu baganda bâge, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>«Jimwo cira cishagala cirhuyêrekire; hano muhika­mwo, mwâshimâna omucukà gw’endogomi gurhasâg’igendwakwo na muntu guli mushwêke. Mugushwêkûle munagulêrhe. <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>“Na hakabà owammudôsa, mpu”: “Cici mugushwêkûlîre?” “Munamubwîre, mpu”: “Nyakasane wagulonza”». <verse eid="LUK 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Banacilîkûla, bashimâna nka kulya anababwîraga. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>N’erhi babà bakola ba­dwîrhe bashwêkûla gulya mucûkà gw’endogomi, bênego bababwîra, mpu: «Cici mwashwêkûlira ogwo mucûkà gw’endogomi?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Nabo bashuza, mpu: «Nyakasane agulonza». <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Okubundi balêrhera Yezu gulya mucûkà gw’e­ ndogomi. Banacigubambakwo ebishûli byâbo, bashonezakwo Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>N’erhi abà akola adwîrhe agenda, abantu bakabamba ebishûli byâbo omu njira. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>E­erhi ahika oku mwandagalo gw’entondo y’Emizêti, omu bushagaluke, engabo y’abaganda bâge yoshi yarhondêra okukuza Nyamuzinda n’izù linene oku bisômerîne byoshi babwîne, mpu: <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>«<char style="qt">Agayirwe oyu Mwâmi oyishire oku izîno lya Nyakasane! Omurhûla omu irunga n’irenge enyanya bwenêne!</char>»<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ayêmêra obukuze bw’abaganda bâge (Ml 21, 14-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Obwo baguma omu Bafarizeyi bâli omu lubaga bamubwîra, mpu: «Mwigîriza, hulisa abaganda bâwe». <verse eid="LUK 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Naye abashuza, erhi: «Mmubwîzire oku erhi bankahulika, amabuye ganayâma».<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu àlakira Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Erhi akola ahika omu cishagala, arhondêra okucilakira, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>«Ocimanyage nâwe olusiku lw’ene ebyakulerhera omurhûla! Ci buno bifulisirwe omu masù gâwe. <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Bulya ensiku zâcikuyishira, abashombanyi bâwe bâkugorhe banakuzonge enyunda zoshi, <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>bâkushekenye oku idaho we n’abâna bâwe bakulimwo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bulya barhayankiriraga Mwâmi Yezu wal’ibalêrhera enshôkano n’obuzigire bw’Îshe Nyamuzinda. Obwo bulêbi buyêrekîre okushâbwa kwa Yeruzalemu omu mwâka gwa kali 70 enyuma za Kristu.</char></note>. Ciru barhakakulekerakwo ibuye oku lindi, kulya kubà orhamanyaga amango wal’irhandûlwa».<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu àhulusa abakâg’iguliza omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21, 12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mrk 11, 15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:14-16">Ywn 2, 14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Anacijà omu ka-Nyamuzinda, arhondêra okuhulusa abakâg’iguliza n’okuguliramwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Kuyandisirwe oku: Enyumpa yâni eri nyumpa ya kushengeramwo. Mwêhe mwayijizirage ishubûkiro lya bishungu»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Iz 56, 7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yer 7, 11</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyigîrizo za Yezu omu ka-Nyamuzinda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:18">Mat 11, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Akayigîriza ngasi lusiku omu ka-Nyamuzinda. Abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano n’abarhambo b’olubaga bakâlonza oku bamuyîrhamwo, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>ci bakubula, bulya olubaga lwoshi lwàli lumurhegîre omu kuyumvîrhiza enyigîrizo zâge.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Abayahudi badôsa Yezu ngahi obuhashe bwâge burhenga (Mat 21. 23-27; Mrk 11, 27-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Lusiku luguma anacibà adwîrhe ayigîriza omu ka-Nyamuzinda anahanûla Emyanzi y’Akalembe, abajinji, b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano n’abagula bw’olubaga bayisha. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Banacimubwîra, mpu: «Rhubwîre buhashe buci ojiramwo ebi byoshi? Nîsi ndi wakuhaga weki obu buhashe?» <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yezu anacibashuza, ababwîra, erhi: «Nâni nammudôsa kanwa kaguma. Mbwîri: <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>Obubatizo bwa Yowane, k’empingu bwahubukaga erhi emw’abantu?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Bajânamwo bône na nnene, mpu: «Rhukaderha nti empingu, akola arhudôsa, erhi: “Carhumaga murhacimuyêmêra?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>“Na rhukaderha nti e­mw’abantu, olubaga lwoshi lwanarhubanda amabuye, bulya bayishi bwinjà oku Yowane anali mulêbi”». <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Okubundi banacishuza, mpu barhayishi aha bwahubukaga. <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Naye Yezu ababwîra, erhi: «Nâni ntammubwîre ninyu buhashe buci njiramwo ebi».<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugani gw’abahinzi babî</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrk 12, 1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Anacirhondêra okubwîra olubaga ogu mugani, erhi: «Muntu muguma anacigwîka olukoma lw’emizâbîbu, alulangîsa abahinzi, agal’icîbalamira nsiku nyinji. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>“Erhi amango gahika, arhuma omwambali emwa bahinzi mpu ahâbwe naye oku mburho y’emizâbîbu. Balya bahinzi bamushûrha banamushugunuka­ kwo maboko mûmu”. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>“Ashub’irhuma owundi mwambali. Naye bamujira buli­go, bamujâcira banamushugunukakwo maboko mûmu”. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>“Ashub’irhuma owa kasharhu. Naye bamuyâgaza banamulibirhakwo”. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>“Nn’olukoma acîj’emurhima, erhi”: “Kurhi najira?” “Narhuma mugala wâni ntonya bwenêne; nkaba yeki bakenga”». <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Balya bahinzi erhi bamutumirhakwo amasù, bajà muligânwè, mpu: «Y’oyu ye wâyîme; rhumunige, rhubè rhwe rhuyish’icîyîmira muli byo». <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Ba­ nacimuhulusa mulya lukoma, bamuniga. «Kurhi olya nn’olukoma ayish’ibajirira? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>“Ayish’iyisha, aherêrekeze balya barhindisi b’olukoma, na lulya lukoma lwâge aluhè abandi”». Erhi bayumva ntyo, bamubwîra, mpu: «Okwo kurhabâga la!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Naye anacibamôlera amasù, erhi: «Kwo kuderha kuci okûla kuyandisirwe: <char style="qt">ibuye abûbasi bagayaguzagya</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lul 117 (118), 22.</char></note>, <char style="qt">lyo lyayishir’ibà kaboko ka nyumpa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>“Ngasi wâhirime kuli eryo ibuye ajonjolekana, naye oyu lyâhonerekwo, lyayish’imuvungunyula”». <verse eid="LUK 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Aho abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano balonza oku bamugwârha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ahâla, Abayahudi bo abo bahinzi babî, bayumvîrhe oku omugani gubayêrekîre. Nabo abahinzi bayish’ihâbwa olukoma ahâli h’Abayahudi, bo bapagani b’igulu lyoshi bahamagirwe okujà omu Ekleziya n’okubà bâna ba Nnâmahanga.</char></note>, ci bayôboha olubaga. Bâli bayumvîrhe oku ogo mugani bo aguderhîre.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuvurhira Sezari</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrk 12, 13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Bamushimbulula, bàrhuma ebyumverhezi. Ebyo byumverhezi byaboneka nka bantu nkana, lyo birhega Yezu omu nderho binamuhâne emwa abakulu b’ecihugo n’emwa omurhegesi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Banacimudôsa, mpu: «Ewe Mwigîriza, rhuyishi oku oderha onayigîriza eby’okunali, orhanalola cikono ca muntu, ci enjira ya Nyamuzinda onayiyigîrize nka oku enali. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Ka kukwânîne rhukavurhira Sezari erhi nanga?» <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Naye bulya àli amanyire obulyâlya bwâbo, anacibà­bwîra, erhi: «Cirhumire mwantega’? <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>Nyêreki olufaranga muvurha. Eyi nshusho eri ya ndi? N’aga mandiko?» Nabo, mpu: «Bya Kaizari» <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Bamushuza, mpu: «Bya Sezari». Naye, erhi: «Ahoo! Ebya Sezari bigaluliragi Sezari, n’ebya Nyamuzinda mubihè Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Ntyo barhacibonaga oku bankamuyagiriza omu nderho zâge embere z’abantu; barhangâla n’ishuzo lyâge, baguguma.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufûka kw’abafîre</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrk 12, 18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Baguma omu Basaduceyi, bo balya bakaderha mpu ntà bufûke bw’abafîre, bamujaho, bamudôsa, mpu: <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>«Ewe Mwigîriza, Mûsa arhurhegesire mpu irhondo mwene wâbo omuntu akafà, nka alesire omukazi arhanasiziri mwâna, mwene wâbo anayinjire olya mukana, ahè mwene wâbo iburha. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Lêro haligi balondana nda. Omurhanzi ayanka omukazi, afà buzira mwâna. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Owa kabiri ayinjira olya mukazi, afà naye buzira mwâna. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Owa kasharhu naye amuyinjira. Boshi oku bànali nda kwo n’okwo, bafà buzira kusiga mwâna. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Buzinda nyamukazi naye anacifà. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Ewe, aha kufûka kw’abafù, ayish’ibà mukà-ndi muli bo? Bulya ayansirwe na bantu nda». <verse eid="LUK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yezu anacibashuza, erhi: «Abâna b’eri igulu bayanka abakazi n’okuyankwa n’abalume. <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>Ci balya bayish’i­kwânana okushangîra obuzîne bwâyisha n’okufûka omu bafù, barhakasheba barhakanashebwa; <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>bulya barhakacifa bundi: kwo banacibêrere nka bamalahika, bâna ba Nyamuzinda, bo bâna bw’obufûke, <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>N’oku abafù bâfûke, Mûsa naye akumanyisize, halya aganîre olw’Ishaka, erhi aderha oku Nyakasane ye Nyamuzinda w’Abrahamu, ye na Nyamuzinda w’Izaki na Nyamuzinda wa Yakôbo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20, 37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-6">Lub 3, 1-6</ref></char>: Ishaka lyagulumira. </char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Arhali Nyamuzinda wa bafù, ci wa bazîne; bulya ye boshi balamira». <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Obwo baguma omu bashamuka b’ihano bashuza, bamubwîra, mpu: «Mushâna Mwigîriza, wadesire bwinjà!» <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Bulya barhàcihalizagya mpu bamudôsa akantu.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristu mugala wa Daudi na Nnawâbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-45">Mat 22, 41-45</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mrk 12, 35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Cirhuma baderha mpu Kristu ali mwene-Daudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>N’obwo Daudi yênene adesire omu citabu c’Ennanga, erhi: <char style="qt">Nyakasane abwîzire Nnâhamwîrhu, erhi: Tamala ekulyo kwâni</char>, <verse eid="LUK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/><char style="qt">kuhika abashombanyi bâwe mbayandaze burhaba aha magulu gâwe</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20, 43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 109:1."><ref loc="PSA 109:110--1">Lul 109(110), 1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 20:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>“Akabà Daudi amudesire mpu ye Nnawâbo, kurhi ankacibaga mugala?”»<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obulyâlya bw’abashamuka b’ihano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:6-7">Mat 23, 6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk 12, 38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Abantu boshi erhi babà badwîrhe bamurhegêra, anacibwîra abaganda bâge, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>«Mucîlange oku bashamuka b’ihano, abasîma okulambagira bayambîrhe ebishûli birîrî n’okulamusibwa oku mmâna n’okubwârhala oku ntebe z’embere omu masinagogi n’ebibwârhalo birhanzi oku cîbo: <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>abà­nyomanya ebirugu by’abakana banaderha amasala malîmalî g’oburhebanyi. Bâbone olubanja lukali kulusha!»<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Entûlo y’omukana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:41-44">Mat 12, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Erhi alambûla amasù, abona abahirhi badwîrhe baheba entûlo zâbo omu mucîmba gw’ecibîkiro, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Abona na mukana muguma wa buligo ahebamwo nkonola ibiri za bujuma. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Anaciderha erhi: «Mmubwîre okuli, oyu mukana mukenyi ahânyire kulusha boshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>Bulya abà boshi bahânyire entûlo oku bisigala omu bunguke bw’ebirugu byâbo, ci yêhe omu bukenyi bwâge ahânyire ebyankamubîsire byoshi anali agwêrhe».<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyigîrizo z’okuyûrha kw’igulu - Enshokolezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-3">Mat 24, 1-3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-4">Mrk 13, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Erhi baguma babà badwîrhe baderha mpu aka-Nyamuzinda kayûbasirwe n’amabuye minjinjà kanabambirwe n’ebindi by’entûlo bya ngulo ndârhi, ababwîra, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>«Ebyo byoshi mudwîrhe mwasinza, ensiku zâciyisha, harhakasigala ibuye oku lindi lirhashâbirwi», <verse eid="LUK 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Bamudôsa, mpu: «Yâgirwa Mwigîriza, mangaci okwo kwâbè na cimanyîso cici camanyîse oku ebyo biri hôfi?»<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebimanyîso birhanzi n’omurhondêro gw’amalibuko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:4-14">Mat 24, 4-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:17-22">Mat 10, 17-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:5-15">Mrk 13, 5-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Naye, erhi: «Mumanye murhârhebwa, bulya banji banayishe oku izîno lyâni, bâderhe, mpu: “Nie (Kristu)”, “mpu na amango gahisire!” “Mumanye murhabakulikiraga”. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>“Amango mwayumve baderha ebîrha n’obugoma, murhayôbohaga; bulya kukwânîne ebyo birhang’iyisha, ci obuzinda erhi burhac’ibà”» <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Okubundi ababwîra, erhi: «Ishanja lyârhêre erindi ishanja, n’o­bwâmi obundi bwâmi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>“Hâbè omusisi munene gw’idaho, n’ecizombo n’ecâhirà byâbè hanji; hayish’ibà n’eby’okuyôbohya, n’emalunga yârhenge ebimanyîso binene”. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>“Ci embere y’okwo kwoshi, barhang’immugwârha, ba­mmulibuze, bammuhâne omu masinagogi n’omu mpamikwa, banammuheke e­mbêre z’abâmi n’abarhegesi izîno lyâni lirhumire”. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>“N’okwo kwayish’ibà buhamîrizi bwinyu”. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>“Mumanye bwinjà oku kurhakwânîni mulonze emurhima ebi mwayish’iderha”: <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>“bulya niene nâmmuhe akanwa n’obumanye abashombanyi binyu barhankahash’ilahira erhi okuhima”. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>“Mwâhânwe ciru n’ababusi binyu, na bene winyu, na baci binyu n’abîra binyu; bayish’iyîrha banji muli mwe”; <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>“mwânashombwe na boshi izîno lyâni lirhuma”. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>“Ci kwônene ntà luviri luguma lw’oku irhwe linyu lwâhere”. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>“Bulêmbêzi bwinyu mwâcizemwo obuzîne bwinyu!”»<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amalibuko ga Yeruzalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-20">Mat 24, 15-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-18">Mrk 13, 14-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>«Ci amango mukabona Yeruzalemu azungulusirwe n’engabo, munanye oku okushâbwa kwâge kukola kuli hôfi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>“Obwo abâli e Yudeya bâyakire oku ntondo; nabo abâli omu lugo bâhuluke; n’abâli omu mahirinji barhaderhaga mpu bacishubira omu lugo”. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>“Bulya ezo nsiku zâbe nsiku za buhane, lyo ngasi kwoshi kwayandikagwa kuyunjula.” <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>“Abakazi bâbè bali nda erhi abâbe badwîrhe bayonsa ezo nsiku, bâsômerwa!”»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 21:23">Amalibuko gâlerhwe n’abapagani n’obujà</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 21:23">(<ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat 24, 21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mrk 13, 19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 21:23">Bulya hâbè malibuko manji omu cihugo n’obukunizi kuli eri ishanja. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Bayish’igera oku bwôji gw’engôrho, bayish’ihêkwa bujà omu mashanja gwoshi, na Yeruzalemu ayish’ilabarhwa n’abapagani, kuhika amango g’abapagani gahike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21, 24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amango g’abapagani, go mango abapagani babà bîshogwa ahâli h’Abayahudi, n’ago mango gayunjula olusiku Abayahudi bâje omu Ekleziya ya Mwâmi Yezu. Lolà <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 11:11-32">Rom 11, 11-32</ref></char>.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugeramwo omusisi kw’igulu n’okuyisha kwa Mwene-omuntu (Mat 24. 29-30; Mrk 13. 24-26)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>«Hayish’ibà ebimanyîso omu izûba n’omu mwêzi n’omu nyenyêzi; n’omu igulu amashanja gayish’ibà burhè ganayish’irhanya bayumva enyanja ekungula. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Abantu bafè n’obwôba omu kulinda ebyayish’ibà omu igulu; bulya eby’oku nkuba byâgeremwo omusisi. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Go mango babone Mwene-omuntu ayish’alembêra omu citù n’obuhashe n’irenge linji. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Amango okwo kwârhondêre okubà, muyinamule amalanga, mugalamire enyanya, kulya kubà obuyôkoke bwinyu buli hôfi».<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amango Mwene-omuntu ayisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mrk 13, 28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Anacibabwîra olwiganyo, erhi: «Mulole olwinganyo oku mulehe n’oku yindi mirhi yoshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Ekarhondêra okuyâna, mwânamanya oku ecanda ciyiruka. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Ninyu kwo na kuguma: amango mwabona okwo kubà, munamanye oku O­bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buli hôfi. <verse eid="LUK 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>Mmubwîre okuli, eri iburha lirhagere n’o­kwo kurhabà kwoshi. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Irunga n’igulu byâgere, ci ebinwa byâni birhakagera.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okubà masù</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>«Mumanye emirhima erhazidoheragwa n’amasîma g’omubiri, endalwè n’okucirhanya oku by’en’igulu, ly’olwo lusiku lurhammuyishira cifudukwè. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Bulya abantu boshi b’igulu lyoshi kwo lwayish’ibayishira nka murhego. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Kuziga mubè masù, munashenge ngasi mango, lyo mukwânana okuyish’ifuma ebyo byâyishe byoshi n’okuyish’iyimanga embere za Mwene-omuntu buzira bwôba».<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ensiku nzinda za Yezu en’igulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:17">Mat 21, 17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:11">Mrk 11, 11</ref>.<ref loc="MRK 11:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:2">Ywn 8, 2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Mûshi, akâg’iyigîriza omu ka-Nyamuzinda; ci erhi kwabaga bijingo, akagend’iyiza obudufu bwoshi oku ntondo ederhwa ntondo y’Emizêti. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>N’erhi kwabaga sêzi mucêracêra, olubaga lwoshi lwakamushimba omu ka-Nyamuzinda mpu bayumve enyigîrizo zâge.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="ms1">VI. Amababale n’okufà kwa Yezu</para>
  <para style="s1">Abashombanyi ba Yezu balagânana okumuyîrha. Yûda alenganya Nnawâbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mrk 14, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">14, 10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:47-53">Ywn 11, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:2">13, 2</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 13:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Olusiku lukulu lw’emigati erhalimwo lwango, luderhwa Basâka, lwâbà hôfi. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano bakâg’ilonza oku bankayirhamwo Yezu, bulya bakâg’iyôboha olubaga. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Lêro Shetani ajamwo Yûda, oderhwa w’e Keriyoti, muguma wa muli balya ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Akanya, aj’idôsa abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abakulu b’abalanzi b’aka-Nyamuzinda ku­erhi ayish’ibahâye. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Nabo basîma bwenêne, bamulaganya okumuhà enfaranga <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Ayêmêra, anakalonza oku amuhâna mahugwe olubaga lurhamanyiri.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amarheganyo ga Basâka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mat 26, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mrk 14, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Olusiku lw’emigati erhalimwo lwango lwahika, go mango gàli garhegesirwe okubâgira Basâka <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Arhuma Petro bo na Yowane, erhi: «Gendi, muj’irhurheganyiza Basâka, rhumulye». <verse eid="LUK 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Nabo, mpu: «Ngahi olonzize rhuj’imurheganyiza?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Hano mujà omu lugo, mwashimânamwo omuntu abarhwîre akabindi k’amîshi. Mumukulikire omu nyumpa ankanajâmwo. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>“Mubwîre nn’enyumpa, mpu”: “Omwigîriza mpu”: “Ngahi eri enyumpa nâlîramwo Basâka haguma n’abaganda bâni?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>“Naye obwo amuyêreka enyumpa y’enyanya ngali enabambirwe; mwo mwarheganyiza”». <verse eid="LUK 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Balîkûla, bashimâna kulya anababwîraga; barheganya Basâka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balya Basâka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:29">Mat 26, 29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:25">Mrk 14, 25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Erhi amango gahika, ajà oku cîbo bo n’Entumwa zâge. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Nal’ingwêrhwe n’omwîfinjo munji gw’okulya oyu Basâka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Basâka </char></note> haguma ninyu ntac’ibabalà. <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>Bulya, mmubwîre, ntakac’imulya kuhika ayunjule omu Bwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda». <verse eid="LUK 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Okubundi ayanka akabehe, avuga omunkwa, erhi: «Yanki, mugabâne mwene na nnene; <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>bulya, mmubwîre, ntakacishub’inywa kuli eyi mburho y’omuzâbîbu kuhika Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda buyishe».<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ajira Obukaristiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat 26, 26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mrk 14, 22-24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Anaciyanka omugati, avuga omunkwa, ogubega, abahà, erhi: «Eci ciri mubiri gwâni gwahânwa mwe murhumire. Mukâjira ntyo kubè kukanke­ngera». <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Nako akabehe kwo n’okwo, erhi bayûs’irya, erhi: «Aka kabehe co ciragâne cihyâhya omu mukò gwâni gwabulagwa mwe murhumire».<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu aderha oku Yûda amulenganya (Mat 26. 20-25; Mrk 14, 17-21)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>«Ci okuboko kw’owandenganya kw’oku haguma nâni oku cîbo. <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Nêci. Mwene-omuntu acikolera nka oku ayàndikîrwe; ci kwônene buhanya bwâge; omuntu Mwene-omuntu anâhânwe naye!» <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Nabo bajânamwo bône na nnene mpu ndi muli bo wankajira ntyo.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndi mukulu omu bâbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:46">Luk 9, 46</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:25-27">Mat 20, 25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-44">Mrk 10, 42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Akadali kabazûkamwo mpu ndi mukulu muli bo. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Abâmi b’amashanja bagarhegeka, nabo abagwêrhe obuhashe kuli bo balonza okuderhwa mpu “Muhanyi w’ebintu”. <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>“Kwônene mwêhe arhali ntyo; ci oli mukulu muli mwe, abè nka ye murhò, n’omurhegesi abè nka ye murhumisi”. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>“Bulya, ndi mukulu kulusha? K’otamîre oku cîbo nîsi erhi olya odwîrhe akolera abâlya? K’arhali otamîre oku cîbo?” “Nie ono ndi ekarhî kinyu nk’odwîrhe akolera abâbo!”»<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluhembo lw’Entumwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:28">Mat 19, 28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>«Ninyu mwe mwabêzire haguma nâni omu malibuko gâni, <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>“mmubîkîre Obwâmi nka kulya Larha abumbîkîre”: <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>“lyo mulya munanywere oku cîbo câni omu Bwâmi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Entumwa zâshangîre Obwâmì bwa Yezu.</char></note> bwâni. Mwâbwârhale oku ntebe z’obwâmi, mutwe olubanja lw’e­ milala ikumi n’ibiri y’Israheli.”»<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu alêba oku Petro amuhakana (Mat 26. 31-35; Mrk 14, 27-31; Ywn 13, 36-38)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>«Simoni, Simoni, alà oku Shetani alonzize okummushengeshera nka mahemba; <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>ci nakulagîre, obuyêmêre bwâwe burhahimagwa. Nâwe hano ogaluka, orhwalihye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Petro ye Mukulu w’Ekleziya yoshi, ye langa obuyêmêre, ye warhwalihya abâbo.</char></note> bene winyu». <verse eid="LUK 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Amubwîra, erhi: «Yâgirwa, ncirheganyize okugenda haguma nâwe omu ngoyi n’ebwa kufà». <verse eid="LUK 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Amushuza, erhi: «Ka nkubwîre Petro, oluhazi lurhâbikè orhampakana kasharhu ene mpu orhanyîshi».<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amango g’entambala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «K’erhi mmurhuma buzira mvumba na buzira nshoho na buzira nkwêrho, hali akantu mwabuzire?» <verse eid="LUK 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Nabo, mpu: «Ntâko». Ababwîra, erhi: «Lêro ngasi ogwêrhe emvumba ayirhôle, n’enshoho kwo na kwo; n’orhayigwêrhi, aguze ecishûli câge, agule engôrho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Entumwa zâshombwe n’abantu boshi: kukwânîne zicilwîre.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Bulya, mmubwîre, kukwânîne aka kanwa k’Amandiko kayunjule kuli nie: Aganjirwe omu bagoma<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22, 37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Iz 53, 12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:32">Luk 23, 32</ref>.</char></note>. Nêci, ebinyêrekîre byaling’iyunjula». <verse eid="LUK 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Bamubwîra, mpu: «Waliha, hano hali ngôrho ibiri». Naye, erhi: «Zirhali nyi ezo!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu oku ntondo y’Emizêti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrk 14, 32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Ahuluka, anacilikûlira oku ntondo y’Emizêti nk’oku anayôrheraga n’abaganda bâge bamukulikira. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Erhi ahika, ababwîra, erhi: «Mushenge mulek’ihimwa n’amashumi». <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Okubundi anacicîyêgûla ikano lyankabandwa irongo; afukama, ashenga, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>«Mâshi Larha, okalonza onyegûlekwo aka kabehe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akabehe, go mababale. </char></note>! Kwône arhali oku nalonza, ci oku walonza we kwo kubage!» <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Malahika arhenga empingu, amubonekera, anamuzibuhya. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Omu kugogomerwa n’oburhè, ashenga, alushîsa, n’entubano yâge yâbà nka ntonyi za mukò zàkâg’irhogera oku idaho. <verse eid="LUK 22:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Erhi ayûs’ishenga, ajà emunda abaganda bâge bâli, abashimâna bali îrò erhi burhè burhuma. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Kurhi mwahunzirage? Zûki, mushenge, mulek’ishumikwa».<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu agwârhwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk 14, 43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Ywn 18, 3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Oku acidwîrhe aderha, engabo yayisha. Olya oderhwa Yûda, muguma wa muli balya ikumi na babiri, erhi abashokolîre. Anaciyêgera Yezu, amunûnugurha. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Yezu amubwîra, erhi: «Yûda we, ka kunûnugurha walenga­nyamwo Mwene-omuntu!» <verse eid="LUK 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Erhi babona okukola kwabà, abàli na Yezu bamubwîra, mpu: «Yâgirwa, ka rhulike engôrho?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Muguma muli bo anaciyirîkira mwambali w’omudâhwa mukulu, amushishimbula okurhwiri kulyo. <verse eid="LUK 22:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Yezu aderha, erhi: «Mulekerage aho». Amuhuma oku kurhwiri, amufumya. <verse eid="LUK 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Okubundi Yezu anacibwîra balya bâli bamuyishîre, bo bajinji b’abadâhwa, n’abakulu b’abalanzi b’aka-Nyamuzinda, n’abagula, erhi: «Ka ndigi cishungu obu munshimbire n’engôrho n’amahiri? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Nobwo ngasi lusiku nali haguma ninyu omu ka-Nyamuzinda, murhanampumagakwo. Ci gakola mango ginyu gano n’obwâmi bw’omwizimya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22, 53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obwâmi bw’omwizimya: bwo bwâmi bwa Shetani.</char></note>».<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro ahakana Nnawâbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26, 69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mrk 14, 66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ywn 18, 15-18</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Erhi bayûs’imugwârha, bamugendana, bamuhêka omu mw’omudâhwa mukulu. Naye Petro amuguma omu cirali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Banacitwâna omuliro omu côgo, bagugorha; Petro naye atamala ekarhî kâbo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Mujà-nyere muguma erhi amubona atamîre anadwîrhe akalûka, amunêka, anaciderha, erhi: «Oyu naye boshi bâli!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Anacihakana, erhi: «Mâshi we- mukazi, ntamwishi». <verse eid="LUK 22:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Erhi kugera hisanzi hitya, owundi amubona, amubwîra, erhi: «Nâwe oli wa muli bo!» Ci Petro ashuza, erhi: «Mâshi yâga, ntali wa muli bo». <verse eid="LUK 22:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Erhi hagera nka nsâ nguma, owundi ahamîriza, erhi: «Nêci kwo binali, oyu naye bo naye bâli; bulya naye ali Mugalileya!» <verse eid="LUK 22:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Naye Petro, erhi: «Mâshi yâga, ntishi okwo odesire». Ho na halya, oku arhaciyûs’iderha, oluhazi lwabika. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Obwo Nyakasane akabagana, alikira Petro kwo amasù. Naye Petro akengêra ecinwa Nyakasane àmubwîraga, erhi: «Ene, embere oluhazi lubike, wampakana kasharhu». <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Anacihuluka, aj’arhonga omulenge.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu àjâcirwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mat 26, 67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mrk 14, 65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Nabo abantu bâli balanzire Yezu bamushekera banamujira buligo. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Bamurhuba obusù, banakamudôsa, mpu: «Lêba ndi okushûsire!» <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Ba­muyôlera bijâci binji.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu embere z’abagula bw’olubaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-66">Mat 26, 57-66</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:1">27, 1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-64">Mrk 14, 53-64</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">15, 1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-14">Ywn 18, 12-14</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Erhi buca, abagula b’olubaga, bo bajinji b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano, bashûbûzanya. Banacimuhêka ekagombe, mpu: <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>«Akabà we Kristu, orhubwîre». Anacibashuza, erhi; «Ciru nankammubwîra, murhanyêmêre, <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>na nkammudôsa, murhanshuze. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Ci kurhenga buno Mwene-omuntu abwârhala oku ntebe yâge ekulyo kw’obuhashe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22, 69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false" link-href="PSA 109:1"><ref loc="PSA 109:110--1">Lul 109(110), 1</ref></char></note> bwa Nyamuzinda!» <verse eid="LUK 22:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Boshi, mpu: «Ewe, k’oligi Mwene-Nyamuzinda!» Abashuza, erhi: «Murhahabiri: ndi ye!» <verse eid="LUK 22:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Nabo, mpu: «Bici rhwacilongeza abahamîrizi? Ka rhwenene rhurhacîyumvîze oku aderha!»<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Boshi oku banali, bayimuka, bamuhêka emwa Bilato.<verse eid="LUK 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu embere za Bilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">Mat 27, 11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:2-5">Mrk 5, 2-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:29-38">Ywn 18, 29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Barhondêra okumulega, mpu: «Rhwashimanyire oyu muntu adwîrhe ago­mêsa olubaga anahanza mpu irhondo barhacivurhiraga Sezari, n’okucîderha mpu ye Kristu Mwâmi». <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Bilato anacimudôsa, erhi: «Ka we mwâmi w’A­bayahudi?» - Naye ashuza, erhi: «Nêci: wakudesire». <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Bilato anacibwîra abajinji b’abadâhwa n’olubaga, erhi: «Ntabwîni cibî cici oyu muntu ajizire». <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Bôhe basimika, mpu: «Agomêsize olubaga omu kuyigîriza omu cihugo coshi c’e Buyahudi, kurhenga e Galileya emunda arhondêreraga kuhik’eno». <verse eid="LUK 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Obwo Bilato erhi ayumva akwo kanwa, adôsa mpu k’oyo muntu ali Mugalileya. <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Erhi amanya bwinjà oku ali muntu w’oburhegesi bwa Herodi, amurhuma emwa Herodi. Obwo erhi naye ali e Yeruzalemu mw’ezo nsiku.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu embere za Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Herodi erhi abona Yezu asîma bwenêne; bulya kurhenga mîra erhi acîfinja okumubona, kulya akâg’iyumva emyanzi yâge, erhi analangalîre okulola oku ajira ecisômerîne. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Amudôkereza bwenêne, ci yêhe arhamuyalulaga. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>O­bwo erhi abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abashamuka b’ihano ho bali; barhàhusagya okumushobeka. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Okubundi Herodi n’omurhwe gwâge bamugayaguza n’okumushekera. Amuyambîsa ecishûli cêru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cishûli cêru: Mwambalo gwa baluzi, mpu lyo acinaguza Yezu. </char></note>, ashub’imugalula emwa Bilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Kurhenga olwo lusiku lonêne, Herodi na Bilato bakoma obwîra, n’obwo burhanzi barhabonanagakwo.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu ashub’ihêkwa emwa Bilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mrk 15, 6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:38-19:16">Ywn 18, 38—19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Bilato anacihamagala abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abarhambo n’olubaga, abà­bwîra, erhi: <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>«Mwandwîrhîre oyu muntu mpu agomêsize olubaga; nâni ene mmudôsa embere zinyu, ntamubwînekwo izâbyo lici muli birya byoshi mwamu­shobekaga. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Ciru na Herodi, bulya arhugalulireye, kuziga ntâco oyu muntu ajizire cikwânîne ayîrhwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Nkolaga namuhana nnamulike». <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>[Lyàli irhegeko okubashwêkulira muntu muguma oku lusiku]. <verse eid="LUK 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Ci olubaga lwoshi lwanaciyâma, mpu: «Oyu afè, orhushwêkulire Baraba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Oyo Baraba àli muntu washwêkeragwa obugoma bwabaga omu cishagala haguma n’obushungu bw’okuniga. <verse eid="LUK 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Omu kulonza okulîka Yezu, Bilato ashub’ibadôsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Bôhe bayâma, mpu: «Omubambe! Omubambe oku musalaba!» <verse eid="LUK 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Ashub’ibabwîra o­bwa kasharhu, erhi: «Ewe, kubî kuci ajizire? Ntâco cikwânîne okufà namu­bwînekwo. Kuziga nkola namuhana ngal’imulîka». <verse eid="LUK 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Ci bôhe bayâma, balushîsa, balonza mpu abambwe oku musalaba, n’okuyâma kwâbo kwajà kwayûshûka. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Bilato obwo atwa mpu bibè nk’oku balonzize. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Anacishwêkûla olya wali oshwêkîrwe obugoma n’obunizi, bulya ye balonzagya; naye Yezu, abahâye mpu bamujire nk’oku basîmire.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enjira y’omusalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-50">Mat 27, 45-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-37">Mrk 15, 33-37</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-30">Ywn 19, 25-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Erhi bakola bamudwîrhe, bagwârha Simoni, muntu w’e Kirena, erhi afuluka; bamusêza mpu abarhule omusalaba bo na Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Ngabo nyinji y’abantu yamukulikira, n’abakazi bajaga bamulakira banabanda endûlù. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yezu anacibahindamukira, ababwîra, erhi: «Mwe bakazi b’e Yeruzalemu, murha­ndakiraga, ci mucîlakire mwenene mulakire n’abâna binyu! <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>“Bulya ensiku zâciyisha, go mango bâderhe, mpu”: “Iragi ly’engumba n’enda zirhaburha n’a­mabêre garhonsagya!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>“Go mango bârhondêre <char style="qt">okubwîra entondo, mpu: Murhufûnike!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>“Bulyâla bakajira ntya oku murhi mubishi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Erhi Yezu ajirirwa ntyo, ye mwêru-kweru (omurhi mubishi gurhagulumira), rhwe babî kurhi rhwayish’ijirirwa (omurhi mûmu, gukajakwo omuliro, kugulumira gugulumira).</char></note>, kurhi byayish’ibà oku murhi mûmu?”» <verse eid="LUK 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Bahêkwa haguma naye bandi bantu babiri babî mpu baj’inigwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abambwa oku musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:35-38">Mat 27, 35-38</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24-28">Mrk 15, 24-28</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-24">Ywn 19, 17-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Erhi bahika ahantu haderhwa Kalvariyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kalvario, erhi Golgota: Ho hantu h’empanga. </char></note>, bamubamba oku musalaba haguma na balya banyankola-maligo, muguma ekulyo, owundi ekumosho. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yezu anaciderha, erhi: «Larha, obafe bwonjo, bulya barhamanyiri eci ba­dwîrhe bajira». Bagabâna emyambalo yâge, bayiyesha cigole.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu agayaguzibwa anajâcirwa oku musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:39-43">Mat 27, 39-43</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29-32">Mrk 15, 29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Olubaga lwayimanga, lwakalolêreza. Ci abarhambo bôhe bakamushekera, mpu: «Acizize abandi, lêro naye acîfumagye yênene akabà ye Kristu, Mwîshogwa wa Nnâmahanga!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Abasirika nabo bamushekera: bamuyegêra, bamuhêreza enkalishi, mpu: <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>«Akabà we mwâmi w’Abayahudi, cîcizagye wênene!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Aha irhwe Iyâge hàli bayandisirwe ezi nderho, mpu: «Oyu ye Mwâmi w’Abayahudi».<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ecishambo cicîyazize cacunguka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Muguma muli birya bishambo byàli bibambirwe oku musalaba amujâcira, erhi: «Kali we Kristu? Cîlîkûzagye, onarhulîkûze nîrhu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Ci owâbo amukankamira, erhi: «Ciru nâwe orhayôbohiri Nnâmahanga, n’obwo oli omu malibuko maguma mwe naye! <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Rhwêhe rhugakwânîne, bijiro bîrhu rhwalyûla; ci yêhe ntà cibî ciguma àjizire». <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Anacibwîra Yezu, erhi: «Yâgirwa, onkengêre hano ohika omu bwâmi bwâwe». <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yezu anacimushuza, erhi: «Okuli, nkubwîre, ene lyonene wâbà haguma nâni omu Paradizo».<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu afà oku musalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-50">Mat 27, 45-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-37">Mrk 15, 33-37</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-30">Ywn 19, 25-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Obwo zàli nka nsâ ndarhu, izûba lyàzima; n’omwizimya gwabwîka igulu lyoshi kuhika amafuluko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu nsâ mwenda, go mafuluko e Bushi bulya ohinga e Bushi arhayaka midi co cirhuma afuluka ako kasanzi.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Omwenda gwàli mumanike aha karhî k’aka-Nyamuzinda gwasharhuka mpande ibiri. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Okubundi Yezu anaciyâma n’izù linene, erhi: «<char style="qt">Larha, mpizire omûka gwâni omu maboko gâwe</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lul 30, 6.</char></note>». N’erhi ayûs’iderha ntyo, arhengamwo omûka.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Erhi Yezu ayûs’ifà</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:51-56">Mat 27, 51-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:38-41">Mrk 15, 38-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:31-37">Ywn 19, 31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Omukulu w’abasirika erhi abona okwo, akuza Nyamuzinda, erhi: «Nêci, kwo binali, oyu muntu ali mwimâna!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Nazo engabo z’abantu zoshi zàl’idesire mpu zilole, erhi zibona oku byamâbà, zashubira eka erhi zanajà zacishûrha ecifuba. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Abîra bâge boshi n’abakazi bamukulikiraga kurhenga e Galileya, bayimanga kuli, bakalâba.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abishwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk 15, 42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ywn 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Hanaciyisha muntu muguma, ye Yozefu. Ali w’omu ihano, muntu nkana na mushinganyanya. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Yêhe arhàli ayêmîre igulu n’ebijiro byâbo. Ali w’e Arimatiya, cishagala c’omu Buyahudi, akâg’ilinda Obwâmi bwa Nyamuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Anacijà emwa Bilato mpu amuhûne omubiri gwa Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Erhi abà amâgumanula, àguboha omu mwenda ànagubisha omu nshinda yali mpumbe omu lwâla. Eyo nshinda erhàli esag’ibishwamwo muntu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Lwàli lusiku lwa Marheganyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23, 54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Marheganyo, go na malâliro ga Basâka.</char></note>, n’olwa-Sabato erhi lukola luli oburhondêra. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Nabo balya bakazi barhengaga e Galileya haguma naye, erhi bakulikira Yozefu, balola enshinda n’oku omubiri gwâge gubishirwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Okubundi banacigaluka, barheganya obu­kù n’omugavu. N’erhi lubà lwa-Sabato, bashîba nka oku birhegesirwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="ms1">VII. Okufûka kwa Yezu n’okurheremera kwâge omu mpingu</para>
  <para style="s1">Abakazi babonekerwa na bamalahika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrk 16, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-2">Ywn 20, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Olusiku lurhanzi lw’omugobe mucêracêra, bajà ebwa cûsho, erhi ba­dwîrhe gulya mugavu bâli barheganyize. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Bashimâna ibuye lihirisirwe lirhanaciri oku nshinda. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Ci erhi bajà omu cûsho, barhashimânagamwo omubiri gwa Nyakasane Yezu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Erhi babà badwîrhe barhanya emurhima kuli okwo, babonekerwa na bantu babiri bayambîrhe emyambalo myêru ikungè. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Banaciyôboha banayûnika obusù oku idaho. (Balya bantu babiri) bababwîra, mpu: «Ewe, ci mwalongeza ozîne omu bafù? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>“Kali arhaciri hano; afûsire. Mukengêre oku ammubwîraga amango aciri e Galileya, mpu”: <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>“Kukwânîne Mwene-omuntu ahânwe omu maboko g’abanya-byâha, abambwe oku musalaba, n’olwa kasharhu afûke”». <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Banacikengêra enderho zâge.<verse eid="LUK 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Entumwa zalahira okuyêmêra</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:10-17">Mat 28, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:10-11">Mrk 16, 10-11</ref>.<ref loc="MRK 16:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:18">Ywn 20, 18</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 20:25">25</ref>.<ref loc="JHN 20:29">29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Erhi barhenga ebwa cûsho, baganîrira balya ikumi na muguma n’abandi boshi ebyo byoshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>(Abo bakazi) bâli Mariya Magadalena, na Yowana, na Mariya, nnina wa Yakôbo. N’abandi bakazi bali haguma nabo, nabo baku­bwîra entumwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Ci ebyo binwa babilola nka by’isirhe, barhanabiyêmêraga.<verse eid="LUK 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro ebwa cûsho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JHN 20:3-10">Ywn 20, 3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Kwônene Petro alîkûla, akanyîriza ebwa cûsho. Ci erhi ayinama mpu ahengûze, arhabonaga erhali myenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emyenda n’ebitambara byàli bibohire omubiri gwa Yezu.</char></note> yônene. Ashub’icîgalukira, aj’azanwa n’ebyo byabîre.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abonekera baganda babiri omu njira y’Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:12-13">Mat 16, 12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Olwo lusiku lwônênè, babiri muli bo bajaga omu lugo lwa lugendo lwa stadi makumi gali ndarhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Stadi makumi gali ndarhu: Lwàli lugendo lwa bilometri nka ikumi na bibiri, zo nsâ ibiri.</char></note> kurhenga e Yeruzalemu. Olwo lugo izîno lyâlwo lwo Emausi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Bakâg’ishambâla emyanzi ya kulya kwoshi kwabîre. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Lêro erhi babà badwîrhe basbambâla n’okudalika, Yezu yenênè abayegera, bagenzikanwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Cikwône amasù gâbo garhabashigimubona. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Myanzi mici eyi mwayisha mwaganîra bugenda-­njira munali burhè?» <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Muguma muli bo, ye Kleofasi, amushuza, erhi: «Lêro wamâbà wêne omu banya-Yeruzalemu w’okurhamanya ebizind’ibà mw’ezi nsiku!» <verse eid="LUK 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Naye, erhi: «Bici ebyo?» Nabo bamushuza, mpu: «Ebiyêrekîre Yezu w’e Nazareti. Ali mulêbi munya-buhashe omu bijiro n’omu nderho embere za Nyamuzinda n’ez’abantu boshi, <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>n’oku abajinji b’abadâhwa n’abakulu bîrhu bamuhânaga mpu atwîrwe okufà, banamubamba oku musalaba. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Rhwàli rhumanyire nti ye wayôkola Israheli; n’ene lwo lusiku lwa kasharhu kurhenga bibîre ntyo! <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Ciru bakazi baguma b’emwîrhu barhufudusize. Ene sêzi mucêra­cêra bâli ebwa cûsho; <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>n’ene babula omubiri gwâge, bayish’iderha mpu babonekîrwe na bamalahika, bababwîra mpu ali mugumagumà. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Baguma muli rhwe bajîre ebwa cûsho, bashimâna okwo balya bakazi baderhaga kwo n’okwo; ci yênene barhamubwîne!» <verse eid="LUK 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Obwo anacibabwîra, erhi: «Abà bahwi­njà n’ab’emirhima mizibu oku kuyêmêra ebyaderhagwa n’Abalêbi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Ewe! ka kurhàli kukwânîne Kristu ababale ntyo lyo ajà omu irenge lyâge?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Arhondêrera kuli Mûsa n’Abalêbi boshi, abahugûla ngasi byoshi byàli bimuyêrekîre omu Mândiko. <verse eid="LUK 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Erhi bayegera lulya lugo bàjagamwo, ajira nka owajà kuli kulusha. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Banamusêza, mpu: «Bera haguma nîrhu, bulya bikola bijingo bwamânayira». Anacijà omu lugo mpu abêre haguma nabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Erhi abà akola ali oku cîbo haguma nabo, anaciyanka omugati, avuga omunkwa, agugisha, n’erhi abà a­magubega, abagabira. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Amasù gâbo gazibûka, bamumanyirira; ci yêhe anacihirigirha omu masù gâbo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Banacijânamwo, mpu: «Ewa! k’emirhima yîrhu erhakag’iyâka ene akarhuganîza omu njira n’okurhuhugûlira Amandiko?» <verse eid="LUK 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ho na halya bagandûla, bashubira e Yeruzalemu, bashimâna balya bànali boshi. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Banacibabwîra, mpu: «Kwo binali! Nyakasane afûsire, anabonekîre Simoni!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Nabo babaganûlira oku byàbâga omu njira n’oku bamumanyaga omu kubega omugati.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu abonekera Entuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Oku banacidwîrhe baganîra ntyo, Yezu apamuka ekarhî kâbo, ababwîra, erhi: «Omurhûla kuli mwe!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Banacijuguma, bageramwo omusisi mpu bamayagânwa n’omuzimu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Cirhumire muyôboha n’e­ntanya zimmuja emurhima? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Loli amaboko n’amagulu gâni, oku nie ono nienênè! Mummamarhe, mulole; bulya omuzimu arhajira mubiri erhi rhuvuha nk’oku mubwîne mbigwêrhe». <verse eid="LUK 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Erhi abà adwîrhe aderha ntyo, abayêreka amaboko n’amagulu gâge. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Balahira kwayêmêra erhi mwîshingo gurhuma, banakazânwa. Anacibabwîra, erhi: «Ka ntà cirîbwa mugwêrhe hano?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Ba­ muhereza ecihimbi c’enfî nyôce. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Aciyanka, acirya banabona.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Enyigîrizo nzinda oku Ntumwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:18-20">Mat 28, 18-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15-16">Mrk 16, 15-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:7-8">Ebj 1, 7-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Okubundi anacibabwîra, erhi: «Byo nakâg’immubwîra ebi erhi nciri haguma ninyu: oku kuhika ebinayandikiragwa omu citabu ca Mûsa n’omu Balêbi n’omu Nnanga biyunjule». <verse eid="LUK 24:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Obwo abalangaza obukengêre lyo bayumva Amandiko. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Ababwîra, erhi: «Kristu àli ayandikîrwe okubabala n’okufûka omu bafù olusiku lwa kasharhu; <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>“n’oku amashanja goshi, kurhondêrera e Yeruzalemu, gâyigîrizibwa obucîyunjuze bw’okubabalirwa ebyâha oku Izîno lyâge”. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>“Ninyu mwe muli bahamîrizi b’okwo”. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>“Nkolaga nâni nammurhumira olya walaganyibagwa na Larha”. “Mwêhe mubêre muli cino cishagala kuhika mubwîkwe n’obuzibu bw’enyanya!”»<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yezu arheremera empingu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mrk 16, 19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-12">Ebj 1, 9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Anacibahulukana, abahêka olunda lw’e Betaniya; alambûla amaboko, abagisha. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Oku adwîrhe abagisha, anacicîyêgûla kuli bo, amânamânwa omu malunga. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Nabo erhi babà bamâharâmya, bashubira e Yeruzalemu bashagalusire bwenêne. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Barhàrhengaga omu ka-Nyamuzinda bakuza Nnâmahanga n’okumuvuga omunkwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
